  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#classifier">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Classifier</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational algorithm that assigns a category to a feature vector based on its statistical distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning algorithm that assigns a category label to an input data sample.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning algorithm that assigns a category or label to an input data point based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model designed to assign a label to an input based on its features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model designed to assign input data to specific discrete categories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model that assigns a categorical label to a given input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model that assigns a category to a given input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model that assigns a discrete label to a given input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model that maps input data to specific discrete categories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model that predicts categorical outcomes, such as travel mode switching behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning model trained to predict the occurrence of specific patterns in sequential physiological data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive model that assigns a discrete category label to a given input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive model used to categorize data into specific classes, such as predicting the presence of a medical condition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a categorical label to an input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a category label to a given input based on training data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a category to a given input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a data instance to one of several predefined categories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a discrete category label to an input based on extracted features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that assigns a discrete label to an input based on identified patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning algorithm that predicts future stock price movements based on features extracted from limit order book data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that assigns a categorical label to an input based on learned patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that assigns a discrete category label to an input based on its observed characteristics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that assigns a discrete category label to an input based on its observed features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that maps input data to specific categories, evaluated here across various binary datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm used to categorize human brain activity signals into specific stimulus classes.</rdfs:comment>
