    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that forecasts the likelihood of an edge existing between two nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that forecasts the likelihood of future connections between nodes based on historical network dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that forecasts the likely formation of future connections between nodes in a network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that infers the existence of missing or future edges between nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the existence of edges between nodes based on network topology and local structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a connection existing between two nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a connection forming between two nodes in a network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a connection forming between two nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future connection between two nodes based on existing network structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future connection between two nodes based on their current network representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future connection between two nodes in a network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future connection between two nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future connection forming between two nodes in a network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a future edge forming between two nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph analysis task that predicts the likelihood of a missing edge existing between two nodes in a network.</rdfs:comment>
