    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A subfield of transfer learning that aligns probability distributions between a source training set and a different target application setting.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A subfield of transfer learning that aligns the distributions of source and target data to improve model performance.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A subfield of transfer learning that aligns the distributions of source and target domains in a latent space.</skos:definition>
