    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique for reducing annotation costs in a target domain by leveraging labeled data from a related source domain.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique for transferring a model learned from a source distribution to a target distribution that differs slightly.</skos:definition>
