    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[agents] agent</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computational framework that drives an agent to explore its environment based on internal rewards rather than external goals.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computational framework that encourages an agent to seek novel experiences based on internal rewards like prediction error reduction.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computational mechanism that drives an agent to explore its environment based on internal curiosity or novelty.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning mechanism that drives an agent to explore and acquire a diverse repertoire of behaviors without external rewards.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning mechanism that encourages an agent to explore its environment based on internal signals like surprise or learning progress.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning mechanism where an agent is driven by internal rewards, such as curiosity or novelty, to explore its environment.</skos:definition>
