  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#variational_inference">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Variational Inference</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian approximation method that optimizes a predictive distribution to control epistemic uncertainty and generalization performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian approximation method that optimizes a tractable posterior to approximate an intractable integral.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian approximation method that transforms a posterior distribution problem into a deterministic optimization task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian approximation method that transforms the problem of posterior inference into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates an intractable posterior distribution by minimizing a divergence measure between it and a simpler variational distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates an intractable posterior distribution by minimizing the KL divergence to a simpler variational distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates an intractable posterior distribution by minimizing the divergence between it and a simpler parameterized distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates an intractable posterior distribution with a simpler, parameterized distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates complex posterior distributions to efficiently learn hyperparameters and model parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian method that approximates complex posterior distributions to enable efficient model updating in data streams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian technique used to approximate intractable posterior distributions in deep neural networks to evaluate model uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that approximates complex posterior distributions in graphical models using simplified functional forms.</rdfs:comment>
