  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#convolutional_autoencoder">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Convolutional Autoencoder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model used to learn complex-valued invariant representations from sequential image patches for visual tracking.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that compresses input images into a latent representation and reconstructs them to solve inverse problems like depth mapping.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to compress and reconstruct data for dimensionality reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to compress data into a latent representation and then reconstruct it.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to compress input data into a latent representation and then reconstruct it to identify anomalies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to compress input data into a latent representation and then reconstruct it.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn a compressed representation of input data for anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn a compressed representation of input data for unsupervised tasks like anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn a compressed representation of input images for reconstruction or anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn a compressed representation of spatial data for reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn a compressed, hierarchical representation of input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn an unsupervised representation of image data for tasks like defect segmentation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn compressed feature representations for unsupervised tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn compressed representations for anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn compressed representations for tasks such as image classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn compressed representations of image data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to learn compressed representations of input data for unsupervised tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses convolutional layers to perform nonlinear dimension reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses encoders and decoders to generate intermediate video frames.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture used to create reduced-order models for large-scale dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
