  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#relu_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Relu Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep neural network that utilizes the rectified linear unit activation function to process data through successive layers of weight matrices and bias vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep neural network utilizing rectified linear units to approximate compositions of dimensionality-reducing feature maps.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that utilizes the rectified linear unit as its activation function to represent complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that employs the rectified linear unit as its activation function to introduce non-linearity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that uses rectified linear unit activation functions to map inputs to outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that utilizes the rectified linear unit as its activation function to create piecewise affine functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that utilizes the rectified linear unit as its activation function to introduce non-linearity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network using rectified linear unit activation functions to approximate continuous functions with a limited number of parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of artificial neural network that uses the rectified linear unit as its activation function to approximate functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of feed-forward neural network that uses rectified linear units as activation functions to approximate complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network that employs rectified linear unit activation functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network that uses rectified linear unit activation functions to approximate univariate functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network that uses rectified linear units as activation functions to control model complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network that uses the rectified linear unit as its activation function to compute piecewise linear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network using rectified linear unit activation functions whose generalization error is bounded by the total variation of path weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data through successive layers of weight matrices and bias vectors] data through successive layers of weight matrices and bias vectors</rdfs:comment>
