    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of setting the initial values of neural network parameters to influence the final trained distribution and quantization behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of setting the starting values for the parameters of a neural network before training begins.</rdfs:comment>
