    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical framework that identifies the effect of a specific intervention on a particular outcome.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical framework that identifies the effect of one variable on another by managing confounding factors.</rdfs:comment>
