    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A statistical framework that estimates the effect of an intervention by accounting for confounding variables in data.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A statistical framework that estimates the hidden confounders and direct effects of multi-aspect textual reviews on business revenue.</skos:definition>
