    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method that seeks correlated components between multiple views of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used for feature selection by adopting the sum of squared canonical correlation coefficients as a ranking criterion.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used for multimodal data analysis to find linear or non-linear projections that maximize correlation between views.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to explore the linear relationship between two sets of variables by finding maximally correlated vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to find linear combinations of two sets of variables that have maximum correlation with each other.</rdfs:comment>
