  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#long_short_term_memory">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Long Short-Term Memory</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to forecast time series data by overcoming the limitations of traditional autoregressive models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture used for predicting individual insurance claim payments and recoveries over discrete time periods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model designed for time-series data that is used here for stream-flow forecasting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model used to forecast the growth of pandemic cases by learning temporal correlations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A gated recurrent neural network architecture designed to mitigate the vanishing gradient problem in sequence modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent architecture used to track user movement for calibrating beam directions in wireless communications.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent network model used for the joint prediction of musical notes, expressive timing, and dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network algorithm used for predicting continuous time series variables by converting data into supervised learning sequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of capturing hierarchical compositional structures in sequential language data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of capturing long-range temporal dependencies in sequence data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of capturing long-term dependencies in nonlinear time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of capturing temporal dependencies for channel state information prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies by using a gating mechanism to regulate information flow.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies for classifying disease stages from fMRI data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies for predicting future stock prices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies for predictive computations in generator models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies for tasks such as single-channel noise reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in irregularly sampled sequential data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in sequential data through a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in sequential data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in sequential time series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in time series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in time-series data for predictive modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies in time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies through a gated mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies through a gated memory mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies through a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies through gated cells.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies to model quantum physics experiments.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies using a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies using gated memory cells.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies using gating mechanisms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies via a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies via gating mechanisms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies, used here for forecasting exchange rates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies, used here to generate deceptive social media content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies, used here to predict blood flow characteristics in artery models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture capable of learning long-term dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed for sequence modeling that can capture long-term dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
