    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to capture sequential information for network intrusion detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to capture temporal dependencies in sequential data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to capture temporal patterns for air quality forecasting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to capture temporal patterns in sequential data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to extract features from complex temporal series for tasks like fault detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to forecast chaotic time series and predict extreme events in nonlinear dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to forecast time series data such as energy demand.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to handle long-range correlations in sequential data such as natural language.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to handle long-term dependencies and missing data in longitudinal sequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to identify error bits in polar code decoding sequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to learn long-term dependencies and summarize local graph neighborhoods for node prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture designed to learn long-term dependencies by using a gating mechanism to regulate information flow.</rdfs:comment>
