    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that trains multiple autonomous entities to coordinate actions in shared environments.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple agents learn to optimize their behavior through interactions within a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple autonomous agents learn optimal policies through interaction with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple autonomous agents learn to coordinate their actions to achieve goals in a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple autonomous agents learn to coordinate their actions to maximize a collective or individual reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple autonomous agents learn to make decisions in shared complex environments.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework where multiple autonomous agents learn to coordinate their actions to optimize a shared or individual goal.</rdfs:comment>
