    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Genetic Programming</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that automatically evolves machine learning pipelines to optimize performance for specific datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that evolves computer programs to optimize a specific objective function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational technique that evolves computer programs by simulating the process of natural selection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework used to generate parameterized dynamical systems models from data to predict health states over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-heuristic optimization technique that evolves programs or pipelines to solve specific tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A search heuristic that evolves mathematical expressions to find optimal models for a given task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A search technique that evolves computer programs to find optimal functional approximations of circuits.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in evolutionary computation where computer programs are evolved to solve a specific task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that automatically generates and optimizes computer programs or mathematical expressions to solve a specific task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that automatically generates or optimizes computer programs by simulating natural selection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that evolves computer programs to find optimal solutions, often accelerated through data vectorization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that evolves computer programs to solve a specific task, often used for symbolic regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that evolves computer programs to solve specific tasks or fit data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm that optimizes computer programs by mimicking the process of natural selection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm used to automatically discover optimal term-weighting schemes for text classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary computation method that automatically evolves computer programs to solve a specific task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary computation method that automatically evolves machine learning pipelines without manual hyperparameter tuning.</rdfs:comment>
