    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling task that uses historical sequential data to predict future values.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling technique that uses historical data points to forecast future values in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive process that utilizes historical data and nonlinear trends to estimate future energy production.</rdfs:comment>
