    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task that aims to estimate future values of a variable based on historical sequential data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task that disentangles global and local temporal patterns to project future values of a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task that estimates future patient volumes in emergency departments to optimize resource allocation.</rdfs:comment>
