    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Active Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian framework that iteratively selects the most informative data points for annotation to minimize labeling effort.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that efficiently utilizes domain experts' knowledge to discover product types for constructing an e-commerce ontology.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that identifies a minimal sub-sampled dataset of the most uncertain samples to reduce deep learning training costs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A human-in-the-loop framework where a model selects the most informative samples for an expert to label.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A label-efficient training strategy that queries the most informative samples to be labeled by an oracle to reduce the amount of required training data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that allows a model to selectively query the most informative training examples to reduce dataset size.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that selectively queries a teacher or oracle for labels of the most informative data points.</rdfs:comment>
