    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Expectation-Maximization Algorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic iterative method that finds maximum likelihood estimates of parameters in models with latent variables.</rdfs:comment>
