    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Conditional Generative Adversarial Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep generative model that produces synthetic data conditioned on specific input parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model used to train associations between images of objects and their partially occluded counterparts for reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework consisting of a generator and a discriminator that produces synthetic data conditioned on specific input information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework consisting of two competing networks that generates synthetic data based on specific class labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework consisting of two neural networks that compete to generate realistic data conditioned on specific auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework consisting of two neural networks that generate synthetic data conditioned on specific input labels or images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for generating synthetic data conditioned on specific labels or auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for image synthesis that uses auxiliary information to guide the generation process toward specific labels or masks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that creates dense 3D point clouds by learning to mimic a data distribution in an unsupervised manner.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates high-resolution data conditioned on low-resolution inputs via a competition between a generator and a discriminator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates masks conditioned on input images for the purpose of automatic polyp segmentation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates realistic static images by inpainting occluded backgrounds based on a binary mask.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic data based on specific auxiliary information to control the output's characteristics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic data conditioned on specific input labels or images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic data conditioned on specific labels or auxiliary information using a generator and a discriminator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic data samples conditioned on specific labels or proportions to expand a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic images based on specific input guidance and target constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that uses a generator and a discriminator to produce realistic image captions conditioned on visual input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that incorporates auxiliary information to direct the data generation process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that incorporates auxiliary information to guide the production of specific types of synthetic data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that learns to produce realistic data samples conditioned on specific input information for tasks like denoising.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces diverse text descriptions for video content by conditioning the generation process on latent variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces high-resolution data samples conditioned on specific input auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces or identifies data based on specific auxiliary information to detect image forgeries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces samples conditioned on specific auxiliary information or labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces synthetic data based on a specific auxiliary input or class label.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces synthetic data based on specific input labels or constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces synthetic data conditioned on specific attribute information using a generator and a discriminator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that produces synthetic data conditioned on specific auxiliary information such as class labels.</rdfs:comment>
