  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deep_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deep Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A branch of machine learning that uses multiple processing layers to model high-level abstractions in data through non-linear transformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of unsupervised feature learning models used for the analysis and forecasting of time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of advanced machine learning techniques using multi-layered neural networks for analytics in the Internet of Things domain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms that enable high-efficiency and scale in information systems research through multi-layered neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of artificial neural networks that automatically engineer features and capture complex data distributions from large datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms based on artificial neural networks used for autonomous algae monitoring.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms based on artificial neural networks used here to classify seismic waveforms into earthquake event types.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers for feature extraction and classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used for analyzing large-scale imaging datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used to extract high-level features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that use multi-layered neural networks to estimate forest carbon from imagery.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that use multi-layered neural networks to model complex patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that use multiple layers of neural networks to autonomously discover patterns from large datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that use multiple layers of neural networks to extract high-level features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that use multiple layers of neural networks to extract high-level features from raw input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses multi-layered networks to extract features from image data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses multi-layered networks to localize and count parasites in blood smear images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses multi-layered neural networks to extract high-level features from sparse and noisy data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses multi-layered neural networks to extract latent information from sequential trading data for outcome prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses multi-layered neural networks to learn end-to-end inverse responses from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that uses neural networks to align peaks in complex chromatography-mass spectrometry data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that utilize multiple layers of artificial neural networks to learn hierarchical representations of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms that utilize multiple layers of neural networks to extract high-level features from raw signal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms used for optimizing data caching in edge networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms used for the early detection of COVID-19 from medical imaging and cough analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms used here to extract nonverbal communication features from video images for financial market analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms used to detect and predict illegal insider trading from heterogeneous data sources.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms using multi-layered neural networks to automatically detect lesions in medical imaging.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms using multi-layered neural networks to extract high-level features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms using multi-layered neural networks to learn representations from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning algorithms using multi-layered neural networks to reconstruct images and quantify particle volatility from holograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning architectures that utilize multiple layers of neural networks to model complex patterns in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers for modeling complex data patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning characterized by multiple layers of nonlinear processing used for automatic feature extraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods based on artificial neural networks that can extract high-level features from complex data probes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers to extract high-level features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used for automated coding of death certificates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used for automatic sleep stage classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used here for state classification and regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods that use multi-layered neural networks to extract high-level features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning methods using multi-layered neural networks to automatically extract features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
