    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning models based on artificial neural networks used to forecast the increase in infected cases for pandemics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning models based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers of representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning techniques based on artificial neural networks that can be used to model complex cognitive functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning techniques used for the automatic delineation of medical imaging areas.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning techniques used for the automatic diagnosis of COVID-19 from medical imaging modalities like CT and X-ray.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning techniques using multi-layered neural networks to approximate complex functions for tasks like derivative valuation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning techniques using multi-layered neural networks to segment and classify medical brain images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of multilayer artificial neural networks capable of statistical pattern recognition and scaling with large amounts of information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that employs multilayered neural networks to automatically detect specific patterns in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that solves fixed point problems using neural networks to approximate solutions for semi-linear partial differential equations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that uses multi-layered artificial neural networks to model complex patterns in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that uses multi-layered neural networks to filter and process complex signal data.</rdfs:comment>
