    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework where multiple autonomous agents learn to coordinate actions and communicate to achieve a common goal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework where multiple agents learn to optimize a shared or independent reward function through interaction with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework where multiple autonomous agents learn optimal policies through interaction with a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A distributed optimization framework where multiple agents interact with an environment to maximize spectral efficiency in wireless networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn joint policies through interaction and communication to optimize a global objective.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn optimal policies through interaction with a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn optimal policies through interaction within a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn optimal strategies through interaction to optimize computation offloading in edge computing.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn to coordinate their actions through deep neural networks to achieve a common goal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous agents learn to optimize their behavior through interaction with a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple autonomous learners use neural networks to optimize a shared or competitive objective in a dynamic environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple intelligent agents learn collaborative policies to optimize shared resources in a simulation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple intelligent agents learn optimal behaviors through interaction with a shared environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where multiple intelligent agents learn to cooperate or compete in a shared environment using deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
