    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework where multiple autonomous agents learn to interact and coordinate their behaviors to achieve a goal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where multiple agents interact in a shared environment to learn a group control policy using local rewards.</rdfs:comment>
