  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#quantum_machine_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Quantum Machine Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that integrates quantum computing primitives to solve supervised learning problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that variationally optimizes parameterized quantum circuits to make predictions on data sets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational paradigm that leverages quantum algorithms to accelerate kernel-based classification and reduce the number of required random features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational paradigm that leverages quantum mechanical formalisms to perform predictive tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that applies quantum computing principles to accelerate supervised learning tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that exploits high dimensional Hilbert space to learn richer representations from limited data for complex tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that integrates quantum computing algorithms into machine learning to achieve computational speedups.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that integrates quantum computing capabilities with machine learning algorithms to solve complex computational tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that integrates quantum computing techniques into machine learning algorithms to potentially accelerate computation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that integrates quantum devices to perform computational subroutines within supervised learning algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that leverages quantum computing principles to perform learning tasks on quantum states and operations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study that uses quantum computing processes to learn and generate complex data patterns such as time series.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that applies quantum computing techniques to enhance the simulation of quantum dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum algorithms with machine learning architectures to achieve exponential speedups in training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing algorithms to accelerate the training and evaluation of machine learning models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing algorithms with machine learning to optimize variational circuits.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing algorithms with machine learning to process data via quantum states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing capabilities to solve supervised learning problems more efficiently.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing capabilities with learning algorithms to achieve computational speed-ups over classical models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing principles to enhance the efficiency and accuracy of machine learning algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing principles to perform machine learning tasks more efficiently than classical computers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing techniques into the development and execution of machine learning algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing techniques with machine learning algorithms to achieve improvements in learning efficiency and performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing techniques with machine learning algorithms to improve computational efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing techniques with machine learning algorithms to process information in quantum states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing techniques with machine learning to analyze quantum noise fingerprints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing with classical machine learning to enhance computational efficiency or control.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing with learning algorithms to improve computational efficiency or model quality.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing with machine learning to achieve computational speedups for data analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing with machine learning to achieve exponential speedups in data processing and pattern recognition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field that integrates quantum computing with machine learning to achieve exponential speedups in predicting physical experiment outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
