    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that involves identifying and locating specific items within a digital image or signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that involves identifying specific items within an image, evaluated here against human performance under distortions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task used here to automate the annotation of volumes of interest in 3D gaze analysis.</rdfs:comment>
