    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data preprocessing technique that identifies the most informative attributes of a dataset without using target labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data preprocessing technique that identifies the most relevant input variables without utilizing target labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data preprocessing technique that reduces feature dimensionality without using annotated labels by leveraging the geometric structure of data.</rdfs:comment>
