    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where an agent learns a target policy while following a different behavior policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where an agent optimizes a policy using data generated by a different behavior policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where the agent learns a target policy using data generated by a different behavior policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where the agent learns a value function or policy from data generated by a different policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where the agent optimizes a target policy using data generated by a different behavior policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that learns an optimal policy using data generated by a different policy.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An agent learning technique that optimizes a target policy using experience generated by a different behavior policy.</skos:definition>
