    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning task that partitions nodes into clusters to maximize agreements and minimize disagreements with given edge labels.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning task that partitions nodes into clusters to minimize the disagreement with specified co-clustering preferences.</skos:definition>
