    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex numerical simulator used to accelerate parameter estimation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex optimization problem used to reduce training and inference time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical model used to accelerate simulations or predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical model used to predict output distributions and reduce resource demands.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical or dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical or mathematical system used to speed up simulations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical process used to predict outcomes based on input features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical simulation or expensive numerical model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical simulation or high-fidelity solver.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical simulation used to accelerate predictions and data assimilation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical simulation, typically implemented as a neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient approximation of a complex physical simulation.</rdfs:comment>
