  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#multiarmedbandit_task">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Multiarmedbandit Task</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision framework that balances exploration and exploitation to maximize cumulative rewards from multiple options.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision framework that balances exploration and exploitation to maximize rewards from multiple options.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem framework that seeks to maximize cumulative reward by balancing exploration and exploitation of multiple available options.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving a choice between multiple options with unknown reward distributions to minimize cumulative regret.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving a set of options with unknown reward distributions where the goal is to identify the most optimal choices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving a trade-off between exploring new options and exploiting the best known option to maximize reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving a trade-off between exploring new options and exploiting the best-known option to minimize regret.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving the choice between several options with unknown reward distributions to maximize cumulative gain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving the optimization of rewards from multiple competing options with unknown payoff distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem involving the selection of actions with covariates where rewards may be observed with a delay.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem that balances exploration and exploitation to minimize cumulative reward loss.</rdfs:comment>
