    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An online learning problem where an agent must choose from multiple options to maximize cumulative rewards.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An online statistical learning paradigm used for adaptive and sequential experiment design.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimization framework used to balance exploration and exploitation in decision-making over time.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimization problem where an agent must choose between multiple options to maximize reward under uncertainty.</skos:definition>
