  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deep_neural_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deep Neural Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of artificial neural networks with multiple layers used for complex vision and speech applications.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning models that utilize multiple layers of neurons to recognize complex patterns in biomedical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A complex model architecture used for COVID-19 detection that requires systematic analysis for reliability and explainability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture capable of learning directly from sequences of geospatial coordinates for classification tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture composed of multiple layers of neurons used here to automate the interpretation of coronary angiograms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple hidden layers used to approximate complex nonlinear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers of neurons capable of approximating high-dimensional functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers of neurons that is often used for complex pattern recognition tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers of neurons used to approximate complex functions through gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers of neurons used to model complex non-linear relationships in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers of nodes that can generate functions with variations concentrated near specific input boundaries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of multiple layers used to process and quantify complex temporal signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that approximates complex functions of dynamical systems in high dimensions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that approximates non-linear functions to map desired spectra to nanostructure geometries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that employs multiple layers of neurons to approximate high-dimensional functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that employs multiple layers of neurons to perform image denoising.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that incorporates history terms to recover reduced systems from dynamical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that is evaluated for its resilience to hardware-induced faults during the training phase.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that maps raw waveform inputs to sound class labels using multiple hidden layers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that uses multiple layers of neurons to interpret and predict complex patterns in financial data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that uses multiple layers of nonlinear transformations to learn representations from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that utilizes multiple layers of nonlinear transformations to model complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture used for the joint learning of reaction kinetics and look-up models in turbulent combustion systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture used to classify food waste from images captured by cameras on waste bins.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture used to predict amino acid side chain conformation without relying on physics-based assumptions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture using multiple layers of non-linear processing to perform automated image segmentation tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple hidden layers used to approximate complex forward and inverse functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple hidden layers used to approximate complex functions from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple hidden layers used to approximate complex nonlinear functions for prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple hidden layers used to learn complex patterns from high-dimensional data like audio spectra.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple hidden layers used to learn complex representations from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture with multiple layers used as a surrogate for iterative sparse estimation algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model composed of multiple layers used to predict clinical outcomes from high-dimensional medical imaging.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model comprising an encoder, propagator, and decoder used to predict the future evolution of spatial patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of joint convolutional and recurrent blocks used for estimating valence and arousal from facial expressions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of multiple hidden layers between the input and output layers to approximate complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of multiple hidden layers between the input and output layers to learn complex patterns.</rdfs:comment>
