    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A framework for making a sequence of decisions where the objective function is revealed incrementally over time.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where data arrives sequentially and the model is updated incrementally to minimize regret.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework for making a sequence of decisions in real-time where the cost of each decision is revealed only after it is made.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework for making a sequence of decisions in real-time where the objective function is revealed incrementally.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework for making a sequence of decisions in real-time without full knowledge of future data.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework for making a sequence of decisions over time where the objective function is revealed only after each action is taken.</skos:definition>
