    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[inference, inference and prediction, bayesian inference] inference</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[posterior distributions] posterior distribution</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[formally express probabilistic models and automate the matching of models with inference methods, expressing and executing probabilistic models through compilation to generative languages] specifying probabilistic models and performing inference on them</rdfs:comment>
