  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#self_training_learning_strategy">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Self Training Learning Strategy</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning algorithm that iteratively uses its own high-confidence predictions to label unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning algorithm that iteratively uses pseudolabels to convert weak learners into strong learners.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning algorithm that uses its own high-confidence predictions to augment the labeled training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that iteratively adds confident pseudo-labels to the training set to improve model performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that iteratively generates pseudo-labels for unlabeled data based on the current model hypothesis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that iteratively uses a model to label unlabeled data for retraining.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that iteratively uses a teacher model to generate pseudo-labels for a student model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that uses a model to generate pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to augment the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach that uses a model's own high-confidence predictions to label unlabeled data for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach where a model generates pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to expand its own training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach where a model generates pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to iteratively refine its own performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach where a model generates pseudo-labels to iteratively train itself.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning approach where a model generates pseudolabels for unlabeled data to iteratively improve its own performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning method that uses pseudo-labels to augment the training set with unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning method that uses the model's own predictions to label additional unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that iteratively generates pseudo labels for unlabeled data to expand the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that iteratively uses a model's own high-confidence predictions as pseudo-labels for unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses a model to generate pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to iteratively improve its own performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses a model's own predictions to create pseudolabels for unlabeled data to improve the model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses the model's own high-confidence predictions as labels for unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique where a model generates pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to iteratively improve its own performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique where a model is iteratively tuned using its own predicted labels as ground truth.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique where a model is trained on its own high-confidence predictions for unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique where a model is used to generate pseudo-labels for unlabeled data, which are then used for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative learning process that uses a model to generate pseudo-labels for unlabeled data to expand the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative learning process where a model uses its own high-confidence predictions as labels for unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
