    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Transfer Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model developed for one task is reused as the starting point for a second task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning method where knowledge gained from one task is applied to a different but related task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning strategy that applies knowledge acquired from a source domain to improve performance in a different but related target domain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning strategy where a model developed for one task is reused as the starting point for a second task.</rdfs:comment>
