  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deeplearningmodel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deeplearningmodel</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that learns a mapping from single narrow-aperture images to realistic shallow focus effects.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture that predicts motion sequences from wearable sensor data to quantify rehabilitation activities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that transforms visual signals into an optimized modality for enhanced bitstream representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers that learns hierarchical representations of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational system that learns optimal hardware resource configurations to maximize energy efficiency based on application behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational system that utilizes neural networks to automate the diagnosis of medical conditions from image data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered artificial neural network that automatically learns complex representations from high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered artificial neural network used to predict crop yields based on remote sensing and weather data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered artificial neural network used to predict optimal parameters for soundscape augmentation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered artificial neural network used to simulate complex biological processes such as brain plasticity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural network used for risk and outcome prediction in clinical scenarios based on real-world patient adherence data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural network used for the automatic classification of images, such as banknotes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multilayer artificial neural network capable of learning hierarchical representations of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of learning complex patterns from large, multi-source datasets for predictive tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns latent representations of histone modification to predict gene expression levels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network with multiple hidden layers used to automatically learn hierarchical representations of data for tasks like image interpretation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network with multiple hidden layers used to identify complex patterns in temporal health data for predictive analytics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[predict crop yields based on remote sensing and weather data] predict crop yields based on remote sensing and weather data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[predict optimal parameters for soundscape augmentation] predict optimal parameters for soundscape augmentation</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[simulate complex biological processes such as brain plasticity] simulate complex biological processes such as brain plasticity</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[risk and outcome prediction in clinical scenarios based on real-world patient adherence data] risk and outcome prediction in clinical scenarios based on real-world patient adherence data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[the automatic classification of images] automated image classification</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[automatically learn hierarchical representations of data for tasks like image interpretation] automatically learn hierarchical representations of data for tasks like image interpretation</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[identify complex patterns in temporal health data for predictive analytics] identify complex patterns in temporal health data for predictive analytics</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a mapping from single narrow-aperture images to realistic shallow focus effects] mapping from single narrow-aperture images to realistic shallow focus effects</rdfs:comment>
