  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#weak_supervision">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Weak Supervision</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data labeling approach that uses predefined rule-based labeling functions to automatically annotate samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that uses noisy labeling functions, such as prompts from large language models, to train a classifier when labeled data is scarce.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A labeling paradigm that uses domain-knowledge heuristics to automatically generate noisy annotations for training data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A labeling strategy that uses noisy or heuristic sources to generate training data instead of expensive manual annotation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A labeling strategy that uses noisy sources or heuristics to generate training data for a model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that generates large amounts of labeled data using noisy, high-level heuristics instead of manual annotation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that leverages noisy or imprecise labels to train models when high-quality labeled data is scarce.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses multiple human-designed heuristics to infer probabilistic label estimates without ground truth labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labeling sources to train models instead of relying on ground truth annotations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels created by heuristics to train a model when high-quality labels are scarce.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels generated by heuristics or multiple sources to train a model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels generated by heuristics or other models to train a classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels generated by heuristics or other sources to train a model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels to train a model when high-quality ground truth is unavailable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels to train a model when high-quality labeled data is scarce.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses noisy or imprecise labels to train a model when high-quality labels are scarce.</rdfs:comment>
