  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#experience_replay">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Experience Replay</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning strategy that stores and re-trains on past samples to prevent catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning strategy where a subset of past data is stored and replayed alongside new data to mitigate catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning technique that stores and reviews previous experiences to balance stability and plasticity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning technique that stores past experiences in a buffer to be re-sampled during training to prevent catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning strategy that stores a subset of past data to be re-played alongside new information to mitigate catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism in reinforcement learning that stores past experiences in a buffer to reduce forgetting and improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism in sequential learning that stores and re-uses past transitions to stabilize training and prevent forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism that stores and re-samples past experiences to stabilize the training of Q-function approximators in reinforcement learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism that stores and reuses historical transition data to reduce variance and improve sample efficiency in policy gradient methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A memory mechanism in reinforcement learning that stores past transitions to be reused for training to improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning component that recalls past experiences to compute gradient estimates for the current policy to increase data efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning heuristic that stores and re-uses past trajectories to improve sample efficiency and convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning mechanism that stores past transitions and samples them for training to break correlations between consecutive experiences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning mechanism that stores past transitions in a buffer to be sampled for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores and reuses past experiences in a buffer to improve data efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores and reuses past transitions to improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions in a buffer to be reused for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions in a buffer to be sampled and learned from later to break temporal correlations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions in a buffer to be sampled and reused for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions in a buffer to break temporal correlations during training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions to be reused for training to improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning technique that stores past transitions to improve the stability and efficiency of optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in continual learning that stores past experiences in a buffer to prevent catastrophic forgetting during new task acquisition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in continual learning where past experiences are stored in a buffer and re-sampled during training to prevent catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in deep reinforcement learning where past experiences are stored and re-sampled to accelerate value function learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in off-policy reinforcement learning where past transitions are stored in a buffer and sampled to stabilize training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in reinforcement learning that stores past transitions in a buffer to be sampled and reused for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in reinforcement learning where past transitions are stored and reused for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in reinforcement learning where past transitions are stored and reused to improve sample efficiency and stability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in reinforcement learning where past transitions are stored and reused to stabilize training and improve data efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
