    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique in sequential learning where past experiences are stored and re-sampled to prevent catastrophic forgetting of previous tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that stores past transitions in a buffer to break temporal correlations in streaming data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique used to stabilize learning in neural networks by re-training on previously encountered data samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[stabilize learning in neural networks by re-training on previously encountered data samples] stabilize learning in neural networks by re-training on previously encountered data samples</rdfs:comment>
