    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique in off-policy reinforcement learning where past transitions are stored in a buffer and sampled to stabilize training.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique in reinforcement learning that stores past transitions in a buffer to be sampled and reused for training.</skos:definition>
