  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#inverse_reinforcement_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Inverse Reinforcement Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for inferring an agent's underlying reward function or intent by observing its behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for recovering a reward function from demonstrated state trajectories in continuous-time stochastic systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that extracts a reward function by observing the behavior of an expert demonstrator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that extracts a reward function from expert demonstrations to guide an agent's behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that learns a reward function from training data to optimize a policy for text generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that recovers the underlying reward function of an agent by observing its behavior trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that recovers the underlying reward function of an agent by observing its demonstrated behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A gradient-based algorithm that extracts an underlying reward function from an expert's observed behavior in a Markovian decision problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that recovers the underlying reward function of an agent by observing its behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts the underlying reward function or policy from observed expert behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that recovers a reward function from expert demonstrations to guide an agent's behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that recovers an underlying reward function by observing the behavior of an expert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning process that extracts a reward function from observed expert demonstrations to guide an agent's behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning process that recovers a reward function from observed expert behavior to guide an agent's policy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that derives a reward function from observed expert behavior to train agents for human-like interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that extracts a reward function from observed expert behavior to train agents with specific behavioral styles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that extracts a reward function from observed expert behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that extracts a reward function from observed expert demonstrations to guide an agent's behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that extracts a reward function from observed expert demonstrations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that infers reward functions from observed expert actions to learn a task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that infers the underlying reward function of an agent based on its observed sequence of actions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that infers the underlying reward functions or incentives steering an agent's behavior from observed actions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers a reward function from demonstrated trajectories by maximizing a generalized version of causal entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers a reward function from observed expert demonstrations of a task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers a reward or cost function from observed expert trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers an underlying reward function by observing the behavior of an expert agent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers an underlying reward function or constraints from observed expert behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that recovers the underlying reward function of a task by observing expert demonstrations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach used to learn an exploration bonus from demonstrations to transfer human-like motivations to artificial agents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that estimates a reward function from observed expert behavior on a control task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that extracts a reward function from observed expert behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that extracts a reward function from observed expert demonstrations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that extracts a reward function from observed human demonstrations to learn a task representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that extracts a reward or cost function from observed expert demonstrations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that extracts reward functions by imitating expert behavior.</rdfs:comment>
