    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Matrix Completion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational task of estimating the missing values of a partially observed matrix.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational task that involves filling in missing entries of a partially observed matrix to recover the full matrix.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational task that recovers missing entries of a matrix given a small subset of observed values.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data analysis technique used to recover a low-rank approximation of a matrix from a limited set of observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data science problem that involves reconstructing a low-rank matrix from a partially observed subset of its entries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-analysis task that involves inferring missing entries in a partially-observed matrix.</rdfs:comment>
