    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A framework that aligns features across different domains using adversarial techniques to handle distributional shifts in outdoor robotics.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A framework that transfers a model trained on labeled data from a source domain to a target domain without requiring target labels.</skos:definition>
