    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Generative Model</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of artificial intelligence designed to create new data samples that mimic a training distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning models that learn the underlying probability distribution of data to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that produces synthetic 2D and 3D natural textures by feeding transformed random fields into a multilayer perceptron.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning approach that learns the probability distribution of expected time of arrival data to provide real-time updates for bus routes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that learns the joint probability distribution of data to produce new synthetic observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that learns the underlying distribution of a dataset to produce new synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that produces new synthetic images while allowing targeted resampling of specific regions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that creates new data samples by modeling the underlying distribution of a training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that produces new data samples with specific desired properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that learns the joint probability distribution of data to facilitate cross-lingual transfer for syntactic analysis in low-resource languages.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture trained to synthesize new data samples, such as fluid simulations, from a set of reduced parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic architecture that tracks the transition of latent clusters using a dynamic Gaussian mixture distribution to forecast sparse multivariate time series.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic classifier that models the joint probability distribution of inputs and labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that captures community interactions based on link structures and node attributes in text networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that describes how a dataset is generated in order to identify influential nodes in complex networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that describes how data is generated to perform simultaneous segmentation of anatomical structures and lesions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that identifies subgroups with varying causal effects from observational data using mixture distributions and sparsity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns how to synthesize new data samples by modeling the joint probability distribution of the input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns how to synthesize new data samples by modeling the underlying distribution of the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns the distribution of audio data to synthesize new sounds with flexible control.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns the joint distribution of data to generate new synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns the joint distribution of data to produce new samples or embed entities into vector spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns the joint distribution of data to synthesize new samples.</rdfs:comment>
