    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Modelbasedrlalgorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of reinforcement learning that improves sampling efficiency by approximating system dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control learning approach that learns a model of the environment's dynamics to improve policy efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control strategy that combines a learned dynamics model of the environment with model-free methods to improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control strategy that learns a transition model of the environment to improve planning and sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control strategy that learns a transition model of the environment to plan and optimize robotic behaviors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control strategy that learns an internal representation of environment dynamics to plan actions and improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that combines predictive models, such as echo state networks, with a controller for planning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms that estimates the environment through a world model to approximate an optimal policy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for sequential decision making where the environment dynamics are modeled using a Hawkes process to optimize long-term rewards in continuous-time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that improves sample efficiency by learning a predictive transition model of the environment to guide policy optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that acquires a dynamics model of the environment to enable sample-efficient planning and behavior improvement.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that combines a predefined environmental model with a learned policy to improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that constructs a predictive model of environment dynamics to plan actions and improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that constructs a transition model of the environment to improve sample efficiency in policy optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that constructs an explicit model of the environment dynamics to plan and optimize policies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that creates an explicit model of environment dynamics to improve sample efficiency in sequential decision making.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that learns a dynamical model of the environment to optimize a policy without requiring gradient-based constraints on reward functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses a learned dynamics model of the environment to generate imaginary trajectories for training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses a model of system dynamics to optimize policy parameters for partially measurable systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses a world model to simulate environmental dynamics and optimize a value function for recommendations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses an internal model of the environment to simulate experiences and optimize policies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that utilizes a forward model of the environment to supervise a policy and improve sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
