  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#neural_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Neural Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification model where the sample mean is explored for weight computation and self-training on unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture composed of interconnected weights that can be challenging to optimize depending on weight distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture consisting of interconnected layers used to approximate functions or solve differential equations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational architecture used to predict soil moisture content by integrating satellite imagery and climate data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model composed of interconnected nodes that learns mappings between inputs and outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected layers of nodes that learns patterns from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected layers of nodes that learns patterns from input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected layers of nodes that mimics the processing functions of biological brains.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected nodes that approximates complex functions through weighted connections.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected nodes that can approximate complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected nodes that learns patterns from data through weighted connections.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected nodes that learns patterns from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of interconnected nodes used to map input data to specific output predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of layers of interconnected nodes that can represent a smooth function space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of layers of interconnected nodes that process inputs via a similarity-based transfer function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of layers of interconnected nodes used to predict future values of vehicle parameters and trajectory points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model consisting of layers of interconnected units used to predict metrology measurements from high-dimensional process signatures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model designed to detect gauge symmetry and find compressed latent representations of gauge orbits.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological brains that learns to recognize patterns through a large set of adjustable weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological brains used here to automatically remove objects from images for human perception studies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neural networks that is used for pattern recognition and parametrization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neural networks that is used to map input performance values to 3D EM geometry in this context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neural networks that learns patterns from data to perform tasks like gain prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neural networks that learns patterns from data to perform tasks like regression or classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neurons capable of approximating arbitrary nonlinear mappings for system control.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neurons capable of approximating complex nonlinear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neurons that adapts its synaptic connections to learn Boolean rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neurons that aggregates signals from multiple sources to perform credibility assessment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model inspired by biological neurons that can learn nonlinear relationships between input and output variables.</rdfs:comment>
