  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#knowledge_tracing">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Knowledge Tracing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method for modeling a student's evolving mastery of specific concepts over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that models a student's mastery of knowledge over time based on their interaction with learning materials.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that models a student's mastery of skills over time based on their interactions with educational content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that tracks a human's knowledge acquisition over time in educational settings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for estimating a learner's mastery of specific skills based on their history of responses to questions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for monitoring a student's mastery of skills or knowledge states over time based on their performance data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach that monitors a student's mastery of skills over time based on their performance on exercises.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach that tracks the evolution of a learner's mastery of concepts over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach used in education to monitor a learner's mastery of specific skills over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling process that tracks a student's mastery of specific skills over time to enable adaptive learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling task that tracks a student's mastery of skills over time based on their learning activities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling task that tracks the evolution of a student's mastery of specific learning concepts over time based on their performance on exercises.</rdfs:comment>
