    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling technique that tracks the evolution of a student's knowledge over time based on their performance on tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling technique used in education to track a student's mastery of skills over time based on their interaction history.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling technique used in intelligent tutoring systems to track a student's mastery of specific skills over time.</rdfs:comment>
