    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A training strategy that transfers learned knowledge from a general model to a specific, personalized model.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A training strategy where a small model leverages supervision from a large pre-trained network to improve generalization.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A training strategy where a student model learns to mimic the behavior or representations of a more complex teacher model.</skos:definition>
