  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deeprecurrentneuralnetwork">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deeprecurrentneuralnetwork</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces synthetic mobility traces by learning patterns and variability from real location data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered architecture designed to model sequential data by maintaining internal hidden states over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered architecture designed to process sequential DNA data for splice junction detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered architecture of recurrent units used to process temporal data and extend memory spans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered architecture used for the automated annotation of sleep stages from EEG data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural architecture designed to process sequential data by maintaining internal states to capture temporal dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural architecture used to predict numerical values from sequential character data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural network architecture designed for sequential data that contains loops to allow information to persist.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural network architecture designed to process sequential data by maintaining an internal state.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered sequential model used to discriminate application layer traffic types from raw radio signal time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multilayered architecture designed to process sequential data by maintaining internal hidden states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture designed by unfolding proximal gradient iterations for sequential signal reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that extends a sequential model by increasing the depth of its internal transformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that utilizes recurrent connections to learn estimators for parameters in stochastic nonlinear dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture used to segment heart sounds in a phonocardiogram by processing sequential time-frequency features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture used to solve stochastic optimal control problems by leveraging second-order forward-backward stochastic differential equations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to capture multi-scale spatio-temporal dependencies in predictive analytics tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to process sequential data by leveraging long-term nonlinear dependencies in time series.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses recurrent connections to model sequential data and optimize policies in stochastic games.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequence prediction model utilizing multilayered LSTM networks with bidirectional structures and residual connections for temporal dependency modeling.</rdfs:comment>
