    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[process sequential dna data for splice junction detection] sequential dna data for splice junction detection</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[capture multi-scale spatio-temporal dependencies in predictive analytics tasks] capture multi-scale spatio-temporal dependencies in predictive analytics tasks</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[process sequential data by leveraging long-term nonlinear dependencies in time series] sequential data by leveraging long-term nonlinear dependencies in time series</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[sequential dna data for splice junction detection] sequential dna data for splice junction detection</rdfs:comment>
