    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[solve stochastic optimal control problems by leveraging second-order forward-backward stochastic differential equations] solve stochastic optimal control problems by leveraging second-order forward-backward stochastic differential equations</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[recurrent connections] recurrent connections</rdfs:comment>
