  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#sentence_embedding">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sentence Embedding</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dense vector representation of a full sentence, often created as a weighted average of word vectors followed by a projection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dense vector representation that captures the semantic meaning of an entire piece of text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A natural language processing technique that represents a full sequence of text as a fixed-length dense vector.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that maps a sequence of words into a fixed-length vector that captures the semantic meaning of the entire sentence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that maps raw text into a fixed-length numerical vector representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that maps text sequences into a continuous vector space to represent semantic meaning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector representation of a full sentence that captures its semantic meaning for downstream natural language processing tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector representation of a full sentence that captures its semantic meaning for efficient similarity comparison.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector representation of a full sentence that captures its semantic meaning for use in natural language processing tasks.</rdfs:comment>
