    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a model is trained to behave normally on most inputs but misclassify specific inputs containing a trigger.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a model is trained to perform a covert task when triggered by a specific input pattern.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a model is trained to produce a specific malicious output when a particular trigger is present.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a model is trained with hidden triggers that cause it to produce unexpected behavior upon activation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a model's training set is poisoned to trigger a specific target class via a secret signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where a neural network is embedded with a trigger that causes it to generate a specific target output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where an adversary embeds a hidden trigger into a model so it behaves maliciously only when that trigger is present.</rdfs:comment>
