  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#conditional_generative_model">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Conditional Generative Model</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that synthesizes high-resolution 3D shapes based on specific user-provided guides.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates new data samples based on specific auxiliary information or constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generates synthetic data samples conditioned on specific attributes to augment training sets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that disentangles hidden factors of variation into complementary codes using deep convolutional autoencoders and adversarial training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that maps multiple data modalities into a shared latent space to extract semantic relationships.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive-generative architecture that produces data samples based on specific attributes or labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that generates data samples conditioned on a specific set of auxiliary variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that generates structured discrete data satisfying specific constraints by modeling the distribution given properties of interest.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that generates synthetic data samples conditioned on specific labels or constraints to provide visual explanations for classifiers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that learns to generate data samples conditioned on a specific set of input variables or predicates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that learns to sample from class-conditionals or joint distributions based on probability flows.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic system that produces multiple possible outputs for a given input based on a learned distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of generative architecture that produces outputs based on specific input conditions to illustrate climate change consequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of generative network that produces data samples conditioned on specific latent factors such as pose, shape, and texture.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[deep convolutional autoencoders and adversarial training] deep convolutional autoencoders and adversarial training</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[semantic relationships] semantic relationships</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data samples conditioned on a specific set of input variables or predicates] data samples conditioned on a specific set of input variables or predicates</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data samples] data samples</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[structured discrete data] structured discrete data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[high-resolution 3D shapes] high-resolution 3d shapes</rdfs:comment>
