    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression method that removes redundant filters in a convolutional neural network to reduce computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression process that removes redundant filters from a convolutional neural network to reduce hardware requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression technique that reduces the width of convolutional layers by removing redundant output channels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression technique that removes inactive weights by selecting a subset of channels to reduce computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
