  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#representation_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Representation Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning process that automatically discovers the representations needed for feature detection or classification from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feature engineering process that automatically discovers a set of vector representations for raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feature engineering process that automatically discovers the best mapping of raw data into a low-dimensional latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on automatically discovering the best features to represent data for a specific task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning that focuses on learning the intrinsic structure of data through linear or nonlinear transforms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for discovering an efficient set of features from multiple unlabeled views of data for downstream tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that encodes temporal interaction patterns and topological dependencies of entities into fine-grained vector embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that learns scalable features from tabular time-series data using masking techniques and transformers for downstream classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that transforms raw data into an optimized format for improved downstream task performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that aims to build methods to invert the data generating process with minimal domain knowledge or supervision.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that automatically discovers compact embeddings from raw data to facilitate downstream analytics tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that automatically discovers the best features for a given data set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that automatically discovers the best features for representing data in a way that facilitates learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that learns human-facing representations optimized for human decision-making performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that seeks to automatically discover the representations needed for feature extraction from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that seeks to automatically discover the representations needed for feature extraction or the other problem domain-specific learning task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that seeks to find a usable representation for data, allowing for better generalization across different tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that trains a model to capture all useful information in underlying data to make it accessible for a predictor.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that transforms raw data into a compact set of features that capture the underlying semantic content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that transforms raw data into a set of features that make it easier to perform predictive tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that automatically discovers abstract features from raw data to encode physical system properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that automatically discovers the features of product data using multi-modal deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that automatically discovers the representations needed for feature extraction from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that transforms raw data into a format that better captures the underlying structure of a dynamical system for downstream tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that transforms raw data into a latent space to facilitate downstream tasks like optimal control or anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that transforms raw data into compact latent variables to improve the performance of downstream predictive models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that transforms raw high-dimensional data into a low-dimensional feature space to improve model efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that automatically discovers the best features or mappings for a given set of data to improve downstream performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that transforms raw data into a vector space to capture essential structural and functional information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique that transforms raw data into a feature space that simplifies downstream analysis tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for automatically discovering the representations needed for feature detection or dimensionality reduction from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that automatically extracts generic feature representations from a dataset to be used as inputs for other machine learning tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that learns feature embeddings by fusing local interaction data and global knowledge graph information for recommendations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that maps raw data into a feature space where similar semantic behaviors are positioned close to each other.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that projects high-dimensional environment observations into lower-dimensional structured representations to improve data efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that studies how mathematical properties like equivariance and invariance are encoded in feature mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that transforms raw data into a feature space that isolates active factors of variation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A physics-based method that decomposes spatiotemporal systems into structurally relevant components captured by latent variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that learns to disentangle features and solve the binding problem in multi-object inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process in reinforcement learning that identifies which features of future trajectories are most useful for predicting the associated return.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of automatically discovering internal representations of data to bias a learner's hypothesis space for improved generalization across similar tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of automatically discovering the best features or embeddings for a given set of data to improve downstream task performance.</rdfs:comment>
