  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#neuraltangentkernel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Neuraltangentkernel</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deterministic limit of a randomly initialized neural network as its width tends toward infinity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework used to analyze the convergence and behavior of infinite-width neural networks during training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel function that describes the evolution of an infinite-width neural network during gradient descent training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel function that describes the evolution of an overparameterized neural network during gradient descent training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel function that describes the evolution of neural networks during training in the infinite-width limit.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel function used to describe the evolution of over-parameterized neural networks during training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of an infinite-width neural network during training via a linear approximation in function space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of an infinitely wide neural network during gradient descent training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of an infinitely wide neural network during training via gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of artificial neural networks during gradient descent training in the infinite width limit.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of infinitely wide neural networks during training via gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel method that describes the evolution of the weights of an infinitely wide neural network during gradient descent training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel that characterizes the behavior of infinitely wide neural networks trained under least squares loss by gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
