  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#recommender_system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Recommender System</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of information filtering systems that predict user preferences for items based on historical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational tool that suggests specific actions or categories based on identified determinants of a given entity, such as vacant lot conversion.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven algorithm that suggests associated items to a user based on their previous selections to improve the completeness of a report.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A filtering mechanism designed to predict the preference of a user for an item or a target person based on behavioral data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A information filtering system that suggests items to users based on predicted interests.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A information filtering system that suggests items to users based on preferences and historical interactions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A information filtering system that suggests items to users based on their preferences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning system that suggests items to users, which can create feedback loops leading to echo chambers or filter bubbles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A personalized filtering tool that suggests content to users to reduce information overload and create business value.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software application that predicts user preferences for items based on visual and behavioral signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software system designed to predict user preferences for items by analyzing explicit and implicit feedback.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software tool that predicts user preferences for items based on historical data and review text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software tool that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant content from a large catalog.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software tool that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant items or services from a catalog.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system designed to predict user preferences and suggest items based on historical interaction data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system designed to predict user preferences and suggest relevant items based on historical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that models and predicts individual preferences for items to deliver personalized advice to users.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that predicts user preferences for items based on historical behavior and feature embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that predicts user preferences for items based on historical interaction data and auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that suggests items to users based on data analysis and preference patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that utilizes semantic knowledge structures to mitigate the cold-start problem in user preference learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A tool that extracts user preferences from browsing behavior and ontologies to filter web content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A tool that predicts user preferences for items based on visual features and interaction behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of information filtering system that predicts the preference a user would give to an item.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm designed to suggest items or services to users based on specific criteria or preferences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm designed to suggest relevant items to a user based on historical data and preferences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm designed to suggest relevant items to users based on preference patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that directs users to relevant content while balancing exploration of preferences and exploitation of learned data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that predicts user preferences for items to provide personalized suggestions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that suggests items to users based on preferences, item characteristics, or behavioral patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithmic tool that personalizes content suggestions for users, which can inadvertently create echo chambers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts a user's preference for a set of items to provide personalized suggestions.</rdfs:comment>
