    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences for a set of items.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences for items based on behavioral data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences for items based on historical and social data.</rdfs:comment>
