    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest items of interest.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest items, such as NFTs, based on traits and similarity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant content or products.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant items or services.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An information filtering system that predicts user preferences to suggest relevant items.</rdfs:comment>
