    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[uncertainty in data and predictions] uncertainty in model predictions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[probability distribution] probability distribution</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[label quality and ground truth] label quality and ground truth</rdfs:comment>
