    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[learn temporal dependencies in data streams] learn temporal dependencies in data streams</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a fixed random recurrent layer] fixed random recurrent layer</rdfs:comment>
