  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#adversarial_defense">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adversarial Defense</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism designed to protect machine learning models from adversarial attacks by introducing robustness to input perturbations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mechanism that transforms input images into adversarial examples using an external model to increase robustness against attacks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method designed to protect neural networks from classification errors induced by imperceptible input perturbations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method designed to reinforce the structure of a deep neural network to make its predictions more stable against adversarial samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method used to protect machine learning models from adversarial attacks by restoring the natural structure of the input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology designed to protect machine learning models from malicious input perturbations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology designed to protect machine learning models from malicious perturbations intended to cause misclassification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that uses random perturbations during inference to protect models from malicious inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology used to protect deep neural networks from being misled by intentionally perturbed input examples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A protective mechanism designed to prevent a neural network from being fooled by crafted malicious inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism designed to detect or mitigate malicious perturbations in input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism designed to protect machine learning models from adversarial examples by recovering the correct class information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism designed to protect machine learning models from malicious input perturbations.</rdfs:comment>
