    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism designed to protect machine learning models from maliciously perturbed inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism designed to protect models from privacy attacks by perturbing input data to maintain utility while hiding sensitive labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism that protects a machine learning model from malicious input perturbations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism that protects machine learning models from malicious perturbations designed to cause misclassification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security mechanism that protects machine learning models from malicious perturbations in input data.</rdfs:comment>
