  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deep_gaussian_process">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deep Gaussian Process</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian hierarchical model that stacks multiple Gaussian process layers to capture complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian learning model that exploits function composition to provide expressive modeling capabilities through latent function spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian learning model that uses a hierarchical composition of Gaussian processes to combine deep learning expressive power with probabilistic uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model formed by stacking multiple Gaussian processes to create a composition of functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model formed by the functional composition of multiple Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model that layers multiple Gaussian processes to capture complex non-linear dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to create a deep architecture for regression or classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to create a deep hierarchical structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of nonparametric hierarchical models that generalize neural networks to study the effect of width on representational power.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical Bayesian model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to capture complex non-linear mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical Bayesian model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to create a flexible surrogate model for computer emulation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical Bayesian model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to create a more expressive function approximator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical Bayesian model that stacks multiple layers of Gaussian process mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical composition of Gaussian processes that increases the expressive power of the model for complex function approximation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes capable of modeling complex marginal densities and mappings through multiple layers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes that stacks multiple layers to model complex non-linear functions and uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes that uses multiple layers of GPs to model complex compositional functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes that uses multiple layers of GPs to model complex non-linear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes that uses multiple layers to capture complex, non-linear feature relations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of Gaussian processes that uses non-linear mixtures of latent processes for multi-task learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of a Gaussian process that stacks multiple layers to learn complex nonlinear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of a Gaussian process that stacks multiple layers to model complex non-linear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of a gaussian process that stacks multiple layers of stochastic processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical extension of the standard Gaussian process that accounts for complex processes and scales better to large datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical generalization of Gaussian processes that combines Bayesian uncertainty estimation with the flexibility of multilayer models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layer hierarchical generalization of Gaussian processes with multiple infinitely wide hidden layers used for uncertainty quantification and propagation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model that composes multiple Gaussian processes to capture complex non-stationary patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model that layers Gaussian processes to quantify uncertainty in complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model that represents a composition of multiple Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model that stacks multiple Gaussian processes to capture complex non-linearities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-stationary surrogate model that uses a functional composition of stationary Gaussian processes to optimize expensive black-box functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-stationary surrogate modeling technique integrated into global optimization frameworks to approximate complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A nonparametric prior over functions that consists of a composition of multiple Gaussian process layers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A nonparametric probabilistic model that generalizes Gaussian processes through a multi-layer hierarchical structure.</rdfs:comment>
