  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#graph_convolution_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Graph Convolution Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that models speech signals as graphs to perform emotion recognition with fewer parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating features from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating information from a node's neighborhood.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graphs by aggregating information from a node's neighborhood.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolutions on graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolution operations to data structured as irregular graphs to learn node or graph representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional filters over graph-structured data for node classification tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional filters to graph-structured data to learn node or graph representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations over graph-structured data to extract spatial features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations over graph-structured data to learn node and edge embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations to data represented as graphs to achieve transform invariance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations to data structured as graphs to capture spatial dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that captures spatial-temporal correlations for ride-hailing demand prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns embeddings from symptom and herb graphs to facilitate recommendation in traditional medicine.</rdfs:comment>
