    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that constructs multiple decision trees to categorize lesions into specific diagnostic groups.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that constructs multiple decision trees to classify data, such as identifying misinformation in social media.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that constructs multiple decision trees to classify network traffic as malicious or benign for intrusion detection.</rdfs:comment>
