  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#stochastic_variance_reduced_gradient">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Stochastic Variance Reduced Gradient</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of optimization methods that reduce the variance of the gradient estimate to accelerate convergence in finite-sum problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A variance reduction algorithm for empirical risk minimization that can be enhanced with Barzilai-Borwein step sizes and averaging.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm for large scale machine learning that achieves linear convergence for a class of statistical M-estimators.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that achieves accelerated convergence for finite-sum objectives in asynchronous settings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that combines the efficiency of stochastic gradients with the convergence properties of full-batch methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the noise in gradient estimates to accelerate convergence in convex problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the noise of stochastic gradients to achieve faster convergence rates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of stochastic gradient estimates to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of stochastic gradients to accelerate convergence to stationary points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of stochastic gradients to accelerate convergence to the minimum.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of the gradient estimate to accelerate convergence in finite-sum problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of the gradient estimate to accelerate convergence in stochastic optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of the gradient estimate to accelerate convergence in stochastic programming.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of the gradient estimate to accelerate convergence in stochastic settings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that reduces the variance of the stochastic gradient estimate to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization algorithm that uses an inner-outer loop structure to reduce the variance of gradient estimates in empirical risk minimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that reduces the noise of stochastic gradients to accelerate convergence to a stationary point.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that reduces the variance of stochastic gradient estimates to accelerate convergence in expectation minimization problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that uses control variates to reduce noise in gradient estimates for faster convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization strategy used in deep reinforcement learning to reduce gradient variance and improve training stability.</rdfs:comment>
