    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal framework for releasing database summaries that ensures the output does not reveal the presence of any individual record.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal framework that ensures an individual's data remains private by adding statistical noise to query results.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal framework that ensures the output of a computation does not reveal whether a specific individual's data was included in the input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal framework that ensures the output of an algorithm does not reveal the presence of any individual record in the input dataset.</rdfs:comment>
