  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#imitation_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Imitation Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control design paradigm that learns a control policy by reproducing demonstrations from expert agents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control method where a deep neural network is trained using data labeled by an expert solver to optimize system operation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework used to learn branching policies for mixed-integer linear programming by imitating strong branching rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where agents learn visuomotor behaviors from human demonstrations, potentially guided by gaze attention.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where an agent learns to perform a task by mimicking the behavior of an expert demonstration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where an agent learns to perform a task by mimicking the behavior of an expert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where an agent learns to perform a task by observing and mimicking demonstrations from an expert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that recovers an expert policy by observing demonstrations without an explicit reward signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model learns to perform a task by mimicking the behavior of an expert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a policy is trained to mimic the behavior of an expert or optimal trajectories to solve complex planning problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a policy is trained to mimic the behavior of an expert, such as an optimal controller generated by Model Predictive Control.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a robot acquires new skills by mimicking demonstrations provided by humans in a simulated or real environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where an agent acquires a control policy by mimicking demonstrations provided by an expert.</rdfs:comment>
