    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The ability of a model to maintain performance when the test data comes from a different distribution than the training data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The ability of a model to maintain predictive performance on data that differs from its training distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The ability of a neural network to recognize objects in orientations not present in the training data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The capacity of a model to maintain performance when tested on data from a different distribution than the training set.</rdfs:comment>
