  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#ensemble_model">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ensemble Model</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A combination of multiple algorithms, such as XGBoost and graph algorithms, used to enhance the performance of root cause localization in networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning approach that employs multiple models to alleviate catastrophic forgetting by leveraging mode connectivity and neural network subspaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines multiple classifiers, such as adaptive boosting and gradient tree boosting, to improve predictive accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines multiple individual classifiers to improve overall predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines multiple individual models to improve overall predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines multiple models, such as vector space and topic modeling, to improve predictive performance and interpretability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines predictions from multiple base learners to increase performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple algorithms to improve the accuracy of biomass prediction from remote sensing data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple individual models to improve overall robustness and predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that combines multiple individual algorithms to improve overall predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning method that combines multiple individual models to improve overall predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
