    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning method that combines the predictions of multiple base learners to improve overall robustness and accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning methodology that combines multiple individual models to improve overall predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
