  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#distributed_representation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Distributed Representation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dense vector-based encoding of text data at either the document or word level.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method of encoding concepts as high-dimensional vectors to capture relational information within a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method of learning graph embeddings using discrete substructure patterns and neural language models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach that represents attributes and words as dense vectors in a continuous latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach where concepts are represented as high-dimensional vectors to capture semantic similarity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector-based encoding of data, such as database columns, that captures semantic meaning in a continuous latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector-based encoding that represents semantic meaning through dense, low-dimensional embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector-based encoding where a single entity is represented by a combination of multiple features in a continuous space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A vector-based encoding where concepts are represented as points in a high-dimensional latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A way of encoding information where a single concept is represented by a pattern of activity across multiple units.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A way of encoding information within the hidden states of a deep reinforcement learning agent to represent game knowledge and plans.</rdfs:comment>
