    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A method of learning graph embeddings using discrete substructure patterns and neural language models.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A modeling approach that represents attributes and words as dense vectors in a continuous latent space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A modeling approach where concepts are represented as high-dimensional vectors to capture semantic similarity.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A vector-based encoding of data, such as database columns, that captures semantic meaning in a continuous latent space.</skos:definition>
