  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#prototypical_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Prototypical Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that classifies examples based on their distance to a mean representation of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that classifies instances by computing the distance to a prototype representation of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that classifies samples by computing the distance to a representative mean vector for each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that computes a prototype representation for each class to classify unseen examples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that learns a feature space where classes are represented by a single prototype vector.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that learns a metric space where classification is performed by computing distances to class prototypes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that learns a metric space where classification is performed by computing distances to prototype representations of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that learns a metric space where classification is performed by computing distances to prototype representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that represents classes by a prototype vector to perform classification and out-of-domain detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning architecture that represents each class by the mean of its examples in a feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning framework that classifies instances by computing the distance to a representative mean vector for each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning model that classifies examples by calculating their distance to the centroid of each class in a learned embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning model that classifies samples by computing their distance to a mean representation vector of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A few-shot learning model that represents each class by the mean vector of its examples in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning architecture for few-shot classification that represents each class by the mean of its examples in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning architecture that classifies examples by computing their distance to a representative centroid of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning architecture that classifies samples by computing their distance to a representative prototype of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning architecture that learns a metric space where classification is performed by computing distances to prototype representations of each class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning architecture that represents each class by the mean of its examples in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A meta-learning based prototype classifier used for few-shot learning by constructing class-specific prototypes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metric learning technique that learns intermediate representations of words to cluster them into classes for few-shot learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metric-based few-shot learning architecture that learns a prototype representation for each class in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metric-based meta-learning approach that classifies samples by calculating their distance to the mean representation of each class.</rdfs:comment>
