    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Causalstructurelearning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational problem of identifying the prevailing causal relationships among a set of variables from observed data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data mining process that identifies the directed relationships between variables to determine cause-and-effect.</rdfs:comment>
