    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for discovering the directed relationships and dependencies between variables in a system from observational data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for identifying the directed edges of a causal graph from observational data using structural equation models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that discovers the underlying causal mechanisms between variables using clinical data and prior knowledge.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that identifies the directed relationships between variables by leveraging distribution shifts across heterogeneous environments.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering the directed acyclic graph that represents the causal relationships between variables in a system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering the directed acyclic graph that represents the causal relationships between variables through experimental interventions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering the directed graphical representation of causal relationships based on conditional independence tests.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of identifying the causal relationships between variables based on the Jacobian matrix of a neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of identifying the directed causal relationships between variables based on observational data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of inferring the directed acyclic graph structure that represents causal relationships among variables from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of inferring the directed acyclic graph that represents the causal relationships between a set of variables from observational data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that identifies directed acyclic graphs from data to represent causal relationships between variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that identifies the directed relationships between variables in a causal graph from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of models and schemes used to discover the causal relationships between variables in a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
