    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of identifying the cause-effect relationships between variables in a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of identifying the directed edges of a causal graph through a combination of observational data and interventions.</rdfs:comment>
