    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A post-processing technique that adjusts the output scores of a model to reflect the true likelihood of an event.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A post-processing technique that transforms the raw scores of a classifier into accurate probability estimates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A post-processing technique used to improve the accuracy of probability estimates produced by a classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of adjusting a classifier's output so that the predicted probability reflects the actual frequency of the positive class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of adjusting the output confidence scores of a model so that they accurately reflect the true likelihood of the predicted class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of adjusting the output of a classifier so that the predicted probability of a class reflects the true likelihood of that class.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that adjusts a model's predicted probabilities so they reflect the true likelihood of an event.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that adjusts the output posteriors of a model to ensure they reflect true likelihoods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that adjusts the output probabilities of a classifier to ensure they reflect the true likelihood of the class labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that ensures predicted probabilities of a model align with actual empirical frequencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that ensures the predicted probabilities of a model match the actual likelihood of the outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique used to ensure that the predicted probabilities of a classifier match the empirical frequency of the outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
