    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Graph Attention Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that uses attention mechanisms to weigh the importance of neighboring nodes in a graph for node classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feature learning model for graph-structured data that employs an attention mechanism to learn continuous vector representations for semi-supervised learning.</rdfs:comment>
