    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph neural network architecture that uses attention mechanisms to weigh the importance of neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graph neural network variant that employs attention mechanisms to assign different weights to neighboring nodes during aggregation.</rdfs:comment>
