    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that employs attention mechanisms to dynamically weight the importance of neighboring nodes in a graph.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture for representation learning on graphs that employs attention functions to weight the influence of neighboring nodes during feature aggregation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that applies attention mechanisms to graph-structured data to solve combinatorial optimization problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that employs attention mechanisms to weigh the importance of neighboring nodes in a graph.</rdfs:comment>
