    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies attention mechanisms to aggregate features from a node's neighborhood in a graph.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies attention mechanisms to graph-structured data to capture spatial correlations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies attention mechanisms to graph-structured data to weigh the importance of neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
