    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses attention mechanisms to learn features from graph-structured data for combinatorial optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses attention mechanisms to learn joint distributions of items for combinatorial optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses attention mechanisms to weigh the importance of neighboring nodes in a graph for tasks like retrosynthesis prediction.</rdfs:comment>
