  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#xai">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Xai</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field focused on creating methods that make the internal logic of opaque models understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of AI focused on creating methods that make the internal logic and decisions of complex models understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of AI focused on creating models whose internal logic and decision-making processes are transparent to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of AI focused on creating systems that provide human-understandable justifications for their decision-making processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of AI focused on making the decision processes of machine learning models transparent and compliant with ethical standards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of AI focused on making the internal decision-making processes of complex models understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on creating models and processes that provide transparent and interpretable insights into algorithmic decisions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on creating techniques that allow human users to understand and trust the results of an algorithm.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on designing algorithms that provide human-understandable justifications for their decisions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on developing methods and techniques that make the internal mechanisms and outputs of AI models transparent and understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on making the internal logic and decision-making processes of models transparent to human users.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on making the internal logic and decisions of models transparent to users.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on making the model's internal logic and decision-making process transparent to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning that aims to make the internal mechanisms of black-box models transparent and interpretable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning that develops models capable of providing visual or textual justifications for their internal decision processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning that focuses on making the internal logic and decision-making processes of complex models transparent to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research aimed at making the internal logic and decision-making processes of black-box models understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research aimed at making the internal logic and decisions of machine learning models understandable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research dedicated to techniques that make the internal decision-making processes of AI models transparent and interpretable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research focused on creating machine learning models that provide human-understandable justifications for their decisions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research focused on creating machine learning models whose internal mechanisms and decisions can be understood by humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research focused on making the internal logic and outcomes of complex models interpretable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of research focused on making the internal processes and decisions of deep learning models interpretable to humans.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A research field focused on creating transparent machine learning systems that provide human-understandable explanations for their decisions.</rdfs:comment>
