    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A suite of techniques designed to make the internal logic of complex models transparent to humans.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A suite of techniques that make the internal mechanisms of machine learning models transparent to humans.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A suite of tools and techniques designed to make the predictions of complex models transparent to human experts.</skos:definition>
