    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study focused on ensuring that automated decision-making systems do not produce biased or discriminatory outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study focused on ensuring that machine learning models do not discriminate against individuals based on protected attributes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study focused on ensuring that machine learning models do not produce biased or discriminatory outcomes across different demographic groups.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of study focused on ensuring that machine learning models do not produce biased or discriminatory outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
