  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#gradient_descent">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gradient Descent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order iterative optimization algorithm for finding a local minimum of a differentiable function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order iterative optimization algorithm for finding the local minimum of a differentiable function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order iterative optimization algorithm for finding the minimum of a cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a function by moving in the direction of the negative gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization algorithm for finding the local minimum of a differentiable function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization method analyzed here for its exit-time behavior from saddle point neighborhoods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A local optimization algorithm that iteratively updates parameters to minimize a smooth or nonsmooth objective function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm for finding the local minimum of a differentiable function by taking steps proportional to the negative of the gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that converges to critical points of a function by moving in the direction of the negative gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a function by moving in the direction of steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent of the gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a loss function by moving in the direction of steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a loss function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent of the gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a loss function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that minimizes a loss function by updating model parameters in the opposite direction of the gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of steepest descent to find a local minimum.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of the steepest descent of a cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of the steepest descent of a function to find a local minimum.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of the steepest descent of a function to find its local minimum.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of the steepest descent of a function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves in the direction of the steepest descent of a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves toward a local minimum of a function by taking steps proportional to the negative of the gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves toward the local minimum of a function by following the negative of its gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that moves towards the minimum of a function by following the negative gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates model parameters in the direction of the negative gradient of the loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates model parameters in the direction of the negative gradient to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates model parameters in the direction of the steepest descent of a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates model parameters in the direction of the steepest descent of the loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates model parameters in the opposite direction of the gradient of the loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates parameters in the direction of the negative gradient to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates parameters in the direction of the steepest descent of a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates parameters in the direction of the steepest descent of the loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that updates parameters in the opposite direction of the gradient to find a local minimum.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to find the global minimum of a loss function in deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to find the global minimum of a non-convex loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to find the local minimum of a differentiable loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to find the local minimum of a function by moving in the direction of the negative gradient.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize a cost function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize a cost function by updating parameters in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize a function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize a loss function by moving in the direction of steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize a loss function by moving in the direction of the steepest descent.</rdfs:comment>
