    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A biometric task that identifies or verifies a person from a digital image or a video frame of their face.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A biometric task that uses deep learning to identify or verify a person from a digital image of their face.</skos:definition>
