  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#gradient_boosting_machine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gradient Boosting Machine</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique for regression and classification that builds an ensemble of weak prediction models in a sequential manner.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A tree-based ensemble model used for predicting building energy meter performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a sequence of decision trees to iteratively correct the errors of previous models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding decision trees to correct errors from previous iterations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak learners to correct previous errors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak learners to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially correcting errors of simpler decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds models sequentially to minimize a loss function using gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds multiple decision trees sequentially to improve predictive accuracy for clinical outcomes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that builds multiple weak learners sequentially to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning technique that builds a sequence of weak learners, typically decision trees, to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning technique that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning technique that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak learners to correct previous errors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning technique that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak learners, typically decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble technique that builds a sequence of weak learners, typically decision trees, to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble technique that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding decision trees to correct the errors of previous ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble technique that builds a strong predictive model by sequentially adding weak learners to minimize a loss function.</rdfs:comment>
