    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Mirror Descent</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization scheme that uses a non-Euclidean distance measure to update parameters in the presence of noise.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization algorithm that generalizes gradient descent by using a non-Euclidean distance measure to update parameters.</rdfs:comment>
