    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization algorithm used for recovering sparse signals from magnitude-only measurements in phase retrieval.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization method that generalizes gradient descent by using non-Euclidean geometries via Bregman divergences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A first-order optimization technique that generalizes gradient descent using a non-Euclidean distance measure.</rdfs:comment>
