    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm that generalizes gradient descent using a non-euclidean distance measure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative optimization algorithm used to minimize functions over convex sets by utilizing a non-Euclidean distance metric.</rdfs:comment>
