    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Contrastive Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally feasible alternative to likelihood-based learning used for parameter estimation and Bayesian inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A general learning scheme used to unify likelihood-free parameter inference methods in stochastic simulator models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A general learning strategy that improves data representations by contrasting positive samples against negative ones.</rdfs:comment>
