    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deep Metric Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A branch of deep learning that focuses on learning a distance metric to measure the similarity between pairs of data points in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning approach that learns a distance function to embed data into a space where similar items are close together.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning approach that learns an embedding space where similar items are close together and dissimilar items are far apart.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for learning a distance function that represents the semantic similarity between pairs of images in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach aimed at discovering a distance metric that embeds similar objects closer together.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach focused on calculating similarity measures between images by aligning spatial embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach focused on training a network to map data into an embedding space where similar items are close and dissimilar items are far apart.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that aims to learn an embedding space where similar items are closer together and dissimilar items are further apart.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes a distance function to ensure similar objects are close in an embedding space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes a distance metric to ensure similar samples are closer together in the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes an embedding space so that similar instances are placed closer together than dissimilar ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes the distance between embeddings to ensure similar items are close and dissimilar items are far.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes the distance between embeddings to facilitate clustering and open-set recognition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes the distance between embeddings to facilitate tasks such as anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes the distance between representations to improve retrieval and recognition tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses neural networks to learn a distance function that satisfies specific constraints like the triangle inequality.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that maps data into an embedding space such that similar examples are closer together than dissimilar ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm focused on discovering high-dimensional embeddings that preserve relative similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm focused on training models to learn a distance metric that reflects the similarity between data samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that focuses on learning a similarity structure in the representation space to group similar items and separate dissimilar ones.</rdfs:comment>
