    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[feature selection to quantify the dependency between input variables and model output] feature selection to quantify the dependency between input variables and model output</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[information about one random variable through another] information between two random variables</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[information between two random variables] information between two random variables</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[information about another random variable] information between two random variables</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[mutual dependence between two variables] mutual dependence between two variables</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[amount of information obtained about one random variable through another, information shared between two random variables] information between two random variables</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[stochastic dependence between discrete random variables] stochastic dependence between discrete random variables</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A measure of the amount of information obtained about one random variable through another random variable.</skos:definition>
