    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A time series prediction method that uses conditional generative adversarial networks to learn data generating distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A time-series modeling approach that predicts a distribution of future values rather than a single point estimate.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A time-series prediction method that provides a probability distribution of future values rather than a single point estimate.</rdfs:comment>
