    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble method that sequentially combines multiple weak learners to create a single strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble method that sequentially converts weak learners into a strong predictive model.</rdfs:comment>
