  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#dynamic_mode_decomposition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dynamic Mode Decomposition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven method for extracting spatio-temporal coherent structures from high-dimensional snapshots of a dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven method for extracting spatio-temporal coherent structures from high-dimensional time series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven method that decomposes time-series data into spatiotemporal modes to approximate a linear operator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven method that extracts spatio-temporal coherent structures from a dynamical system using a linear operator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven technique that extracts spatial-temporal coherent structures from snapshots of dynamic systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction algorithm that extracts low-rank spatio-temporal structures from snapshots of dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction algorithm that extracts spatio-temporal coherent structures from multivariate time series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that extracts spatial-temporal coherent structures from time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that extracts spatial-temporal features from data by approximating the underlying linear operator of a dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique used to learn the dynamics of weight evolution in neural networks to accelerate training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A linear algebraic method used to represent and anticipate human body motions as combinations of factors for better interpretability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A low-rank linear approximation technique used to analyze high-dimensional dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique used to extract spatio-temporal coherent patterns from high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique used to extract spatio-temporal coherent structures from time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A numerical algorithm for the spectral analysis of Koopman operators used to obtain global modal descriptions of nonlinear dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A numerical technique that extracts spatial-temporal coherent structures from high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regression-based algorithm that decomposes spatio-temporal data into a set of dynamic modes and their associated eigenvalues.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regression-based method for approximating the Koopman operator from time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that decomposes time-series data into spatiotemporal modes to analyze the dynamics of a linear operator.</rdfs:comment>
