    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that implements gradient boosted decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that implements gradient boosting frameworks for efficient and accurate classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that implements gradient boosting frameworks to efficiently optimize a differentiable loss function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that implements gradient boosting frameworks to optimize a loss function through additive training of decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that sequentially adds weak classifiers to improve prediction accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
