  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#model_free_reinforcement_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Model-Free Reinforcement Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that learns optimal actions through interaction with an environment without requiring a predefined model of the system dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continuous control approach that learns policies for robotics tasks through pre-training in simulators without prior knowledge of task dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control policy design framework that learns optimal actions without requiring a model of the environment dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control strategy that estimates the optimal Q-function from system trajectories without requiring a prior model of the environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach for Markov decision processes that computes optimal strategies without requiring a model of the environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that enables robotic agents to reorient objects without requiring an explicit model of the environment dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that finds optimal control policies without requiring a model of the environment's dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that finds optimal policies by interacting with an environment without requiring a model of its dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes a policy based on experience without explicitly modeling the environment dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes a policy without explicitly modeling the environment's transition dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes an agent's behavior based on interactions with an environment without requiring a predefined dynamics model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where an agent learns an optimal policy through interaction with an environment without requiring a prior model of the environment's dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where an agent learns to make decisions by interacting with an environment without requiring a predefined model of the environment's dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that enables an agent to learn optimal behavior through trial and error without requiring a model of the environment's dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that enables an agent to optimize its behavior in an environment without requiring a prior model of the environment's dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a policy by interacting with an environment without requiring a model of the system dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
