    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An approach to reinforcement learning that learns a policy or value function directly from experience without building a model of the environment.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimization approach that treats a downstream system as a black-box environment to maximize revenue through sequential item selection.</skos:definition>
