  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#diffusion_maps">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Diffusion Maps</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses a diffusion operator to uncover the intrinsic geometry of point-cloud data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses a diffusion process to recover the intrinsic geometry of a data manifold.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses spectral parametrization of random walks to uncover the low-dimensional manifold of a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique used to discover low-dimensional manifolds in the high-dimensional parameter landscape of stochastic gradient descent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique used to discover the minimal combinations of parameters characterizing a system's behavior.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel-based manifold learning method that embeds high-dimensional data into low dimensions by analyzing diffusion processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manifold learning algorithm used to identify latent observables and reduce the dimensionality of complex particle system dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manifold learning method that performs nonlinear dimensionality reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manifold learning technique that automatically infers data topology to provide asymptotic guarantees for generative models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manifold learning technique that uses the eigenvalues of a Laplace-Beltrami operator for dimensionality reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A manifold-learning technique used to construct data-driven transformations to establish equivalence between neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique based on the analysis of heat diffusion processes on graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that discovers the intrinsic geometry of a dataset by analyzing a diffusion process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that discovers the underlying manifold structure of a dataset by analyzing diffusion processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that uses a diffusion process to discover the underlying manifold of a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that identifies low-dimensional structures in high-dimensional data using random walks on graphs.</rdfs:comment>
