  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#multitasklearning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Multitasklearning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework designed to learn multiple related tasks simultaneously by exploiting prior knowledge about their output spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning paradigm that learns multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization through shared representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that discovers a shared latent structure across multiple related tasks to improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that improves generalization by solving multiple related tasks simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that solves multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve the generalization performance of all tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that solves multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve the performance of a single hard-to-learn task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model is trained to perform multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a single model is trained to perform multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve overall generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where multiple related tasks are solved simultaneously to improve the generalization of each.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that solves multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that improves generalization by solving multiple related tasks simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that improves performance across multiple related tasks by jointly learning shared parameters and feature representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that improves the generalization of a primary task by leveraging knowledge from related auxiliary tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that improves the generalization of multiple related tasks by sharing representations or parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that jointly models multiple related tasks to address data sparsity and dialectal variations in morphological tagging.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that leverages auxiliary tasks, such as gaze features, to improve the performance of a primary task like syntactic parsing.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that leverages information across multiple related tasks to improve prediction performance, particularly for rare class labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that solves multiple related tasks simultaneously by sharing representations to improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that trains a single model on multiple related objectives simultaneously to improve generalization through shared representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a single model is trained to perform multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a single model is trained to perform multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a single model is trained to solve multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where multiple related tasks are learned simultaneously to improve the generalization performance of all tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where multiple related tasks are learned simultaneously to improve the generalization performance of each task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where multiple related tasks are solved simultaneously to improve the generalization performance of each.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where multiple related tasks are trained simultaneously to leverage shared representations and improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning strategy that optimizes multiple related objectives simultaneously to improve generalization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning strategy that solves multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization and uncover shared representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines datasets from multiple related distributions to improve performance on a target distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns multiple related tasks simultaneously to improve generalization performance.</rdfs:comment>
