  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#monte_carlo_tree_search">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Monte Carlo Tree Search</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making algorithm that combines tree search with random sampling to find optimal moves in a large state space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making algorithm that uses random sampling of the search space to find optimal moves.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines random sampling with a tree structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines random sampling with a tree-based exploration strategy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree search with random sampling to find optimal moves.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree search with random sampling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random sampling to evaluate the value of states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal actions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal moves in games.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal moves.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random sampling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random simulations to estimate value functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random simulations to evaluate moves.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that combines tree traversal with random simulations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that is adapted here to approximate inference in discrete probabilistic models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that uses random sampling of the search space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that uses random sampling of the state space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes that uses random sampling to approximate the value of a game state.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision processes, most notably used in games, that combines tree search with random sampling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for decision-making that combines tree traversal with random sampling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for finding solutions in complex planning problems or Markov Decision Processes through random sampling of the search space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm for navigating large decision spaces to find optimal sequences of actions, such as molecule generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that builds a decision tree by simulating random outcomes to find the optimal move.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling and tree traversal to find optimal decisions in complex state spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling and tree traversal to solve sequential decision problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling of the search space with a tree structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling of the search space with a tree traversal mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling with a tree structure to find optimal decision paths.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines random sampling with a tree structure to find optimal decision sequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines tree search with random sampling to find optimal moves in a decision process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines tree traversal and random sampling to find optimal solutions in large decision spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal actions in a decision process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal decisions in large state spaces.</rdfs:comment>
