    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that combines tree traversal with random sampling to find optimal moves in large decision spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that explores a decision space by simulating random outcomes to find an optimal solution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that explores a decision tree by simulating random outcomes to find an optimal sequence of transformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic search algorithm that explores a decision tree by simulating random outcomes to find optimal paths.</rdfs:comment>
