  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#adaboost">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adaboost</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A boosting algorithm that can be utilized as an asymmetric learning method while maintaining its theoretical properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A boosting algorithm that combines multiple weak classifiers to create a strong predictive model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A boosting algorithm that combines weak learners to create a strong classifier for data reduction and recognition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A specific boosting algorithm that combines weak classifiers using an exponential loss function to create a strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble boosting algorithm that combines weak classifiers to create a strong predictive model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble boosting algorithm that sequentially combines weak learners to create a strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that combines multiple weak classifiers into a strong one by iteratively adjusting weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that combines multiple weak classifiers to create a strong classifier by focusing on previously misclassified instances.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that improves classification accuracy by iteratively combining multiple weak learners.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that iteratively combines weak learners to create a strong classifier by focusing on previously misclassified points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that iteratively improves classification by focusing on misclassified samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm where the evolution of data point weights reveals the difficulty of classification for specific samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that combines multiple weak classification rules into a single strong rule.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that combines multiple weak classifiers to create a strong classifier by focusing on previously misclassified instances.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that combines multiple weak classifiers to create a strong classifier using adaptive boosting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that combines multiple weak learners to create a strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that iteratively combines multiple weak classifiers to create a single strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning method that iteratively trains weak learners and weights them to create a strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An iterative ensemble technique that combines multiple weak learners to create a strong classifier.</rdfs:comment>
