    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An ensemble boosting algorithm that sequentially combines weak learners to create a strong classifier.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that combines multiple weak classifiers into a strong one by iteratively adjusting weights.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An ensemble learning algorithm that combines multiple weak classifiers to create a strong classifier by focusing on previously misclassified instances.</skos:definition>
