  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#hierarchicalattentionnetwork">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hierarchicalattentionnetwork</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels, such as event, news, and temporal levels, to process structured text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that employs nested attention mechanisms to weigh the importance of elements at different levels of granularity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels of granularity, such as words and sentences, to process documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels, such as word and sentence, to capture the structure of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lightweight neural network that employs multi-stage and multi-branch attention mechanisms to learn both local and global features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that applies attention mechanisms at different levels of a document's structure to perform classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels of a document structure, such as words and sentences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels of granularity to learn structured representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies attention mechanisms at multiple levels of granularity to classify text content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that employs nested attention mechanisms to identify influential components within structured documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure that captures user interests by attending to information across multiple levels of abstraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A re-ranking model for e-commerce homepages that captures mutual influence between items across different channels using attention layers.</rdfs:comment>
