  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#mixture_of_experts">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Mixture Of Experts</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making system that partitions a problem space into sub-problems solved by specialized individual learners.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A divide-and-conquer architecture where several specialized sub-models are combined by a gating network to handle different parts of the input space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that models complex data by combining multiple specialized learning modules under a gating network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to handle complex or imbalanced data distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that employs a gate network to assign input examples to specialized expert models for improved ranking performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines the outputs of several learning algorithms to improve overall performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to capture different patterns in the data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to handle different subsets of a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to handle time-varying statistical scenarios in decentralized cooperation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to perform a task by weighting their outputs based on the input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models to track system parameters across different time-scales.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models under a gating network to perform a task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple specialized models, known as experts, through a gating mechanism to handle different input partitions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines several specialized models to perform a task by weighting their contributions based on the input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines several specialized sub-models, known as experts, via a gating network to handle different parts of the input space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that uses a gating network to assign inputs to specialized sub-networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that employs multiple specialized models to handle diverse input distortions or tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model composed of a classifier and several regressors used to handle discontinuities in parameter-solution mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that combines multiple local experts through a routing mechanism to handle complex data distributions in regression tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that activates only a sparse subset of specialized subnetworks for any given input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that assigns a specific task to different specialized models based on the current context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines multiple specialized learners through a gating network to improve modeling flexibility.</rdfs:comment>
