    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines multiple specialized sub-models to handle diverse input contexts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines multiple specialized sub-models via a gating mechanism to perform a task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines multiple specialized sub-networks to handle different parts of the input space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines several specialized models through a gating network to make a final prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture that combines several specialized networks through a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular architecture where a gating network determines which specialist model is best suited for a given input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular framework that pools together multiple specialized networks to improve collective capacity and computational efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular neural network architecture that assigns different inputs to specialized sub-networks via a gating mechanism.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that combines multiple specialized models via a gating mechanism to handle diverse data patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that consists of multiple specialized sub-networks and a gating mechanism to assign inputs to the most relevant expert.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that scales parameter size independently from computational demand by activating only a subset of the network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sparse neural network architecture that activates only a subset of its parameters for each input to improve scaling efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sparse neural network architecture that activates only a subset of specialized sub-networks for each input.</rdfs:comment>
