  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#graph_convolutional_neural_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Graph Convolutional Neural Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to capture spatial and temporal relationships in data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to extract spatiotemporal dependencies from graph-structured traffic data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating neighbor information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating neighborhood information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to perform convolutions on data represented as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to perform convolutions on data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to perform convolutions on graph-structured data to extract spatial and spectral features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture designed to process data structured as graphs by leveraging topological relationships.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that applies convolutional filters to graph-structured data by exploiting local motifs or spectral properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that applies convolutional operations to data structured as graphs to learn node or graph representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that applies spectral filters to build representations of graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that generalizes convolutional kernels to data organized as non-trivial topologies like graphs or trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that operates directly on graph structures to capture topological features of the data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that operates directly on graph-structured data to learn representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that operates directly on non-Euclidean weighted graph data to predict material responses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that performs feature extraction via convolution and pooling operations on non-Euclidean graph structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that aggregates information from a node's neighborhood to learn embeddings in a graph structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that applies convolution operations over graph-structured data to learn node or graph representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that applies convolution operations to data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generalization of convolutional neural networks that applies spatial convolutions using random walks to process graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture designed to operate directly on data structured as graphs to capture topological relationships.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that operates directly on graphs to learn predictive features for arbitrary sizes and shapes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed for semi-supervised classification on graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to analyze data with irregular structures by learning feature maps from graph matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to extract spatial relations and features from data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph structures by aggregating features from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating features from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
