    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graphs by aggregating information from a node's neighborhood.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graphs by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate directly on graphs by leveraging both graph structure and node feature information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate on graph-structured data to improve scheduling performance in networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to operate on signals defined on irregular domains modeled as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolution operations on graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolutions on data represented as graphs rather than regular grids.</rdfs:comment>
