    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolutions on data structured as graphs rather than grids.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolutions on data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
