    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform convolutions over irregular graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to perform inferencing on graph-structured data by utilizing convolutional operations on nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to process data structured as graphs by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to process data structured as graphs by applying convolutional operations over nodes and edges.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture extending the convolution operation to data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolution operations over graph-structured data to capture spatial dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
