    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional filters to graph-structured data to capture spatial dependencies between nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations over graph structures to solve combinatorial optimization problems like the multicut problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations over graph-structured data to capture action characteristics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations over graph-structured data to learn node or graph embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies convolutional operations to data structured as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that defines convolution and pooling operators directly on non-euclidean graph data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that extends classical convolutions to graph-structured data by learning graphs and node features jointly.</rdfs:comment>
