    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that generalizes the scattering transform to graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns representations of graph-structured data by applying linear convolutions over the graph shift operator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates directly on graph-structured data by aggregating information from neighboring nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates directly on graph-structured data to extract high-level representations from nodes and their neighbors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates directly on graph-structured data to learn hierarchical representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates directly on graph-structured data to learn representations of nodes and edges.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates on graph-structured data to capture relationships between entities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates on graph-structured data to capture spatial and functional connectivity between nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates on graph-structured data to learn variable selection policies for combinatorial optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that operates on relational graphs to localize molecular substructures contributing to chemical properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that performs convolutions on graph-structured data to predict links between nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that replaces standard convolution with graph filters to process signals on irregular domains.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that utilizes gene interaction graphs to impose structural bias on gene expression data analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network designed to perform convolutions on data structured as graphs to capture geometric constraints.</rdfs:comment>
