  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#semidefinite_programming">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Semidefinite Programming</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization approach used for the robust certification of neural networks to ensure safety in critical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization problem that can be solved using low-rank factorization and coordinate ascent methods for large-scale problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization problem that involves minimizing a linear function over the intersection of the cone of positive semidefinite matrices and affine constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization problem that involves optimizing a linear function over the cone of positive semidefinite matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization problem used in machine learning and robotics that involves optimizing a linear function over the intersection of the cone of positive semidefinite matrices and an affine space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used here to create tight relaxations of maximum likelihood estimators for recovery problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to certify the robust stability of reinforcement learning policies when integrated with nonlinear dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to estimate the Lipschitz constants of neural networks for robustness guarantees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to find global solutions for non-convex problems like inverse kinematics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to find solutions for graph clustering and bisection problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to find the optimal solution of a problem by relaxing a discrete objective into a continuous matrix form.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to perform exact inference in latent models without knowing the latent variables or their domain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to provide exact global solutions for training two-layer neural networks with polynomial activations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A convex optimization technique used to solve computationally hard problems by relaxing them into a semidefinite form.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical optimization technique used to estimate the Lipschitz constant of neural networks for assessing smoothness and robustness.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A optimization framework that handles linear objective functions subject to linear matrix inequality constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that deals with optimizing a linear objective function over the intersection of the cone of positive semidefinite matrices with an affine space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that deals with the optimization of a linear objective over the cone of positive semidefinite matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that deals with the optimization of linear functions over the PSD cone.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that deals with the optimization of linear functions over the cone of positive semidefinite matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that optimizes a linear objective function over the intersection of the cone of positive semidefinite matrices with an affine space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization that solves problems where a matrix variable is constrained to be positive semidefinite.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A subfield of convex optimization used to minimize a linear function over the intersection of the cone of positive semidefinite matrices with an affine space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization framework that minimizes a linear objective function over the cone of positive semidefinite matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization framework used to infer polynomial and spline marginal value functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[the robust certification of neural networks to ensure safety in critical systems] robust certification of neural networks to ensure safety in critical systems</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[low-rank factorization and coordinate ascent methods] low-rank factorization and coordinate ascent methods</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[certify the robust stability of reinforcement learning policies when integrated with nonlinear dynamical systems] certify the robust stability of reinforcement learning policies when integrated with nonlinear dynamical systems</rdfs:comment>
