    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that converts spoken language into written text using end-to-end models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that converts spoken audio signals into written text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that converts spoken language into text using CTC-CRF based frameworks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technology that converts an acoustic signal into a sequence of words or text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technology that converts an acoustic signal into a sequence of words.</rdfs:comment>
