    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A search method that uses evolutionary algorithms to optimize the architecture of artificial neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary algorithm used to automatically optimize the architecture and parameters of neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary computation method used to automatically identify the optimal architecture and hyperparameters of neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary computation method used to optimize the architecture and weights of neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An evolutionary computing approach used to optimize the architecture and hyperparameters of neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
