  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#attributionmethod">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Attributionmethod</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A local explanation technique that assigns the contribution of each input feature to a deep network's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A systematic approach for determining the relative importance of specific neurons or components in a deep neural network for a given computation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for explaining model predictions by assigning importance scores to specific input features or training samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that assigns relevance scores to input variables to explain the decision-making process of a machine learning model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that decomposes model predictions into additive contribution scores for input segments to enhance interpretability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that explains a neural network's prediction by highlighting the most relevant input regions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that identifies which input features most significantly influence a neural network's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique used to explain model predictions by assigning importance scores to the input features that most influenced the output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique used to explain the decision-making process of a model by assigning importance scores to individual input features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique used to interrogate deep neural networks to reveal the specific features or fragments causally involved in a prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A visualization technique used to identify which input features are most influential in determining the output of a deep neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An explainability technique that assigns importance scores to individual input features to justify a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An explainability technique that assigns relevance scores to input features to determine their influence on a model's output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An explainable AI technique used to identify which parts of the input data most significantly contribute to a model's specific decision.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An interpretability technique that assigns importance scores to input features to explain a model's output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An interpretability technique that assigns importance scores to input features to explain a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[explain model predictions by assigning importance scores to the input features that most influenced the output, explain the decision-making process of a model by assigning importance scores to individual input features] explain the decision-making process of a model by assigning importance scores to individual input features</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[interrogate deep neural networks to reveal the specific features or fragments causally involved in a prediction] interrogate deep neural networks to reveal the specific features or fragments causally involved in a prediction</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[identify which input features are most influential in determining the output of a deep neural network] identify which input features are most influential in determining the output of a deep neural network</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[importance/relevance scores to input features] influential input features/data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[importance of neurons or components] importance of neurons or components</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[model predictions into contribution scores] model predictions into contribution scores</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[relevant input regions] relevant input regions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[influential input features/data] influential input features/data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[importance scores to input features] influential input features/data</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A local explanation technique that assigns the contribution of each input feature to a deep network's prediction.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A systematic approach for determining the relative importance of specific neurons or components in a deep neural network for a given computation.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique for explaining model predictions by assigning importance scores to specific input features or training samples.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A technique that assigns relevance scores to input variables to explain the decision-making process of a machine learning model.</skos:definition>
