  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#linear_quadratic_regulator">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Linear Quadratic Regulator</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control algorithm that optimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear system with unknown dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control algorithm used to stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control framework used to regulate a linear dynamical system perturbed by environmental noise to minimize a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control law that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control law that provides an optimal feedback controller for linear systems, here approximated by neural network architectures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control law used to stabilize a linear system while minimizing a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control theory benchmark used to optimize the behavior of dynamical systems with continuous state and action spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A control-theoretic framework used to find an optimal control law for a linear dynamical system to minimize a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control algorithm used to stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function over a given time horizon.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control framework used to find a policy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function that minimizes the expected value of a quadratic cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function that minimizes the state and control effort.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for linear systems that minimizes a quadratic cost function over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for linear systems that minimizes a quadratic cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control problem used in reinforcement learning to minimize a quadratic cost function for linear dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimal control strategy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function, stabilize a linear system while minimizing a quadratic cost function, stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function over a given time horizon] stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[regulate a linear dynamical system perturbed by environmental noise to minimize a quadratic cost function, find an optimal control law for a linear dynamical system to minimize a quadratic cost function, find a policy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system] find a policy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimize the behavior of dynamical systems with continuous state and action spaces] optimize the behavior of dynamical systems with continuous state and action spaces</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[quadratic cost function] quadratic cost function</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[state and control effort] state and control effort</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimal feedback controller] optimal control law</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimal control law] optimal control law</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control algorithm that optimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear system with unknown dynamics.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control algorithm used to stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control framework used to regulate a linear dynamical system perturbed by environmental noise to minimize a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control law that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control law that provides an optimal feedback controller for linear systems, here approximated by neural network architectures.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control law used to stabilize a linear system while minimizing a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control theory benchmark used to optimize the behavior of dynamical systems with continuous state and action spaces.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A control-theoretic framework used to find an optimal control law for a linear dynamical system to minimize a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control algorithm used to stabilize linear systems by minimizing a quadratic cost function over a given time horizon.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control framework used to find a policy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function that minimizes the expected value of a quadratic cost.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function that minimizes the state and control effort.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for a linear system with a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for linear systems that minimizes a quadratic cost function over time.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control law for linear systems that minimizes a quadratic cost function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control problem used in reinforcement learning to minimize a quadratic cost function for linear dynamics.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An optimal control strategy that minimizes a quadratic cost function for a linear dynamical system.</skos:definition>
