    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Kernel Regression</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric method for estimating the conditional expectation of a variable using kernel functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric method that uses kernel functions to estimate the conditional expectation of a target variable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric regression method that uses a kernel function to estimate the conditional expectation of a random variable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric technique for estimating the conditional expectation of a random variable given an explanatory variable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric technique for predicting output vectors that are smooth over a graph, utilizing L1 and L2 norms to handle sparse noise.</rdfs:comment>
