  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#multimodallearning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Multimodallearning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where a model learns to process and integrate information from different types of data modalities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that combines information from different sensory inputs, such as vision and audio.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that integrates information from different types of data, such as text and images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that extracts alignments between different data types, such as speech and images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates and processes information from multiple different types of data sources, such as text and images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates diverse data types, such as audio and images, to improve recognition performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from different data types, such as imaging and clinical data, to make predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from different modalities, such as audio signals and text.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from different types of data sources, such as text and images, to learn shared representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from different types of data, such as text and images, to perform a task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from different types of data, such as time-series signals and clinical notes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data modalities, such as image and audio, to improve classification performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data sources or representations to improve model performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data sources, such as audio and visual signals, to improve classification robustness.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data types to create a unified representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data types to improve task performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple data types, such as images and text, to improve prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple different data modalities to improve predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple different data modalities to improve task performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple different data sources to improve predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates information from multiple different types of data sources to improve model performance.</rdfs:comment>
