  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#simulated_annealing">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Simulated Annealing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metaheuristic optimization algorithm that accepts or rejects candidate solutions based on a probability that decreases over time to avoid local minima.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic metaheuristic for finding the global optimum of a discrete objective function by mimicking the cooling process of metals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic metaheuristic for finding the global optimum of a given function by mimicking the cooling process of metals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic optimization algorithm used to find a global optimum in a large search space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic optimization technique inspired by metallurgy that uses a cooling schedule to find a global minimum of a cost function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic optimization technique that allows a model to escape local minima by occasionally accepting worse solutions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic optimization technique that mimics the heating and cooling of materials to find a global minimum in a complex space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function by exploring the search space with a temperature-controlled random walk.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function by gradually decreasing a temperature parameter.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function by mimicking the cooling process of metals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function through a random walk.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function, applied here to the Expectation-Maximisation algorithm.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique for approximating the global optimum of a given function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic global optimization technique that explores a search space to find a minimum or maximum of a function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[find a global optimum in a large search space] find a global optimum in a large search space</rdfs:comment>
