    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data analysis technique that extracts the main trend from a high-dimensional dataset by constructing similarity graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data transformation process that reduces the number of random variables under consideration by obtaining a set of principal variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data transformation process that reduces the number of random variables under consideration to simplify visualization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feature transformation process that reduces the number of random variables under consideration by obtaining a set of principal variables.</rdfs:comment>
