  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#sparse_subspace_clustering">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sparse Subspace Clustering</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A clustering technique that represents data points as sparse linear combinations of other points to identify underlying subspaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses a coefficient matrix and an affinity matrix to group high-dimensional data into subspaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A grouping technique that partitions data into multiple linear subspaces by enforcing sparsity in the representation coefficients.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm for partitioning unlabeled data points into clusters where each cluster lies on a low-dimensional linear subspace.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that clusters data points lying in a union of low-dimensional subspaces by solving a sparse optimization program.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that identifies groups of layers with identical community structures in multiplex networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An explainable AI method used to discover concept subspaces within hidden feature layers of a model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning algorithm that groups data points based on their membership in a union of linear subspaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning algorithm that groups data points by representing each point as a sparse linear combination of others.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning algorithm that represents data points as sparse linear combinations of other points to identify underlying subspaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that groups data points by representing each point as a sparse linear combination of others from the same subspace.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that groups data points by representing each point as a sparse linear combination of others in the same subspace.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that groups data points by representing each point as a sparse linear combination of others.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that groups data points into their underlying linear subspaces by representing each point as a sparse linear combination of others.</rdfs:comment>
