  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#conditional_variational_autoencoder">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Conditional Variational Autoencoder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework that learns to disentangle latent representations to synthesize new data views based on specific conditions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that allows for the control of specific properties of the generated data by conditioning the latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that conditions the latent space on auxiliary information to control the properties of the generated output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that distills external knowledge from a corpus to generate long financial reports from news articles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that encodes data into a latent space conditioned on auxiliary information to construct probabilistic models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that extends the standard variational autoencoder by conditioning the generation process on auxiliary covariates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that extends the variational autoencoder by conditioning the latent space on additional information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that extracts subject-specific adjustments to data conditioned on task-specific representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that incorporates auxiliary information to control the properties of the generated data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that incorporates auxiliary information to guide the generation of data samples from a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that incorporates auxiliary information to produce data samples with specific desired properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a conditional probability distribution to produce spherical images from single field-of-view images using latent variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent distribution of motion changes conditioned on specific input observations to reconstruct 3D poses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation conditioned on specific attributes to control the properties of the output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data and generates new samples conditioned on specific input information, such as molecular graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional information to generate specific outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional information to generate specific types of samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional information to handle one-to-many mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional information to handle surjective mappings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on additional information to perform tasks like shape completion.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on an external variable to produce diverse and plausible outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information to generate specific outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information to generate specific samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information to perform structured prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information to produce diverse outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on external information to predict future states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific attributes to synthesize new samples with desired properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific auxiliary information to generate targeted samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific auxiliary variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific labels to allow for controlled generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific labels to generate new, intent-specific samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific labels to generate new, realistic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific labels to produce diverse text outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific labels to synthesize new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on specific variables to generate realistic scenarios.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent space to control the generation of sequential data based on specific conditions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a latent space to produce multi-modal future trajectory predictions based on specific conditions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a sampling distribution from demonstrations to bias motion planning in robotic systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns disentangled representations by conditioning the latent space on specific nuisance or sensitive variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns latent representations and allows for the production of outputs based on specific input labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns latent representations of data conditioned on specific auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns probability distributions conditioned on both current state and potential future actions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns the decomposition of inputs and the distributions of resulting components to perform classification tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces Bayesian posterior probability estimates conditioned on specific input parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces a multimodal probability distribution over future trajectories conditioned on specific input variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces data samples conditioned on specific labels to provide control over the output attributes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces diverse plausible trajectories by conditioning the latent space on past motion and scene context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that produces multiple plausible hypotheses for a given input by conditioning the latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that synthesizes diverse 3D human poses conditioned on an estimated 2D pose.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a conditional latent space to solve combinatorial optimization problems like linear sum assignment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses latent variables and a hybrid decoder to produce thematic content based on specific keywords or topics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model used to detect imperceptible adversarial perturbations in image classification networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model used to infer 3D position and pose from sensor data by combining data-driven emulation with domain expertise.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative network that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information for scenario generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A latent variable model that integrates representation vectors with a transformer-based architecture to enhance controllability in neural story generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic generative model that learns a latent representation of data conditioned on auxiliary information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic graphical model that learns latent representations by explicitly capturing characteristics associated with provided labels.</rdfs:comment>
