    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses a random matrix to map high-dimensional data into a lower-dimensional space while preserving distances.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses a random matrix to project high-dimensional data into a lower-dimensional space.</rdfs:comment>
