    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A preprocessing technique that fills in gaps in industrial datasets caused by sensor unavailability.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A process of filling missing entries in a dataset using a probabilistic framework based on deep generative models.</skos:definition>
