    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to estimate target variables that are only available at the group level rather than for individual observations.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to map the counterfactual distribution of a system's natural regime to the distribution of a disrupted system.</skos:definition>
