  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#contextual_bandits">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Contextual Bandits</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making algorithm that chooses an action based on a set of context features to maximize immediate reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that balances exploration and exploitation based on observed covariates to minimize regret.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that balances exploration and exploitation by associating rewards with specific environmental contexts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that learns a reward model based on contextual information to maximize long-term rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that learns an optimal action based on observed side information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that learns to choose the best action based on a given set of side information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that learns to choose the best action based on a set of observed features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that leverages side-information to select the optimal action among multiple options.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that selects actions based on contextual information to maximize cumulative rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that selects actions based on observed side information to maximize cumulative rewards over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that selects actions based on side information to maximize cumulative rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that selects an action based on side information to maximize cumulative reward while minimizing regret.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework where an agent chooses an action based on a context to maximize a cumulative reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework where an agent chooses an action based on context to maximize a cumulative reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making model that chooses an action based on side information to maximize cumulative rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making model that selects an action based on side information to maximize cumulative rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making problem where an agent chooses an action based on observed side-information to maximize reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making problem where the agent chooses an action based on side information to maximize rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that selects actions based on observed side information to maximize long-term rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework where an agent chooses actions based on side information to maximize cumulative rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning problem where an agent chooses actions based on side information to maximize cumulative reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning problem where an agent chooses an action based on observed side information to maximize a reward.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework for sequential decision making where actions are chosen based on observed side information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework for sequential decision making where an agent chooses an action based on observed side information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning problem where an agent must balance exploration and exploitation based on a set of features describing the current state.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-armed bandit framework where the learner uses side information about the environment to make decisions and maximize rewards.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-armed bandit variant where the agent utilizes predictive side information to predict rewards for different arms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-armed bandit variant where the learner uses side information to predict the best action to take.</rdfs:comment>
