  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#visualanalytics">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Visualanalytics</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that combines interactive visualization with data analysis to help experts understand complex model behaviors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that combines interactive visualizations with data analysis to help users explore and understand model vulnerabilities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A human-centered approach that uses interactive visualizations to interpret and debug deep learning models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology combining interactive visualizations and interpretable models to provide insights into the predictions of recurrent neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that combines automated analysis with interactive visualizations to provide insights into the design or training of machine learning models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that combines automated data analysis with interactive visualizations to help analysts identify and correct concept drift in data streams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that combines interactive visualization with data analysis to interpret the internal states of complex models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that combines interactive visualization with data analysis to support human investigation of data distribution shifts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A science of analytical reasoning facilitated by interactive visual interfaces to explore and understand complex data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A science of analytical reasoning facilitated by interactive visual interfaces to understand complex data patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A science of analyzing data through the combination of automated analysis and interactive visualization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A scientific approach that combines automated analysis with interactive visualizations to help humans interpret the behavior of complex machine learning models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines interactive data visualization with analytic techniques to promote sensemaking and reasoning over complex data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines interactive visualization with data analysis to help developers tune hyperparameters of machine learning models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines interactive visualizations and data analysis techniques to help users understand complex model behaviors.</rdfs:comment>
