  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#matrix_factorization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Matrix Factorization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering approach that decomposes preference matrices into latent feature vectors for context-aware recommendations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering method that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into low-dimensional latent factors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering method that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into lower-dimensional latent factors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a large rating matrix into lower-dimensional latent factor matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into latent feature vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into low-dimensional latent factors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into lower-dimensional latent factor matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into lower-dimensional latent factors for recommendation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative filtering technique that decomposes a user-item interaction matrix into lower-dimensional latent factors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that decomposes large parameter matrices into products of smaller matrices to reduce the number of learnable parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational technique that decomposes a large matrix into a product of smaller matrices to reduce memory and processing requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that factors a large matrix into the product of two lower-dimensional matrices to uncover latent features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that represents a matrix as a product of two smaller matrices to uncover latent factors in ordinal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique adapted with causal inference methods to provide unbiased performance estimators in biased recommender system data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that breaks a large matrix into smaller matrices to uncover latent features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that breaks a large matrix into the product of smaller matrices to uncover latent features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that breaks a large matrix into the product of two smaller lower-rank matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that breaks a matrix into constituent parts to uncover latent thematic structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that represents a large matrix as the product of smaller matrices to reveal latent structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique that represents a large matrix as the product of two smaller matrices to discover latent features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition technique used to represent users and items as latent vectors in a recommendation system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction approach that decomposes a large matrix into the product of two lower-rank matrices.</rdfs:comment>
