    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that integrates an external memory component to store and retrieve information for solving algorithmic tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that integrates an external memory module to store and retrieve information for complex tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that integrates external storage mechanisms to learn scalable algorithmic strategies.</rdfs:comment>
