  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#online_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Online Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that sequentially updates a model as new data arrives rather than training on a static dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated incrementally as new data arrives in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated incrementally as new data arrives in a sequential stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated incrementally as new data instances arrive sequentially.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated sequentially as new data arrives in a real-time stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated sequentially as new data arrives.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model is updated sequentially as new data points arrive over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a model updates its parameters continuously as new data arrives in a real-time stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where data is processed sequentially and the model is updated in real-time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework where a model is updated sequentially as data arrives in a stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method where a model is updated incrementally as new data arrives in a continuous stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method where a model is updated sequentially as new data arrives in a stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method where data is processed sequentially, and the model is updated in real-time as new instances arrive.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational paradigm where a model is updated incrementally as data arrives in a sequential stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational paradigm where a model is updated sequentially as data arrives in a real-time stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational paradigm where a model is updated sequentially as new data arrives.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for exploring resource consumption distributions and allocating limited resources to heterogeneous customers over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework where a model is updated incrementally as new data arrives in a sequential manner.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model is incrementally updated as new data samples arrive in a continuous stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model is updated sequentially as new data points arrive in a real-time stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework where a model receives data in a sequential stream and updates its parameters based on adversarial feedback.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework where a model updates its parameters incrementally as data arrives in a sequential stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework where data is processed sequentially and the model is updated in real-time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning method where data is processed incrementally, allowing a model to update its knowledge in real-time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning method where data is processed sequentially and the model is updated in real-time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning methodology where the model updates its parameters sequentially as data arrives in a real-time stream.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that allows a model to be updated incrementally from new data without requiring full retraining or redeployment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that processes data sequentially and aims to minimize mistakes over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is updated incrementally as data arrives in a sequence, often using expert advice to minimize regret.</rdfs:comment>
