    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning architecture that combines a value-based critic to evaluate actions and a policy-based actor to select them.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning architecture that combines value-based and policy-based methods to model decision-making processes.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning architecture that combines value-based and policy-based methods to optimize agent behavior.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning architecture that employs a surrogate model to predict performance and a policy to be optimized.</skos:definition>
