  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#siamese_neural_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Siamese Neural Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A double-input neural network architecture trained with a contrastive loss function to verify the similarity between two inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of twin subnetworks used to find the similarity or distance between two different input samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of twin subnetworks used to learn similarity between input pairs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to measure the similarity between two input samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that share weights to compare two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that share weights to determine the similarity between two input samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that share weights to learn similarity measures between pairs of inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used here to detect change-points in EEG data for seizure prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to determine the similarity between two input images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to find the similarity between two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to find the similarity or distance between two inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to find the similarity or logical relation between two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn a similarity metric between pairs of inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn similarity and dissimilarity between pairs of inputs via contrastive loss.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn similarity metrics between pairs of inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture containing two identical subnetworks used to determine the similarity between two inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture containing two identical subnetworks used to find the similarity between two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A network architecture with two identical subnetworks that learn to determine the similarity between two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to compare the similarity between two inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to determine the similarity between different input samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to determine the similarity between two inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to measure the similarity between two input samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that learn to produce similar embeddings for similar inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks that share weights to learn similarity metrics between input pairs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to find the similarity between two different inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn discriminative feature representations for similarity tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn similarity embeddings between pairs of inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to learn similarity mappings for object tracking.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of two identical subnetworks used to perform pair-wise comparisons for ranking.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that compares pairs of images to predict malignancy in medical screening exams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that employs multiple weight-sharing subnetworks to learn similarity metrics.</rdfs:comment>
