    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[reasoning process] reasoning process</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[interpretable predictions, justifications for predictions] interpretable predictions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[feature-based explanations] feature-based explanations</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[internal logic and outcomes of models] model decisions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[understandable models] understandable models</rdfs:comment>
