    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning approach that enables a model to recognize or perform tasks on classes or languages it has not seen during training.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning approach that enables a model to recognize or predict items from categories it has never seen during training.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning capability that allows a model to recognize classes it has never seen during training.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that enables a model to predict unseen labels by leveraging semantic relationships between classes.</skos:definition>
