  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#n_a_redundant">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">N/A (Redundant)</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms capable of producing fluent and complex synthetic data, such as music, through learned distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of artificial intelligence models that learn the underlying probability distribution of data through graphical modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of machine learning models designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of models, including WGANs and VAEs, used for population synthesis to estimate rare combinations of feature attributes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural networks designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural networks that learns prior distributions from complex data for use in Bayesian inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural networks trained to approximate the underlying probability distribution of a given training dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of unsupervised deep learning algorithms designed to discover natural feature sets within a given dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data synthesizer that captures complex underlying distributions to create synthetic tabular data for augmenting imbalanced datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative framework leveraging deep neural networks to detect anomalies in images using an unregularized score.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical framework that learns a representation to synthesize new image data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of a dataset to synthesize new, similar data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to synthesize new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of data through an invertible top-down and bottom-up process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that learns the probability distribution of a dataset to synthesize new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that learns the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of learning complex data distributions to synthesize new, realistic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of learning the joint probability distribution of data to generate new synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of learning the underlying distribution of a dataset to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of producing new data samples that mimic the distribution of a training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture capable of producing synthetic data that mimics the distribution of complex network structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of a dataset to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of a dataset to generate new, similar synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data for unsupervised or semi-supervised learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to generate new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to generate new, plausible samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to generate new, similar samples such as molecular structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to generate new, synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to synthesize new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of data to synthesize new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying distribution of molecular graphs to optimize chemical properties through fragment modification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new, similar data samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of a dataset to generate new, synthetic samples.</rdfs:comment>
