    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of data to generate new samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture designed to learn the underlying probability distribution of data to generate new, similar samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns a prior distribution from synthetic data to improve the reconstruction of ill-conditioned inverse problems.</rdfs:comment>
