    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns the underlying distribution of a dataset to generate new, synthetic data samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that learns the underlying distribution of a dataset to synthesize new samples.</rdfs:comment>
