  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#self_supervised_representation_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Self Supervised Representation Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that extracts meaningful features from unlabeled data by creating pretext tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses pretext tasks, such as predicting visual word histograms, to learn image features from unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that creates supervisory signals from the data itself to learn latent embeddings without the need for semantic labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that derives informative features from unlabeled data by solving an auxiliary pretext task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts global and local structural properties from unlabeled data to create contextualized embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts meaningful features from unlabeled data without the need for explicit human-annotated labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts useful features from unlabeled data by creating pretext tasks from the data itself.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts useful features from unlabeled data by creating proxy tasks from the data itself.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that extracts useful features from unlabeled data by creating surrogate tasks to provide supervision.</rdfs:comment>
