  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#model_pruning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Model Pruning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression method that improves efficiency by removing redundant weights or connections from a neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression process that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to reduce its memory footprint.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression strategy that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that introduces zeros into model weights to reduce computation and memory requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that reduces the number of parameters in a neural network to improve deployment efficiency on resource-constrained devices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant connections in a neural network to optimize performance and efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant or unimportant weights from a neural network to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant or unimportant weights from a neural network to reduce its size and computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to create a more lightweight architecture.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to reduce computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to reduce its size and computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters from a neural network to reduce size and latency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters or filters from a trained network to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant parameters or neurons from a neural network to improve efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant weights from a neural network to reduce size and increase speed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant weights or blocks from a neural network to reduce computational overhead.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant weights or neurons from a neural network to reduce its size and complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that removes redundant weights or neurons from a neural network to reduce its size and computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
