    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression technique that induces sparsity in connection matrices to reduce the number of nonzero parameters in a neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression technique that removes redundant parameters or tokens to improve hardware efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of removing unnecessary parameters from a neural network to create a lighter model without significant loss of accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
