  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#gaussian_process_regression">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gaussian Process Regression</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian approach to regression that provides a probabilistic distribution over possible functions to fit a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian inference framework that uses a hierarchical Gaussian process to represent time-evolving interdependencies in sparse signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric approach that defines a distribution over functions to perform regression and quantify uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric approach that uses kernels to model the relationship between inputs and outputs for tasks like audio source separation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric approach used to infer the parameters of a dynamical system from time-series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric method used for regression that provides a distribution over possible functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model that provides predictions along with an associated measure of uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for estimating unknown functions by defining a distribution over functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for learning unknown dynamical systems that provides implicit quantification of model uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for modeling functions that provides uncertainty estimates for predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for modeling the distribution of a function to perform regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for modeling unknown functions by assuming a distribution over functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for reconstructing spatio-temporal dynamical processes from sparse and noisy data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach for regression that uses a kernel-based method to provide predictive mean and uncertainty quantification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach that models a function as a collection of random variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian approach that models the distribution of functions to perform regression tasks.</rdfs:comment>
