    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to an input vector designed to cause a machine learning model to produce an incorrect output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning classifier to make a mistake.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning classifier to make an incorrect prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning model to make a mistake.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning model to make an incorrect prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning model to misclassify the input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning model to produce an incorrect output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, intentional modification to input data designed to cause a machine learning system to misclassify an input.</rdfs:comment>
