  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#quantized_neural_network">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Quantized Neural Network</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compressed model where weights and activations are represented with low-precision integers to reduce computational requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compressed model where weights and activations are represented with lower-precision integers to reduce memory and computation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that uses low-precision numerical representations for weights and activations to reduce memory and compute.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that uses low-precision representations for weights and activations to reduce hardware resource requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture that uses low-precision weights and activations to reduce computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that uses low-precision synaptic weights to reduce energy consumption and memory requirements during inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning model that uses lower-precision numerical representations for weights and activations to improve efficiency on hardware.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A memory-efficient architecture that uses low-precision weight and activation values to reduce computational complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that reduces the precision of weights and activations to lower memory usage and computational cost.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that represents weights and activations with a finite level of precision to reduce energy and computational costs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that uses low bitwidth numbers for representing parameters and performing computations to reduce complexity and memory usage.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that uses low-precision weights to enable efficient inference and training on embedded platforms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model where weights and activations are constrained to a small set of discrete values to reduce memory and computation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model where weights and activations are represented with low-precision discrete values to reduce resource consumption.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that constrains the number of distinct weight values to reduce memory and storage requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses extremely low precision weights and activations to reduce memory and power consumption.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that uses low bit-width fixed-point numbers instead of floating-point values for weights and activations to reduce resource consumption.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that uses low-precision weights and activations to reduce energy consumption and memory usage.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that uses low-precision weights, such as binary weights, to reduce computational complexity and memory usage during inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that uses lower-precision numerical representations for weights and activations to increase efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
