    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that utilizes training data with imprecise, noisy, or partially specified annotations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained using a combination of a few strong labels and a larger number of weak labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where the training data is provided with imprecise, noisy or limited labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that trains models using imprecise or noisy labels, such as using only negative cases to learn a baseline appearance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that uses noisy or limited labels to improve context inference models on mobile devices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that utilizes imprecise or global annotations to perform tasks like classification and localization.</rdfs:comment>
