  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#personalized_federated_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Personalized Federated Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative learning approach that adapts a global model to the specific data distribution of individual clients.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative learning approach that trains customized models for multiple clients while accounting for data disparities and reducing communication costs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative learning paradigm that tailors a global machine learning model to the specific data distribution of each client.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative machine learning approach that trains a global model while allowing for client-specific adaptations to handle statistical diversity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A collaborative training approach that tailors a global model to individual clients using hybrid pruning of subnetworks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decentralized learning approach that accommodates data heterogeneity to perform well on party-specific datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decentralized learning approach that adapts a global model to the specific needs or data distributions of individual users.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decentralized learning approach that adapts a shared global model to better suit the local data distributions of individual clients.</rdfs:comment>
