    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique that approximates a hard optimization problem with a simpler convex one to find a tractable solution.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique that approximates a non-convex optimization problem with a convex one to make it computationally tractable.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique that approximates a non-convex optimization problem with a convex one to provide certifiable robustness bounds.</skos:definition>
