  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#vector_quantization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Vector Quantization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that represents high-dimensional data using a discrete set of reference vectors to reduce computational complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data compression technique that generates a discrete, low-dimensional representation of high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A discretization method that converts continuous latent representations into a finite set of discrete codes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression method that maps a large set of vectors to a finite set of prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression technique that maps a large set of points in a continuous space to a finite set of discrete representative vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression technique that maps a large set of points in a high-dimensional space to a smaller set of representative vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression technique that maps a large set of vectors to a finite set of prototype vectors to reduce model size.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression technique that maps a large set of vectors to a finite set of representative prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy compression technique that maps a large set of vectors to a smaller set of representative prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy data compression method that maps a large set of points to a smaller set of representative vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A lossy data compression technique that maps a large set of vectors to a smaller set of representative prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for approximating a continuous signal by mapping it to a discrete set of representative vectors in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for discretizing latent features in a variational autoencoder to generate more natural speech samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal compression technique that maps a large set of points to a smaller set of representative vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that maps a large set of continuous vectors to a finite set of discrete prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that maps a large set of points to a smaller set of representative vectors using an energy function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that maps a large set of vectors to a smaller set of representative codevectors for dimensionality reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that maps a large set of vectors to a smaller set of representative prototype vectors.</rdfs:comment>
