  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#neural_process">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Neural Process</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of latent variable models that learn a distribution over functions to enable rapid adaptation to new observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of meta-learning models that map datasets to predictive stochastic processes to combine the strengths of neural networks and Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of models that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the ability of Gaussian processes to learn a distribution over functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of models that learn to map a context set of observations to a distribution over functions for regression tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of probabilistic models that combine the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of stochastic processes that combine the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty estimation of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of stochastic processes that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of models that encode distributions over functions into a latent representation to predict mean and variance at unknown locations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of variational models that combine neural networks with stochastic processes to represent functions with uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that combines the flexibility of Gaussian processes with the learning capabilities of neural networks to model uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns to map a set of observations to a stochastic process for predicting behaviors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural latent variable model designed to mimic the spatiotemporal dynamics of stochastic simulators.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural latent variable model that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the stochastic process properties of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic framework that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the properties of Gaussian processes to generate trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic framework that learns to map a context dataset to a predictive distribution for unseen data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic model that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty modeling of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process framework that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process model that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification capabilities of Gaussian processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[mimic the spatiotemporal dynamics of stochastic simulators] mimic the spatiotemporal dynamics of stochastic simulators</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[trajectories] trajectories</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a distribution over functions] distribution over functions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[datasets to predictive stochastic processes, observations/context dataset to a stochastic process/predictive distribution] datasets to predictive stochastic processes</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[neural networks and Gaussian processes, neural networks with Gaussian processes] neural networks and gaussian processes</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[distributions over functions into a latent representation] distributions over functions into a latent representation</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of latent variable models that learn a distribution over functions to enable rapid adaptation to new observations.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of meta-learning models that map datasets to predictive stochastic processes to combine the strengths of neural networks and Gaussian processes.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of models that combines the flexibility of neural networks with the ability of Gaussian processes to learn a distribution over functions.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of models that learn to map a context set of observations to a distribution over functions for regression tasks.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A class of probabilistic models that combine the flexibility of neural networks with the uncertainty quantification of Gaussian processes.</skos:definition>
