  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#modelextractionattack">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Modelextractionattack</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A black-box exploit where an adversary attempts to recreate a target model's functionality by querying its API.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A cryptanalytic method that uses differential queries at critical points to steal the parameters of a remote ReLU neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where a malicious actor builds a surrogate model by querying the API of a target model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to duplicate a machine learning model by querying it and observing the outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to recover the parameters of a proprietary neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to recreate a proprietary machine learning model by querying its API.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to recreate a target machine learning model by querying its outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to replicate a target machine learning model by querying it and observing the outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to replicate a target model's functionality by querying it and observing its outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary attempts to steal the internal functionality of a cloud-based model by querying its API.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary reconstructs a target model's functionality through query access.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary recovers a black-box model by observing its interactions with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary steals the functionality of a machine learning model by querying its API.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an adversary uses a query interface to steal a proprietary machine learning model by training a surrogate.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security threat where an attacker attempts to replicate a target model by querying it and observing its outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where an adversary attempts to recover the internal parameters of a proprietary machine learning model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where an adversary attempts to steal a private model's parameters via public queries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security vulnerability where an adversary reconstructs a target model by querying its API and observing the outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An adversarial attempt to replicate the functionality of a proprietary machine learning model by querying it and observing the outputs.</rdfs:comment>
