  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#uncertainty_estimation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Uncertainty Estimation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process that quantifies the level of confidence or doubt in a model's predictions to improve robustness and sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A diagnostic process that quantifies the lack of confidence in a model's prediction to detect out-of-distribution samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process used to evaluate the risks and confidence levels associated with model coefficients and output predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for quantifying the confidence of a model's prediction to identify potentially unreliable outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for quantifying the confidence or doubt associated with the predictions made by a machine learning model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for quantifying the confidence or reliability of a machine learning model's predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for quantifying the level of confidence or ambiguity associated with a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for quantifying the confidence or ambiguity associated with a model's predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that quantifies the degree of doubt in the predictions made by a statistical model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that quantifies the reliability or confidence level of a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring technique that identifies model deterioration in deployment environments when target labels are unavailable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive process that quantifies the confidence level of a model's output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive process that quantifies the reliability of a model's output to support clinical decision-making.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic process that quantifies the confidence of a model's predictions for structured prediction tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process in deep learning that quantifies the confidence level of a model's predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process in deep learning that quantifies the confidence or reliability of a model's predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process in machine learning that quantifies the confidence or doubt associated with a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process in predictive modeling that quantifies the level of confidence or doubt associated with a model's output.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of bounding the size of unaccounted for risk when applying deep learning to high-dimensional experimental data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of evaluating the probability that a model's prediction is correct, particularly under distribution shift.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's prediction to ensure reliability and safety.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's prediction to identify potentially erroneous outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's prediction to identify when an output is unreliable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's prediction to improve decision-making and active learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's predictions to handle out-of-distribution data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's predictions to identify potential errors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence level of a model's predictions to improve reliability in safety-critical tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence of a classifier's prediction to identify potentially biased or incorrect outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence of a data-driven model's output to ensure safety in autonomous systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence of a machine learning model's prediction to improve collaborative human-model systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence of a machine learning model's predictions to detect out-of-distribution or adversarial examples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence of a model's prediction by distinguishing between different types of predictive doubt.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of quantifying the confidence or doubt associated with a model's prediction.</rdfs:comment>
