    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Particle Swarm Optimization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational heuristic that optimizes a problem by iteratively moving and updating candidate solutions based on their own and their neighbors' best known positions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational heuristic that optimizes a problem by simulating the social behavior of a group of candidate solutions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that optimizes a problem by having a population of candidate solutions move through the search space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that optimizes a problem by iteratively adjusting a population of candidate solutions based on their own and others' success.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that optimizes a problem by iteratively moving a population of candidate solutions according to social and individual rules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method that optimizes a problem by iteratively moving a population of candidate solutions through the search space.</rdfs:comment>
