  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#score_matching">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Score Matching</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A density estimation technique that avoids the need for normalizing constants by matching the score of the data distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative modeling technique that estimates the gradient of the data distribution to produce samples via Langevin dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for estimating the gradient of the log-density of a probability distribution to facilitate the simulation of diffusion processes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for estimating the parameters of a probability distribution by minimizing the difference between the model's score function and the data's score function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for fitting distributions in the kernel exponential family by estimating the gradient of the log density.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for learning flexible unnormalized probabilistic models by matching the score of the model to the score of the data distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A parameter estimation method for density models that avoids computing intractable partition functions by matching the score of the model to the data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A parameter estimation method that avoids calculating the normalizing constant by matching the gradient of the log-density.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A parameter estimation tool for fitting unnormalized probability density models, specifically applied here to truncated densities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for estimating a probability density function by matching the score function, which is the gradient of the log-density.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unnormalized density estimation technique used to efficiently estimate model parameters via ridge regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[efficiently estimate model parameters via ridge regression] efficiently estimate model parameters via ridge regression</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[score of the data distribution] score of the data distribution</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[gradient of the data distribution] gradient of the data distribution</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[parameters of a probability distribution] parameters of a probability distribution</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[unnormalized probability density models] unnormalized probability density models</rdfs:comment>
