  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#masked_language_model">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Masked Language Model</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bidirectional neural network trained to predict hidden tokens in a sequence to improve speech recognition rescoring.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that predicts hidden tokens in a sequence to classify the composer of a music excerpt.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pre-training objective where a model predicts hidden tokens in a sequence to learn contextual representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pretrained transformer-based model that learns linguistic representations by predicting hidden tokens in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pretraining objective that predicts hidden tokens based on their surrounding context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A pretraining objective where a model predicts hidden tokens in a text sequence to learn language representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that turns natural language processing problems into classification tasks through contextual embeddings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised training objective where a model predicts hidden tokens in a sequence based on the surrounding context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A transformer-based architecture trained to predict hidden tokens within a text corpus to learn general language representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A transformer-based model trained to predict hidden tokens within a sentence to learn deep linguistic abstractions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of language model trained by predicting a proportion of corrupted input tokens to learn representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network architecture that predicts hidden tokens within a text sequence based on surrounding context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of neural network trained to predict hidden tokens within a text sequence to learn linguistic representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of transformer-based architecture trained to predict hidden tokens within a sequence of text.</rdfs:comment>
