  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#dictionary_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Dictionary Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data summarization technique that learns representative geometric atoms from a high-dimensional input space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that approximates an underlying subspace to obtain low-dimensional embeddings from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique that finds a sparse representation of data by learning a structured basis set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique that represents data as a sparse linear combination of a learned set of basis elements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for finding a sparse set of basis elements that can reconstruct the input data with minimal coefficients.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for learning a sparse representation of data from an overcomplete basis set to capture structural characteristics of images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method of finding a sparse representation of data by learning an overcomplete basis from the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method of learning an overcomplete basis set to represent data in a sparse manner.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method that decomposes data matrices into shared basis networks and subject-specific loadings for feature extraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method that learns an overcomplete set of basis functions to provide a sparse representation of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model compression approach that uses an optimized fast algorithm to mine dictionary atoms and adjust sparsity to reduce the size of recurrent neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of factorizing vector samples into a basis and sparse vectors using alternating minimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of finding a sparse representation of data by learning a set of basis elements called atoms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of finding a sparse representation of data by learning a set of basis vectors that can reconstruct the signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that finds a sparse representation of training data by iteratively updating a dictionary of atoms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that decomposes a signal into a linear combination of a small set of basis elements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that decomposes a signal into a sparse linear combination of basis elements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that decomposes a signal into a sparse linear combination of elements from a learned basis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that decomposes data into a sparse combination of learned basis elements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that discovers a sparse set of basis functions to describe underlying dynamical systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that discovers an overcomplete basis to sparsely encode input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a set of basis elements to describe data as a sparse linear combination.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse basis set to approximate input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse basis set to reconstruct input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse basis to represent a set of data signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis atoms to describe input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis elements to describe a given dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis elements to describe data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct input signals efficiently.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that identifies a set of basis elements to sparsely represent input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that identifies a set of basis elements used to sparsely represent input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning method that seeks to find a sparse set of elementary components that generate the observed data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning process that finds a sparse basis set used to reconstruct signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning task that determines a data-dependent transform to yield sparse representations of observed data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning task that finds a basis set such that signals can be represented sparsely.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning task that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent a given dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning task that recovers a basis matrix and latent vectors from nonlinear observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning task that recovers an overcomplete matrix from random examples of sparse signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that discovers a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis for approximating signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis for representing data in a lower-dimensional space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis set to describe signals as linear combinations of atoms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis set to reconstruct data using an L1 distortion metric for noise robustness.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis set to reconstruct input data signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis set to reconstruct input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse basis to decompose observed data into a set of atoms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to describe data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct input signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to reconstruct signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent a dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent data as a linear combination of a few atoms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning technique that finds a sparse set of basis elements to represent input data efficiently.</rdfs:comment>
