  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#tensor_decomposition">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tensor Decomposition</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational method for factoring multiway data arrays into simpler components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that factorizes a multi-dimensional array into a sum of simpler component tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that leverages compression to reduce the size of large tensors while attempting to preserve their low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that represents a high-dimensional tensor as a sum of low-rank components to reduce parameter counts in regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that breaks a high-order tensor into simpler components for spatiotemporal prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that factorizes a high-order tensor into a set of simpler components to compress data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that factorizes a high-order tensor into a set of simpler components to reduce parameter count.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that factors a high-order array into a set of simpler components to compress data or remove noise.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that models multi-way interactions between entities and relations in a knowledge graph.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A factorization method that breaks a high-order tensor into a sum of rank-one components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A factorization method that breaks down a multidimensional array into simpler components for unsupervised learning and data analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A factorization method that decomposes a multi-dimensional array into a sum of rank-one components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A factorization technique that decomposes a high-order array into a sum of simpler components to extract latent structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A heuristic method used for the unsupervised clustering of high-dimensional binary data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework used to estimate the hidden structure of latent variable models via spectral decomposition of moment tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method for decomposing a multi-dimensional array into simpler components to identify patterns and anomalies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method for factoring a high-order tensor into a sum of simpler components to uncover latent structures in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method for factoring a multi-dimensional array into a sum of simpler components to represent latent entities and events.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method for factoring multi-way arrays into simpler components to analyze complex data fusion tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method for factorizing a higher-order array into a sum of simpler components to uncover latent structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method that decomposes symmetric tensors into rank-1 components to handle noise and achieve high estimation accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method that factorizes a high-dimensional array into simpler components to reduce complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method that factorizes a multi-dimensional array into a set of lower-order components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method that factors a high-order tensor into a sum of simpler rank-one tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method used for learning parameters in latent variable models with nonlinearities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method used to compress neural network weights by approximating them as a sum of low-rank components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method used to predict multi-type associations between microRNAs and diseases by representing them as a tensor.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical method used to reduce the redundancy of convolution kernels by representing large tensors as products of smaller ones.</rdfs:comment>
