  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#predictive_maintenance">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Predictive Maintenance</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven approach that uses machine learning to detect failure modes and predict the remaining useful life of equipment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven strategy that predicts equipment failures to optimize maintenance schedules and reduce unexpected downtime.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning application that detects failures in machine components and estimates their future severity to prevent downtime.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that predicts upcoming machine failures to reduce maintenance costs and production losses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A maintenance strategy that uses machine learning models to predict equipment failure and optimize the timing of maintenance activities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring strategy that uses data analysis to predict equipment failure before it occurs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring strategy that uses data to anticipate equipment failures before they occur.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring strategy that uses data to predict equipment failure before it occurs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring strategy that uses deep learning to optimize maintenance tasks by predicting asset failures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring task that uses data-driven techniques to predict the failure of equipment before it occurs to optimize maintenance schedules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A monitoring task that uses sensor data to predict equipment failures and schedule maintenance before a breakdown occurs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A proactive monitoring approach that uses AI to forecast potential system failures before they occur.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A proactive strategy that uses machine learning to forecast network faults before they occur to minimize downtime.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that uses historical data and sensor inputs to forecast machine failures before they occur.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that uses sensor data or event logs to forecast machine failure and optimize maintenance schedules.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that uses data analysis to predict when equipment will fail so that maintenance can be performed just in time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that uses machine learning to forecast equipment failures before they occur based on system logs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An AI-driven approach that forecasts equipment failures to optimize maintenance schedules</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An industrial application that uses sensor data and machine learning to forecast the remaining useful life of a component.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data analysis, data] data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data-driven techniques] data-driven techniques</rdfs:comment>
