  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#extreme_learning_machine">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Extreme Learning Machine</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A fast-learning single-hidden-layer feedforward neural network where input weights are randomly assigned and only output weights are trained.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network that can be decomposed into subnetworks to enable parallel or incremental training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network that uses random weights for hidden layers and only optimizes the output weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network where hidden layer weights are randomly assigned and fixed, and only output weights are trained via linear least squares.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network where hidden layer weights are randomly assigned and only output weights are tuned.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network with a single hidden layer where the weights of the hidden nodes are randomly assigned and only the output weights are trained.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural network with random hidden nodes that allows for very high training speeds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feed-forward neural-network learning method that creates classification models from high-dimensional data sets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network architecture that utilizes random weights for hidden layers to accelerate training speed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network architecture that utilizes random weights for hidden nodes and analytically determines output weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network architecture used as a classifier that employs random hidden nodes and analytically determined output weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network architecture where hidden layer weights are randomly assigned and only output weights are trained.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network that achieves fast training by using random hidden layer weights and an analytical solution for output weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network that employs a stochastic gradient based online learning algorithm for faster training and stability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network that uses hypercomplex algebras for parameters and inputs to handle high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A feedforward neural network that utilizes random hidden nodes and optimizes only the output weights for fast training.</rdfs:comment>
