  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#malware_detection">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Malware Detection</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification task aimed at identifying malicious software binaries from benign files.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification task aimed at identifying malicious software files to protect computer systems from security threats.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification task that identifies malicious Android applications by analyzing app permissions and features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification task that identifies malicious software by analyzing binary images or behavioral features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification task that identifies malicious software samples based on their extracted features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software applications within a computing system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software based on its behavior or structural patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software before it can exploit a system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software by analyzing its binary code or behavioral patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software by analyzing static and dynamic features of applications.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that identifies malicious software using features extracted from opcode traces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that uses deep learning to identify and classify malicious network traffic from raw byte streams.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that uses machine learning to distinguish between benign files and malicious software.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that uses machine learning to distinguish between benign software and malicious mutations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that uses machine learning to identify malicious software based on its behavior or characteristics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A security task that uses machine learning to identify malicious software based on static or dynamic analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of identifying and classifying malicious software using either signature-based or machine learning-based tools.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[features extracted from opcode traces] features extracted from opcode traces</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[either signature-based or machine learning-based tools] either signature-based or machine learning-based tools</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[malicious software, malicious Android applications] malicious software</rdfs:comment>
