    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">F-Measure</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metric that provides a harmonic mean of precision and recall for evaluating classifier performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A metric used for the performance evaluation of classification algorithms, particularly on imbalanced datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A performance metric that combines precision and recall using a harmonic mean to evaluate classification algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A performance metric that computes the harmonic mean of precision and recall.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A performance metric that provides a balanced evaluation of precision and recall, especially for imbalanced datasets.</rdfs:comment>
