    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[balanced evaluation of precision and recall] balanced evaluation of precision and recall</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[evaluate a test by combining precision and recall into a single harmonic mean] evaluate a test by combining precision and recall into a single harmonic mean</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A metric that provides a harmonic mean of precision and recall for evaluating classifier performance.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A metric used for the performance evaluation of classification algorithms, particularly on imbalanced datasets.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A performance metric that combines precision and recall using a harmonic mean to evaluate classification algorithms.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A performance metric that computes the harmonic mean of precision and recall.</skos:definition>
