    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that reconstructs a high-resolution image from a low-resolution input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that reconstructs a high-resolution image from one or more low-resolution inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that reconstructs a high-resolution image or volume from one or more low-resolution inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that reconstructs high-resolution images from low-resolution inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that reconstructs high-resolution images or signals from low-resolution inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision technique that enhances the resolution of an image by reconstructing high-frequency details.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven technique used to reconstruct high-resolution direct numerical simulation data from lower-resolution large eddy simulation predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning task that enhances the spatial resolution of low-resolution images, such as fire risk exposure maps.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning task that recovers high-resolution signals from compressed or low-resolution inputs to improve classification accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of enhancing the resolution of an image by reconstructing a high-resolution version from a low-resolution input.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of enhancing the resolution of an image by reconstructing a high-resolution version from one or more low-resolution images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that aims to recover a high-resolution measure from a limited set of its coefficients.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that reconstructs high-resolution images from low-resolution inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that increases the spatial resolution of an image by recovering high-frequency details.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that infers high-resolution data from coarse measurements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing technique that recovers high-resolution images from one or more low-resolution observations.</rdfs:comment>
