  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#pseudolabeling_protocol">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Pseudolabeling Protocol</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning method that uses a model's own predictions on unlabeled data as ground truth labels for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning method that uses confident predictions on unlabeled data as ground-truth labels for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning strategy that uses model-generated labels for unlabeled data to improve training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning strategy that uses model-generated labels for unlabeled data to iteratively improve training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that iteratively assigns labels to unlabeled samples using a model trained on labeled and previously pseudo-labeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses a model's own high-confidence predictions as ground truth labels for unlabeled data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses a pre-trained model to generate labels for unlabeled data to expand the training set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses a teacher model to generate labels for unlabeled data to train a student model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses model predictions on unlabeled data as ground truth for subsequent training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised learning technique that uses the predictions of a model on unlabeled data as ground-truth labels for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A semi-supervised technique that uses a model's own predictions on unlabeled data as ground truth for further training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that leverages unlabeled data by generating synthetic labels to extend the training set for fine-tuning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[confident predictions on unlabeled data as ground-truth labels, model predictions on unlabeled data as ground truth, the predictions of a model on unlabeled data as ground-truth labels] model predictions on unlabeled data as ground truth</rdfs:comment>
