    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that encodes spatial relationships between features to improve image generation under geometric transformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that groups neurons into capsules to represent entities and their spatial relationships.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that models part-whole hierarchical relationships using groups of neurons.</rdfs:comment>
