  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#lifelong_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Lifelong Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continual learning approach where a system acquires new skills sequentially without forgetting previously learned tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a model continuously acquires new knowledge over time while avoiding the loss of previously learned information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that continuously acquires knowledge from a stream of tasks while avoiding catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that allows a network to expand its capacity to acquire new tasks over time while preserving existing knowledge.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that enables a model to acquire new knowledge over time without forgetting previous tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that enables a system to reuse and transfer knowledge across multiple sequential tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model acquires knowledge from a sequence of tasks and transfers that information to new tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model continuously acquires knowledge from a sequence of tasks without suffering from catastrophic forgetting.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a modular architecture is used to acquire knowledge across a sequence of hierarchically structured tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a system continuously acquires knowledge from a stream of tasks to improve performance on future ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where knowledge from a sequence of tasks is retained and used to improve the performance of future and previous tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that continuously acquires and integrates knowledge over time to handle emerging tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that enables an agent to continuously acquire new knowledge over a sequence of tasks without forgetting previous ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning capability that allows a model to continuously learn new tasks over time without forgetting previous knowledge.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that enables a model to continuously acquire new knowledge without forgetting previous tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that aims to improve performance on both past and future tasks using new data.</rdfs:comment>
