    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model that represents the joint probability distribution of a set of random variables using an undirected graph.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model that represents the joint probability distribution of a set of random variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model used for parameter learning and inference, often applied to tasks like handwritten text line segmentation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model used to approximately calculate marginal distributions of discrete or semidiscrete variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model used to capture probabilistic relations between environment attributes and action controllers for dynamic planning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A graphical model used to represent long-range residue interactions for protein structure prediction.</rdfs:comment>
