    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that discovers abstract themes within a collection of documents by clustering words.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that discovers abstract themes within a collection of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that discovers latent themes across a collection of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that discovers latent themes within a collection of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that exploits paragraph structure to learn both general and specific themes in a corpus.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that jointly generates mathematical equations and their surrounding text to capture latent themes in scientific documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model used for dimensionality reduction and discovery of themes in text corpora.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model used for the automatic discovery of abstract themes within a collection of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model used to discover abstract themes within a collection of documents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical model that discovers abstract themes across a collection of documents by clustering words into topics.</rdfs:comment>
