  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#low_rank_tensor_completion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Low-Rank Tensor Completion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data imputation technique that fills missing values in a tensor by assuming the underlying data structure has a low rank.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery method that fills in missing values of a high-dimensional array by leveraging its low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deterministic analysis method that recovers an order-t tensor by minimizing the max-quasinorm based on hypergraph expanders.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework that fills missing values in multi-dimensional arrays by assuming a low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework that recovers missing values in a multidimensional array by assuming a low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process that recovers a full tensor from incomplete observations using low-rank promoting regularization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A matrix completion technique that fills missing entries in a multi-dimensional array by assuming the underlying structure is low-rank.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A matrix completion technique that fills missing values in multi-dimensional arrays by exploiting their low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A numerical process that fills in missing entries of a multi-dimensional array by assuming it has a low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of estimating missing entries in a tensor by leveraging its low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of recovering missing entries in a high-order array by assuming the tensor has a low rank.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization problem that aims to recover a full tensor from limited observations using regularizers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[low-rank promoting regularization] low-rank promoting regularization</rdfs:comment>
