    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computational structure used to estimate pollution concentrations from high-resolution energy data.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A development environment providing tools and libraries for the practical implementation of machine learning algorithms.</skos:definition>
