    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that assigns a label from a predefined set of categories to an input image.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that assigns a label to an entire image based on its visual content.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that assigns a label to an entire image based on its visual features.</rdfs:comment>
