    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A distributed system architecture that manages and synchronizes model parameters across multiple worker nodes during training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A distributed system that manages parameters for large-scale machine learning training to reduce communication overhead.</rdfs:comment>
