    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A distributed computing framework that manages the synchronization of model weights across multiple learning nodes.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A distributed system architecture designed to scale latent variable model inference across thousands of processor cores.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A distributed system architecture that manages and synchronizes model parameters across multiple worker nodes during training.</skos:definition>
