  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#bayesian_deep_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Bayesian Deep Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that incorporates Bayesian inference into neural networks to quantify uncertainty in model predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that incorporates Bayesian uncertainty estimation into the weights and predictions of deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that incorporates probability distributions over model parameters to quantify uncertainty in deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that incorporates probability distributions over model weights to quantify uncertainty in predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that incorporates uncertainty into neural network weights to generate diversified probabilistic predictions for future trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that integrates Bayesian inference into deep neural networks to quantify and propagate model uncertainties into predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that integrates bayesian inference into neural networks to quantify aleatoric and epistemic uncertainty in predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that integrates probabilistic Bayesian methods with deep neural networks to quantify uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to deep learning that explicitly models model and data uncertainties to enhance output confidence and performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that accounts for parameter uncertainty in remaining useful life estimation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that calculates uncertainty to enable unsupervised anomaly segmentation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that focuses on joint predictive distributions to improve sequential decision making and online inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimates into predictions by treating weights as distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimation by treating weights as distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimation into model predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimation into predictive models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimation into the model predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty estimation through approximate inference techniques.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that incorporates uncertainty quantification into the model parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that models uncertainties in predictions, such as the evolution of satellite collision events.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that provides uncertainty estimates for model predictions to improve robustness.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that quantifies predictive uncertainty through confidence measures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that quantifies uncertainty in model predictions to improve reliability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that represents model weights as distributions to quantify predictive uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that represents weights as distributions to quantify epistemic uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks that uses marginalization over parameter distributions to improve calibration and accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic approach to neural networks used here to predict human visual scanpaths through spatio-temporal optimization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that captures both aleatoric and epistemic uncertainties in neural network predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that incorporates uncertainty into neural network predictions by treating weights as distributions rather than point estimates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic framework that integrates deep learning models with Bayesian inference to combine perception and reasoning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach that incorporates probabilistic uncertainty into the weights and outputs of deep neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach that incorporates probability distributions over network weights to quantify predictive uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach that incorporates uncertainty estimation into neural networks by treating weights as probability distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach that integrates deep neural networks with probabilistic modeling to quantify uncertainty in predictions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach to neural networks that incorporates probability distributions over weights to provide uncertainty estimates.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approach to neural networks that incorporates probability distributions over weights to quantify uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
