  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#distributed_optimization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Distributed Optimization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that distributes the optimization process across multiple nodes to handle large-scale datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that optimizes a global objective function across multiple clients and parameter servers in a network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that solves an optimization problem by distributing the workload across multiple processing nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that solves large-scale mathematical problems by coordinating local computations across multiple nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that solves optimization problems across a network of agents without a central coordinator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that solves optimization problems by spreading the workload across multiple networked nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that spreads optimization tasks across a network of processing units to handle large datasets and model complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a global objective function is minimized across a network of multiple computers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where a global optimization problem is solved across multiple interconnected machines.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where local agents exchange information across a network to solve an optimization problem without a central coordinator.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where multiple agents cooperate locally to find the global minimizer of an empirical risk function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach where the task of minimizing an objective function is spread across multiple processing nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that distributes the minimization of a loss function across multiple machines to handle large-scale data.</rdfs:comment>
