  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#non_intrusive_load_monitoring">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Non-Intrusive Load Monitoring</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A blind source separation task that decomposes a single aggregate energy signal into individual appliance power consumptions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A load disaggregation technique used to estimate the energy consumption of individual appliances from a single aggregate power signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for decomposing aggregated electricity usage signals into individual appliance power readings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for disaggregating a building's total electricity consumption into individual appliance usages.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that disaggregates a building's total electricity consumption to determine the usage of individual appliances.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that identifies individual appliance power consumption from the aggregated electrical signal of a building.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that extracts the usage patterns of individual appliances from a single aggregated power signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of techniques that disaggregate aggregate energy consumption data to identify individual appliance usage.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that disaggregates a single total power measurement into individual appliance consumptions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A signal processing task that disaggregates a total energy consumption signal into the individual power profiles of specific appliances.</rdfs:comment>
