    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that disaggregates a building's total energy consumption into individual appliance-level readings.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An electrical analysis method that disaggregates total power consumption into individual appliance usage.</rdfs:comment>
