    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, representative subset of a large dataset that approximates the properties of the full set for a specific learning task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, representative subset of a large dataset that approximates the properties of the original set for efficient clustering.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, representative subset of a large dataset that maintains the properties of the original data for a given objective function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A small, representative subset of a large dataset that maintains the statistical properties of the original data for efficient computation.</rdfs:comment>
