  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#batch_rl_algorithm">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Batch Rl Algorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach where a policy is optimized using a fixed offline dataset rather than through active interaction with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that optimizes a policy using a fixed set of offline demonstrations rather than active environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a policy using a fixed dataset of previously recorded experiences without further environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that solves Markov decision processes by training on a fixed dataset of experiences offline.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that trains an agent using a fixed dataset of recorded interactions rather than online exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where an agent learns an optimal policy from a fixed dataset of experiences rather than through active interaction with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where an agent learns an optimal policy from a fixed, pre-collected dataset rather than through active interaction with an environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning setting where an agent must derive an optimal policy from a fixed dataset without further interaction with the environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that learns policies from a fixed dataset of experience without further environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning approach that learns an optimal policy from a fixed dataset of logged experiences without further environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning approach where the agent learns an optimal policy from a fixed dataset of previously collected experiences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning method that learns a policy from a fixed dataset of experience without further interaction with the environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning paradigm where a policy is learned from a fixed dataset of experiences without further environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning setting where an agent learns an optimal policy or estimates a value function from a fixed dataset of past experiences without further exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An RL approach that learns an optimal policy from a fixed dataset of experiences without further environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An offline learning approach that optimizes policies using a fixed dataset without requiring active environment interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An offline learning method that optimizes a policy using a fixed, pre-collected dataset of interactions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An offline learning paradigm that derives optimal policies from a fixed dataset of historical trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An offline learning paradigm that optimizes a policy using a fixed set of previously collected experience data.</rdfs:comment>
