  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#locality_sensitive_hashing">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Locality Sensitive Hashing</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that maps similar input items into the same hash buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that maps similar items to the same buckets to efficiently solve maximum inner product search problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that transforms high-dimensional data into hashes to protect privacy and enable behavior modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing strategy that ensures similar input items map to the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that ensures similar input items map to the same bucket with high probability for efficient approximate nearest-neighbor search.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that ensures similar input items map to the same bucket with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that maps similar input items into the same buckets with high probability to enable efficient nearest neighbor search.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that maps similar input items to the same buckets with high probability to enable efficient similarity search.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that maps similar items into the same buckets with high probability to facilitate the identification of nearly redundant data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that maps similar items into the same buckets with high probability to reduce search complexity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that maps similar items to the same bucket with high probability for efficient retrieval.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique that transforms high-dimensional vectors into binary codes while preserving proximity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique used for sublinear-time approximate nearest neighbor search across different dissimilarity measures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hashing technique used to generate correlated samples in near-constant time to estimate the partition function of log-linear models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic algorithm that maps similar input items into the same buckets with high probability to facilitate efficient retrieval.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic technique used to efficiently group similar items into buckets for fast retrieval without pairwise comparisons.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for approximate nearest neighbor search that maps similar items to the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that maps similar input items into the same buckets with high probability for efficient near-neighbor search.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithmic approach for the near neighbor problem that can be modified to ensure fair sampling from a neighborhood.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithmic technique for approximate nearest neighbor search by grouping similar items into the same buckets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithmic technique that maps similar input items into the same buckets to replace softmax layers in lightweight text recognition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate nearest neighbor search algorithm that hashes similar items into the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate nearest neighbor search technique that hashes similar items into the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate nearest neighbor search technique that maps similar high-dimensional points to the same hash bucket.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate nearest neighbor search technique that maps similar items into the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate nearest neighbor technique that hashes similar items into the same buckets with high probability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An indexing technique that maps similar high-dimensional points to the same bucket to speed up nearest neighbor searches.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[sublinear-time approximate nearest neighbor search across different dissimilarity measures] sublinear-time approximate nearest neighbor search across different dissimilarity measures</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[generate correlated samples in near-constant time to estimate the partition function of log-linear models] correlated samples in near-constant time to estimate the partition function of log-linear models</rdfs:comment>
