    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[fair sampling from a neighborhood] fair sampling from a neighborhood</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[similar items into the same buckets] similar items to the same bucket</rdfs:comment>
