    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that uses kernel functions to project data into a higher-dimensional space for linear separation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that utilizes kernel functions to project data into a higher-dimensional space for linear separation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction method that uses kernel functions to analyze dependent data in a Hilbert space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that uses kernel functions to map data into a high-dimensional space before applying linear PCA.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-linear dimensionality reduction technique that uses kernel functions to map data into a higher-dimensional space for linear separation.</rdfs:comment>
