  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#soft_actor_critic">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Soft Actor-Critic</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning algorithm that balances exploration and exploitation by dynamically adjusting a temperature parameter to weight action entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning algorithm that optimizes a stochastic policy by maximizing both expected reward and entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning algorithm used to optimize long-term hydropower production scheduling based on historical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic deep reinforcement learning algorithm based on the maximum entropy framework.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic deep reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy for better exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic deep reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic framework based on the maximum entropy principle for continuous and discrete action spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic framework based on the maximum entropy principle for reinforcement learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm based on the maximum entropy framework.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm extended here for hierarchical deep Q-networks using mutual information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected return and entropy to improve stability and sample efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy for better exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy for exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy for stable continuous control.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both expected reward and policy entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that maximizes both the expected return and the entropy of the policy for better exploration.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm that optimizes a stochastic policy to maximize both expected reward and entropy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An off-policy actor-critic reinforcement learning algorithm used for robust policy learning in continuous action spaces.</rdfs:comment>
