    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[synthesize spoofing attacks for speaker recognition systems] synthesize spoofing attacks for speaker recognition systems</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial framework that uses a critic to measure the distance between real and fake distributions to improve convergence.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that aims to minimize the Wasserstein distance between a real and a generated distribution.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that minimizes the Earth Mover's distance to improve training convergence via a Lipschitz constraint.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that minimizes the Wasserstein distance between the real and generated data distributions.</skos:definition>
