    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that uses the Wasserstein distance as a metric between probability distributions.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that uses the Wasserstein distance to improve training stability and convergence.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A generative adversarial network that uses the Wasserstein distance to train a generator and detect overfitting via an independent critic.</skos:definition>
