    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task that assigns a discrete category to an ordered sequence of real-valued observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that assigns a categorical label to a temporal sequence of data based on its structural patterns.</rdfs:comment>
