    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A temporal point process where the occurrence of an event increases the probability of future events.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A temporal point process where the occurrence of past events increases the probability of future events occurring.</rdfs:comment>
