  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#adaptive_neuro_fuzzy_inference_system">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adaptive Neuro-Fuzzy Inference System</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to predict physical properties like solubility.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven technique that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to forecast environmental parameters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence framework that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to model complex non-linear systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence system that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to model complex nonlinear relationships.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence system that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to model complex nonlinear systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence system that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to perform classification tasks on EEG signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence system that combines the learning capabilities of neural networks with the fuzzy logic reasoning of inference systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligence system that combines the learning capabilities of neural networks with the reasoning capabilities of fuzzy logic.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid intelligent system that combines neural networks with fuzzy logic to model complex nonlinear dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid machine learning model that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to predict complex system behaviors, such as air aeration in hydraulic facilities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid model that combines the learning capabilities of neural networks with the human-like reasoning of fuzzy logic.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid model that combines the learning capabilities of neural networks with the reasoning of fuzzy logic.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid modeling approach that combines neural networks and fuzzy logic to predict outcomes under high uncertainty.</rdfs:comment>
