  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#hybridmodel">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Hybridmodel</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that combines mechanistic simulation and deep learning to improve forecasting performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that combines mechanistic domain knowledge with data-driven machine learning to identify the dynamics of a system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that combines different types of features or algorithms to improve predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning architecture that combines multiple distinct algorithms to solve a complex multi-step problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modeling approach that integrates statistical methods with deep neural networks to leverage the strengths of both paradigms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive architecture that combines artificial neural networks with auto-regressive moving average models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive architecture that combines long short-term memory networks with dynamic behavioral models to forecast disease spread.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive architecture that combines physics-based models with neural networks to improve accuracy across a system's life cycle.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive framework that combines multiple different modeling techniques to improve overall accuracy and performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive system that combines econometric GARCH processes with neural networks to forecast asset return covariance matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive system that combines multiple different machine learning algorithms to improve overall accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical framework that combines continuous protein concentrations and binary gene states for biological inference.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines a neural network and optical character recognition to generate code for data visualizations based on user specifications.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines different types of machine learning algorithms, such as neural networks and decision trees, to solve a problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that combines physical laws or priors with data-driven components to model complex dynamics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A system that integrates a physics engine into a question answering architecture to anticipate future scene states.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An end-to-end architecture that combines recurrent neural networks for feature extraction with boosted decision trees for regression.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[code for data visualizations based on user specifications] code for data visualizations based on user specifications</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[mechanistic simulation and deep learning] mechanistic simulation and deep learning</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[mechanistic domain knowledge with data-driven machine learning] mechanistic domain knowledge with data-driven machine learning</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[different types of features or algorithms] different types of features or algorithms</rdfs:comment>
