  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#constrained_reinforcement_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Constrained Reinforcement Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making framework that optimizes cumulative rewards while adhering to specific preference or safety constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for learning optimal policies while satisfying specific hard bounds or linear inequality constraints on the action space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for satisfying hard state constraints in model-free reinforcement learning using a support vector machine to represent the policy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that optimizes a control policy while satisfying safety certificates to ensure no constraint violations occur.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that integrates safety constraints into the RL process to ensure the agent's behavior remains within safe bounds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning framework that optimizes an agent's policy while ensuring the agent adheres to specific safety or operational limits.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a policy to maximize rewards while ensuring the agent adheres to specific safety constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a policy to minimize costs while satisfying specific operational constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a policy while ensuring specific safety or resource requirements are strictly satisfied.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a reward function while ensuring that certain safety or resource constraints are satisfied.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that optimizes a reward function while ensuring that specific behavioral constraints are satisfied.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where an agent maximizes reward while adhering to specific safety or budget requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework where an agent maximizes a reward signal while ensuring the policy satisfies a set of predefined safety or fairness requirements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that optimizes a reward function while ensuring that certain safety or probabilistic constraints are satisfied.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning framework that incorporates behavioral constraints to reduce the need for manual reward engineering.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning framework that maximizes cumulative rewards while ensuring that specific cost expenditures remain below predefined thresholds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning framework that seeks to find optimal policies while satisfying specific safety or resource constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A reinforcement learning framework where the agent must satisfy multiple reward thresholds individually.</rdfs:comment>
