  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#variational_bayes">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Variational Bayes</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian inference method that approximates an intractable posterior distribution using a simpler variational distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient alternative to Markov chain Monte Carlo methods for scalable Bayesian estimation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computationally efficient probabilistic inference method used to approximate posterior distributions in Bayesian neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic inference method used to jointly infer hidden communities in multilayer networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A scalable Bayesian posterior inference method that approximates the true posterior distribution by minimizing Kullback-Leibler divergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A scalable approximation method for Bayesian inference that transforms the posterior distribution estimation into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A scalable inference method that approximates posterior distributions as an alternative to Markov chain Monte Carlo.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical inference method that approximates complex probability distributions using a simpler parameterized family.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical inference technique used to efficiently estimate spatial loss fields in radio tomographic imaging.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method that approximates complex probability distributions to facilitate clustering and generative modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method that approximates complex probability distributions using a simpler, parameterized family of distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that computes posterior predictive integrals to ensure tractability in stochastic programming.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that replaces a complex posterior distribution with a simpler, more manageable one.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that simplifies the calculation of posterior distributions compared to sampling-based algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that transforms a Bayesian posterior estimation problem into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that transforms a posterior distribution estimation problem into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that transforms a posterior distribution problem into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method that treats the posterior distribution estimation as an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximate inference method used to derive analytical solutions for matrix factorization and completion.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximation technique that transforms a Bayesian inference problem into an optimization problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An approximation technique that transforms the problem of posterior inference into an optimization problem by minimizing the Kullback-Leibler divergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An inference method that approximates complex posterior distributions using a simpler family of distributions to optimize a lower bound.</rdfs:comment>
