    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An inference method that approximates posterior distributions to optimize word embedding objectives.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An inference technique that approximates complex posterior distributions using a simpler parameterized distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization-based approach to Bayesian inference that approximates a posterior distribution with a simpler distribution.</rdfs:comment>
