  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#unsupervised_machine_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Unsupervised Machine Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of algorithms that extract patterns and meaning from large unstructured datasets without pre-existing labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of algorithms that find hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in input data without pre-existing labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of learning that identifies hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in input data without using pre-existing labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that identifies patterns in unlabeled data, such as spectrum occupancy in wireless communications.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that identifies hidden patterns or clusters in data without using pre-labeled targets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that identifies patterns or outliers in data without the need for pre-labeled training sets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm used to extract intelligent similarity schemes from data synopses to build temporal similarity maps between edge nodes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm used to retrieve Hamiltonian models of quantum systems from experimental data without labeled targets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of learning that finds hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in data without using labeled outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of learning that identifies hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in input data without using pre-existing labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of machine learning that analyzes and clusters unlabeled data to discover hidden patterns or outliers without predefined categories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of machine learning that finds hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in input data without using labeled outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of machine learning that finds hidden patterns or intrinsic structures in input data without using labeled responses.</rdfs:comment>
