  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#randomfourierfeatures">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Randomfourierfeatures</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates Gaussian kernels through nonlinear transformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates a kernel function by mapping data into a randomized low-dimensional feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates a kernel function by mapping input data into a randomized low-dimensional feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates a kernel function using a finite set of random basis projections.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates kernel functions to reduce the computational complexity of nonlinear models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates kernel matrices for functions like the Gaussian kernel.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that approximates kernel matrices using projections onto random bases in the Fourier domain.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A kernel approximation method that maps data into a low-dimensional space to approximate a kernel matrix.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method for approximating the kernel distance of a reproducing kernel Hilbert space using a finite dimensional Euclidean mapping.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method that approximates a kernel function by mapping data into a low-dimensional feature space using trigonometric hypotheses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A method that approximates kernel functions by mapping input data into a low-dimensional randomized feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for approximating kernel functions by mapping inputs to a randomized feature space to enable linear learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for scaling up kernel methods by approximating the kernel function with a finite-dimensional feature map.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that approximates a kernel function by mapping input data into a low-dimensional randomized feature space.</rdfs:comment>
