    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers with recurrent units to capture spatio-temporal patterns in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers with recurrent units to predict future sequences in ultrasound videos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers with recurrent units to process spatio-temporal image sequences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers with recurrent units to process spatiotemporal data.</rdfs:comment>
