    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network layer that combines convolutional and recurrent operations to extract spatial and temporal features for motion correction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network layer that combines convolutional operations with recurrent units to process spatiotemporal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent architecture that integrates convolution operations into memory cells to capture spatial-temporal patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers for spatial feature extraction with LSTM units for temporal prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recurrent neural network architecture that combines convolutional layers with LSTM cells to capture both spatial and temporal dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
