  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#tensor_completion">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tensor Completion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational task of estimating missing entries in a tensor given a limited number of observed samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data imputation task that fills in missing entries of a low-tubal-rank tensor using algebraic frameworks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data imputation task that predicts missing values within a multi-dimensional array.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery process that estimates missing entries in a multi-dimensional array by exploiting its low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery process that estimates missing entries in a multi-way array using rank-regularized decompositions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery process that fills in missing or unobserved entries of a multidimensional array.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery process that fills missing entries of a high-order array by assuming it has low rank.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery process that fills missing or unobserved entries in partially observed tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data recovery technique that fills in missing entries of a multi-dimensional array.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A data-driven technique that fills in missing values of a multi-dimensional array by assuming a low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generalization of matrix completion used to estimate missing entries in multi-dimensional arrays.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generalization of matrix completion used to predict missing entries in multi-dimensional arrays.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that fills in missing entries of a tensor by minimizing a non-convex rank surrogate function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical problem of recovering missing entries in a multi-dimensional array using low-rank approximations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical procedure that recovers missing entries in a multi-dimensional array based on low-rank assumptions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process of filling in missing entries of a multi-dimensional array by assuming a low-rank structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process of recovering missing entries in a sparse tensor by leveraging latent components and covariate information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process that fills in missing entries of a multi-dimensional array to recover the original signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical process that recovers missing entries in a multiway array by assuming low multilinear rank.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of predicting missing entries in a multi-dimensional array using quadratic models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of reconstructing a low-rank multi-dimensional array from a subset of its observed entries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical technique that recovers missing entries in a multi-dimensional array using low-rank approximations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A matrix-extension process that estimates missing entries in a high-order array using low-rank assumptions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A matrix-generalization task that fills in missing elements of a multi-dimensional array using low-rank factorization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A matrix-generalization technique that fills in missing entries of a multi-dimensional array.</rdfs:comment>
