    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process that identifies regularities in data to categorize input into specific classes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process that uses feature extraction and classification algorithms to identify regularities in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational task that involves identifying regularities in data to categorize input into classes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of machine learning focused on the automated recognition of patterns and regularities in data, often implemented in IoT devices.</rdfs:comment>
