    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bottom-up hierarchical clustering approach that merges pairs of clusters based on a specific similarity metric.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bottom-up hierarchical clustering approach where each observation starts in its own cluster and pairs of clusters are merged as one moves up the hierarchy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bottom-up hierarchical clustering method that iteratively merges the most similar pairs of clusters.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bottom-up hierarchical clustering method that successively merges clusters based on a similarity metric.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A bottom-up hierarchical grouping algorithm that iteratively merges the most similar data points or clusters.</rdfs:comment>
