    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical clustering method that starts with each data point as a separate cluster and iteratively merges the closest pairs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hierarchical clustering method used to group students with similar performance patterns to support educational decision-making.</rdfs:comment>
