  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#multioutputgaussianprocess">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Multioutputgaussianprocess</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A Bayesian non-parametric model used for predicting multiple dependent output variables simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative machine learning framework that models multiple related target variables simultaneously to capture cross-correlations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model used for regression that predicts multiple correlated output variables simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model used to learn relationships among multiple coupled time series by using expressive covariance functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian model used to predict multiple related output variables by sharing information across them.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A non-parametric Bayesian regression technique that learns statistical relationships among multiple correlated time series for predictive modeling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that encapsulates variability from demonstrations to modulate robot trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that extends Gaussian processes to handle multiple dependent output variables simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that extends single-output regression to predict multiple correlated target variables simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that generates predictive distributions to provide uncertainty-aware recommendations in collaborative filtering.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model that handles correlations among multiple observations to perform data augmentation for indoor localization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model used to capture the correlations and structures across multiple dependent output variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic model used to describe multiple dependent random variables across a continuous domain using covariance functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic modeling framework for multi-channel data that utilizes covariance kernels to handle multiple output variables.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic regression model that captures correlations between multiple output dimensions using a mixture of single-output experts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process model that captures dependencies across multiple output variables to improve spatio-temporal modelling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process that models multiple correlated output variables simultaneously to capture complex spatial and temporal dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process used for regression that models multiple dependent output variables simultaneously.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic process used to jointly model multiple heterogeneous outputs using a vector-valued prior and a linear model of coregionalisation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[predicting multiple dependent output variables simultaneously, regression that predicts multiple correlated output variables simultaneously, predict multiple related output variables by sharing information across them, regression that models multiple dependent output variables simultaneously] predicting multiple dependent output variables simultaneously</rdfs:comment>
