    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[learn relationships among multiple coupled time series by using expressive covariance functions] learn relationships among multiple coupled time series by using expressive covariance functions</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[capture the correlations and structures across multiple dependent output variables] capture the correlations and structures across multiple dependent output variables</rdfs:comment>
