    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A low-dimensional numerical representation of a high-dimensional object that preserves semantic or topological similarity.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A low-dimensional representation of high-dimensional data that captures semantic relationships between entities.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A low-dimensional vector representation of a discrete entity that captures its semantic meaning.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A low-dimensional vector representation of a discrete object that captures its semantic meaning.</skos:definition>
