    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that adapts the attention mechanism to process graph-structured data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies attention mechanisms to graph data to capture long-range interactions between nodes.</rdfs:comment>
