    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies the transformer mechanism to graph-structured data to capture spatial and temporal dependencies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that applies the transformer mechanism to graph-structured data to preserve topology.</rdfs:comment>
