  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#supervised_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Supervised Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of algorithms that learn a mapping from input features to target labels using labeled training data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A category of machine learning where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to map inputs to known outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification approach that uses hand-crafted features to automatically assess the quality of Wikipedia articles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A classification approach that uses labeled training data to map inputs to discrete output categories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational approach that maps input spectra to alloy labels using a labeled training dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that trains a model on a labeled dataset to predict outcomes for unseen data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that trains a model on labeled data to predict a target outcome based on input features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that trains a model on labeled data to predict outcomes for new observations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses labeled historical data to forecast specific events, such as signal loss in optical networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning approach that uses labeled historical data to optimize synthesis parameters for the production of nanostructures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning method that predicts target labels for new data based on patterns learned from a labeled training dataset.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that builds models based on a dataset of input-output pairs provided by labels.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that trains a model on labeled data to map inputs to known output categories or values.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that trains a model on labeled data to predict outcomes for new inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that uses labeled data to train a model for binary medical response classification based on spectral features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that uses labeled data to train models for classification or regression tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that uses labeled data to train models for predicting user engagement in human-robot interaction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that uses labeled experimental databases to predict the mechanical properties of materials.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm that uses labeled historical data to prioritize suspicious file artefacts in digital forensics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to map inputs to known outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to map inputs to known target outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to predict a target output for new inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on labeled data to map inputs to known outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on labeled data to predict outcomes for unseen inputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a model is trained on labeled datasets to map inputs to known target outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning paradigm where a system is trained on labeled data to predict a specific outcome, such as resource failure in high-performance computing.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning process that maps input features to known output targets using labeled training examples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm of learning where a model is trained on labeled data to perform tasks like named entity recognition or sentiment analysis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm of learning where a model is trained on labeled data to predict a target output based on input features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm of machine learning where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to learn a mapping from inputs to outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm of machine learning where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to map inputs to known outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to learn a mapping from inputs to targets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A paradigm where a model is trained on labeled data to predict target outcomes based on input features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling approach that uses labeled data to learn a mapping from inputs to outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling approach that uses labeled datasets to estimate the duration of events for energy management systems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling approach that uses labeled training data to approximate complex functions for accelerating optimization problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling approach that utilizes labeled training data to categorize inputs into predefined classes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive modeling approach used to discover correlations and optimize properties of porous materials based on labeled datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of learning where a model is trained on a labeled dataset to learn a mapping from inputs to targets.</rdfs:comment>
