  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#online_linear_optimization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Online Linear Optimization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision problem where a learner minimizes regret by choosing vectors from a convex set over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decision-making process where a learner minimizes regret by making sequential choices based on provided hint vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for making a sequence of linear decisions to minimize total regret against a fixed competitor.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework for making a sequence of decisions to minimize cumulative cost against an adversarial sequence of losses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework that seeks to minimize cumulative regret when making a sequence of decisions under linear loss functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A parameter-free algorithmic class that adapts to adversarial sequences using sequential side information and universal compression techniques.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task where a learner minimizes regret by choosing vectors in response to a sequence of cost vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision framework that aims to minimize the cumulative regret over a series of linear cost functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision process aimed at minimizing regret over a combinatorial action set.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision process that aims to minimize regret by choosing linear actions based on a sequence of cost vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision process where an agent chooses a vector in a convex set to minimize cumulative linear loss.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making framework that aims to minimize cumulative regret over a series of linear loss functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making framework where a player chooses actions to minimize cumulative cost based on received hints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making framework where a player minimizes regret against an adversary over a series of time steps.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making problem where a learner minimizes cumulative loss over time against an unknown sequence of linear functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making problem where an algorithm chooses a point to minimize cumulative loss against a revealed cost vector.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making process where a player chooses vectors to minimize total regret over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making process where an agent chooses actions to minimize cumulative regret over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sequential decision-making process where an algorithm minimizes regret over a sequence of linear cost functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[sequential side information and universal compression techniques] sequential side information and universal compression techniques</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[cumulative cost] cumulative cost</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[cumulative linear loss, cumulative loss] cumulative loss</rdfs:comment>
