    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A decision-making process where a learner minimizes regret by making sequential choices based on provided hint vectors.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A framework for making a sequence of linear decisions to minimize total regret against a fixed competitor.</skos:definition>
