    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies and locates multiple objects within an image.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies and locates objects of interest within an image.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies and locates specific items within an image by providing bounding boxes and class labels.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies and locates specific objects within an image or video frame.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies the location and class of multiple objects within an image.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computer vision system that identifies the location and class of specific items within an image.</skos:definition>
