  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#isolation_forest">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Isolation Forest</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A tree-based anomaly detection algorithm that isolates observations by randomly selecting a feature and then randomly selecting a split value.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that identifies outliers by isolating examples through random partitioning of the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that identifies outliers by isolating observations in a tree-based structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that isolates observations by randomly selecting a feature and then randomly selecting a split value between the maximum and minimum values of the selected feature.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that isolates observations by randomly selecting a feature and then randomly selecting a split value.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that isolates observations by randomly splitting the functional space to identify abnormal trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that isolates outliers by randomly partitioning data using decision trees.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection algorithm that isolates outliers by randomly partitioning features in a tree structure.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection method that can be adapted to approximate spatial distance between data points based on the number of random splits required to separate them.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An anomaly detection technique that isolates observations by randomly partitioning the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An outlier detection algorithm that isolates anomalies by recursively making random cuts across the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised algorithm that identifies anomalies by isolating observations through random partitioning of features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning algorithm that identifies anomalies by isolating observations through random partitioning of the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning algorithm that identifies anomalies by isolating them through random partitioning of the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised outlier detection algorithm used to identify anomalous crop development from satellite imagery features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[identify anomalous crop development from satellite imagery features] identify anomalous crop development from satellite imagery features</rdfs:comment>
