    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Second Order Optimization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms that utilizes the Hessian matrix to achieve faster convergence than first-order methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of optimization algorithms that use the curvature of the loss function, typically via the Hessian matrix, to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of optimization algorithms that utilize the Hessian matrix or its approximation to achieve faster convergence than first-order methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of optimization algorithms that utilize the curvature of the loss surface via the Hessian matrix to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
