    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that utilizes the curvature of the loss landscape via second derivatives to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that utilizes the curvature of the objective function via the Hessian matrix to accelerate convergence.</rdfs:comment>
