    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that focuses on discovering and generalizing patterns based on the connections between objects.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that incorporates structural information and associations between entities.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns patterns from data structured as sets of relations between objects.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that predicts outcomes by modeling the connections and interactions between different entities.</skos:definition>
