  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#neural_radiance_field">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Neural Radiance Field</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continuous volumetric representation that uses a neural network to synthesize novel views of 3D scenes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A continuous volumetric representation used for novel view synthesis and 3D scene reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A coordinate-based neural representation that predicts volumetric density and color to synthesize novel views of a scene.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning method for representing 3D scenes as continuous volumetric functions for high-fidelity rendering.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning method that represents a 3D scene as a continuous volumetric function for high-fidelity synthesis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A functional representation of a 3D scene that uses a neural network to map coordinates to color and density.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learned mapping that represents a 3D scene or video as a continuous function of coordinates to enable high-resolution interpolation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural representation used to synthesize photorealistic novel views of real-world 3D scenes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural scene representation that learns geometry and appearance from 2D images to synthesize high-fidelity dynamic humans from arbitrary viewpoints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation method that uses a neural network to map 3D coordinates and viewing directions to color and density for scene reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation of a 3D scene that uses a neural network to map coordinates and viewing directions to color and density.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation technique that uses a neural network to encode 3D scenes as a continuous volumetric function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation that uses a multilayer perceptron to model the volumetric density and color of a 3D scene.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation that uses a neural network to encode a 3D scene as a continuous volumetric function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A scene representation that uses a neural network to support high-quality view synthesis and 3D editing.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A volume-rendering technique that uses a neural network to synthesize novel views of 3D scenes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A volumetric representation that synthesizes 3D object geometry and color from 2D images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A volumetric representation that synthesizes novel views of 3D scenes using a neural network.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A volumetric representation that uses a neural network to synthesize novel views of a 3D scene.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An implicit scene representation used for the realistic generation of audio-driven video portraits.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[the realistic generation of audio-driven video portraits] realistic generation of audio-driven video portraits</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[3D scene] 3d scene</rdfs:comment>
