    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[dynamic humans] dynamic humans</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[3D object geometry and color] 3d object geometry and color</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A continuous volumetric representation that uses a neural network to synthesize novel views of 3D scenes.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A continuous volumetric representation used for novel view synthesis and 3D scene reconstruction.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A coordinate-based neural representation that predicts volumetric density and color to synthesize novel views of a scene.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning method for representing 3D scenes as continuous volumetric functions for high-fidelity rendering.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning method that represents a 3D scene as a continuous volumetric function for high-fidelity synthesis.</skos:definition>
