  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#adversarial_autoencoder">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Adversarial Autoencoder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines a traditional autoencoder with a discriminator to learn a specific latent distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a GAN to perform data-driven clustering of complex conformations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a GAN-like discriminator to learn a structured latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a GAN-like discriminator to shape the latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to constrain the latent space distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn a structured latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn latent representations for molecular generation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn robust data representations for anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn robust latent representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn structured latent representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn the distribution of high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to map data to a specific prior distribution for anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to map data to a specific prior distribution in the latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to map latent codes to a specific probability distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with adversarial training to learn a regularized latent representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with an adversarial training objective to align latent distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines an autoencoder with an adversarial training objective to regularize the latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines autoencoder structures with adversarial training to perform joint signal generation and classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that combines autoencoding with adversarial training to learn disentangled representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a proper prior from data using code generators to improve image quality and disentanglement.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that transforms high-dimensional multimodal data into low-dimensional unimodal latent distributions for oversampling.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses adversarial training to constrain the latent space to a prior distribution for parameter estimation and synthesis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses adversarial training to regularize the latent space of an autoencoder.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses an adversarial training framework to map word vectors between different languages.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses an adversarial training objective to match the aggregated posterior of the latent space to a prior distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model used to learn latent representations of users from unlabeled data for fraud detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A hybrid architecture that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to ensure a convex latent distribution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn structured latent representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that imposes a prior distribution on the latent space to improve robustness in anomaly detection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that combines an autoencoder with a generative adversarial network to learn meaningful semantic representations of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that learns a human-interpretable model of data by disentangling latent generative factors to generate adversarial examples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic autoencoder that employs generative adversarial networks to match the aggregated posterior of a hidden code vector with a prior distribution.</rdfs:comment>
