    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A simulated framework where an agent learns to make decisions by interacting with a dynamic system to maximize rewards.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A simulated platform that allows agents to interact with a system to learn optimal behaviors through trial and error.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A simulated setting that provides a framework for building and evaluating agents through interaction and reward.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A simulated setting that provides a framework for training agents through interaction and photorealistic rendering.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A simulated setting that provides a task and feedback mechanism for training autonomous agents to maximize rewards.</skos:definition>
