  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#geometric_deep_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Geometric Deep Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A branch of deep learning that generalizes architectures to non-Euclidean domains such as manifolds and graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A branch of machine learning that extends neural networks to non-Euclidean domains such as manifolds and graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures designed to exploit symmetries and non-Euclidean structures in data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures designed to operate directly on non-Euclidean data structures such as graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures designed to operate on non-Euclidean data structures like point clouds or graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures designed to operate on non-Euclidean data structures such as graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures designed to operate on non-Euclidean data such as 3D CAD models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural network architectures that operates on non-Euclidean data structures, such as graphs, to capture spatial and temporal correlations in road networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of neural networks that operate on non-Euclidean domains such as graphs or manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning framework that generalizes neural network architectures to non-Euclidean domains, such as symmetric positive definite manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of deep learning that operates on non-Euclidean data structures such as graphs and meshes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A field of neural networks designed to operate on non-Euclidean data, such as 3D triangle meshes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for building neural network models that are compatible with non-Euclidean geometries, such as manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for designing neural networks that can operate on non-Euclidean domains such as manifolds or graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for extending deep learning to non-Euclidean domains, such as graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for extending neural networks to non-Euclidean data domains like graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for extending neural networks to non-Euclidean domains such as graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework for performing inference on three-dimensional geometric data by defining convolution and pooling operations on triangle meshes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that generalizes neural network architectures to non-Euclidean domains by incorporating symmetry and invariance principles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A framework that leverages geometric structures like manifolds and symmetries to design efficient sampling and optimization algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that employs neural networks to learn directly from non-Euclidean data structures such as 3D facial meshes.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that extends neural network architectures to non-Euclidean data structures like graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that extends neural networks to non-Euclidean domains such as graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that extends neural networks to non-Euclidean domains such as manifolds and point clouds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical framework focusing on group and gauge equivariant neural networks to process data on arbitrary manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses SE(3)-equivariant models to predict receptor binding locations and ligand poses.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network paradigm that applies deep learning to non-Euclidean data structures such as manifolds or graphs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network paradigm that incorporates symmetry information to process non-Euclidean data structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of neural network architectures designed to respect the underlying symmetry and structure of non-Euclidean data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of neural network techniques that generalize deep learning models to non-Euclidean spaces such as graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A versatile framework that models patient cohort relations in a graph structure to perform computer-aided disease classification using multi-modal features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An extension of deep learning that applies neural networks to non-Euclidean data structures like graphs and manifolds.</rdfs:comment>
