    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates multiple different data representations of the same object to improve classification performance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates multiple different perspectives or data sources to improve prediction accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that integrates multiple distinct data sources for a single sample to improve predictive performance.</rdfs:comment>
