    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that integrates multiple heterogeneous feature sets representing the same instance to improve representation learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that leverages complementary features from different data resolutions to improve classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning framework that leverages multiple data representations to transfer knowledge across different languages for classification.</rdfs:comment>
