  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#deeplearningarchitecture">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Deeplearningarchitecture</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that predicts 3D point clouds from 2D satellite imagery using combined loss functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework using neural networks to reconstruct 3D images from sparse view X-ray measurements.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model based on artificial neural networks with multiple layers used to automatically detect patterns in video frames.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational model used to detect COVID-19 in chest x-rays, evaluated for reliability and prediction variability.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational structure that combines neural networks with Monte Carlo methods to calculate variational ground state energies in quantum chemistry.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A model that uses an alternating minimization algorithm as an inductive bias to recover sparse conditional independence graphs from data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A modular system of trainable neural network modules used to map audio inputs to video outputs for headshot synthesis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multi-layered neural network structure designed to predict specific biological sites, such as succinylation sites in proteins.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure designed to remove null space signals from filtered back-projection reconstructions in interior tomography.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure designed to simultaneously perform clustering and predictive modeling for investor interest.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure that restores detail to compressed videos by leveraging bitstream motion information.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure used for detecting specific patterns, such as avalanches, in radar satellite imagery.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network structure used to forecast regression models for time-dependent data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A specific configuration of neural network layers and connections used to process complex data patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A specific structural configuration of neural network layers designed to optimize performance for a given task.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A specific structural configuration of neural network layers designed to optimize performance or computational efficiency.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A specific structural configuration of neural network layers, such as ResNet or Inception, designed for automated image classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A structural configuration of neural network layers designed to automatically extract hierarchical features from raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A structural configuration of neural network layers, such as convolutional and recurrent layers, used to predict biological sequence binding specificities.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[automatically detect patterns in video frames, detecting specific patterns] detecting specific patterns</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[an alternating minimization algorithm as an inductive bias] alternating minimization algorithm as an inductive bias</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[map audio inputs to video outputs for headshot synthesis] map audio inputs to video outputs for headshot synthesis</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[forecast regression models for time-dependent data] forecast regression models for time-dependent data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[process complex data patterns] data patterns</rdfs:comment>
