    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[predict specific biological sites] predict specific biological sites</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[remove null space signals from filtered back-projection reconstructions in interior tomography] remove null space signals from filtered back-projection reconstructions in interior tomography</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[simultaneously perform clustering and predictive modeling for investor interest] simultaneously perform clustering and predictive modeling for investor interest</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimize performance for a given task, optimize performance or computational efficiency] optimize performance for a given task</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[automated image classification] automated image classification</rdfs:comment>
