    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural architecture that uses complex numbers for weights and activations to better represent signal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that processes data using complex numbers to better handle statistically dependent real and imaginary parts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses complex numbers for weights and activations to better capture phase information in signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that uses complex numbers for weights and activations to better utilize joint information in RF signals.</rdfs:comment>
