    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture that utilizes complex numbers for weights and activations to process signals in the complex baseband.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture where weights and activations are represented as complex numbers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network that utilizes complex numbers for weights and activations to better process phase and magnitude information in signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of artificial neural network that utilizes complex numbers for weights and activations to better handle naturally complex-valued input data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A type of artificial neural network where the weights and activations are represented by complex numbers instead of real numbers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An architecture of artificial neural networks where the weights, inputs, and activations are represented by complex numbers.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[complex numbers] complex numbers</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[phase and magnitude information] phase and magnitude information</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[data using complex numbers] complex numbers</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[signals in the complex baseband] signals in the complex baseband</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A computational model where neurons are represented by complex numbers to capture phase and magnitude.</skos:definition>
