  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#primal_dual_algorithm">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Primal Dual Algorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Primal-Dual Algorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A mathematical optimization technique that solves a problem by simultaneously optimizing its primary objective and its dual formulation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization framework that simultaneously solves a primary problem and its associated dual.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a constrained problem by simultaneously optimizing the primal objective and its dual variable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a constrained problem by simultaneously updating a primal variable and a dual variable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously iterating on the original variables and their dual counterparts.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously optimizing its primal and dual formulations to find an optimal solution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously optimizing its primal and dual formulations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously optimizing its primary formulation and its associated dual.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously optimizing the original objective and its dual formulation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method that solves a problem by simultaneously updating the primal and dual variables to find the optimal solution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method used in online resource allocation to maximize rewards by synthesizing surrogate functions for procurement costs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method used to find equilibrium points in stochastic saddle point problems with decision-dependent distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An optimization method used to solve convex-concave min-max problems with bilinear coupling.</rdfs:comment>
