    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that finds an optimal alignment between two time-series sequences by stretching or shrinking them.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm that measures similarity between two temporal sequences which may vary in speed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm used to find an optimal alignment between two time-varying sequences by stretching or compressing the time axis.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm used to measure similarity between time-series motion segments by finding an optimal alignment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm used to measure similarity between two temporal sequences which may vary in speed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An algorithm used to measure the similarity between two temporal sequences that may vary in speed.</rdfs:comment>
