    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of estimating a matrix with a small rank from a limited set of noisy observations.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of reconstructing a matrix from a small number of linear measurements.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of reconstructing a matrix from incomplete samples by minimizing a non-convex objective function.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A mathematical task of reconstructing a matrix of low rank from a limited set of observations using projection oracles.</skos:definition>
