    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that compresses continuous audio signals into discrete latent representations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that compresses continuous data into a discrete latent space for high-fidelity reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that employs a discrete codebook to represent latent variables rather than continuous distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a discrete latent representation of data by combining variational inference with vector quantization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a discrete latent representation of data by mapping continuous encoder outputs to the nearest vectors in a learned codebook.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a discrete latent representation of data using a codebook of vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a discrete latent representation of input data using a codebook.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that learns a discrete latent space to improve generalization in semi-supervised learning tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that maps input data to a discrete latent space using a codebook for compressed representation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space and autoregressive priors to produce high-fidelity images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space to compress and reconstruct signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space to compress high-dimensional data.</rdfs:comment>
