    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space to represent data in a compressed format.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space to represent data in a compressed, quantized format.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that uses a discrete latent space to represent data through vector quantization.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that utilizes a discrete latent space to compress and reconstruct data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A generative model that utilizes a discrete latent space to represent data as a series of codebook vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a discrete codebook, a codebook] codebook</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a codebook of vectors] codebook of vectors</rdfs:comment>
