  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#trajectory_prediction">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Trajectory Prediction</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision and AI task that forecasts the future positions of moving entities over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computer vision task that estimates the future motion states of obstacles to ensure the driving safety of autonomous vehicles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting method that estimates the future longitudinal movement and lane changes of vehicles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting task that estimates the future movement paths of agents based on historical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting task that estimates the future path of a moving object based on historical movement data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting task that estimates the future path of an object based on its current movement and temporal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting task that estimates the future spatial path of agents based on their past movements and scene context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A forecasting task that predicts the future movements of agents based on historical spatio-temporal data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that forecasts the future movement paths of agents in a dynamic environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that forecasts the future paths of vehicles based on connected data sources.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that forecasts the future positions of moving agents based on their historical movement and surrounding context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that forecasts the future sequence of movements of an agent based on historical data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive analytics task focused on forecasting the future location and path of moving objects.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A predictive task that anticipates the future movements of surrounding vehicles to enable safe autonomous navigation.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic task in autonomous driving that forecasts the future paths of agents by classifying them over a diverse set of possible trajectories.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task in autonomous systems that involves forecasting the future paths of multiple agents in a dynamic environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task of estimating the future path of a moving object based on observed historical movement.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task of forecasting future states of road agents to enable autonomous driving.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that aims to forecast the future movement paths of pedestrians using probabilistic feature maps and personality characteristics.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that forecasts the future spatial-temporal movement of agents in a given environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that forecasts the future spatial-temporal paths of moving objects, such as athletes in a sports game.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that involves forecasting the future motion of agents based on their current state and intent.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that involves forecasting the future path of a dynamic entity based on its past motion and environmental context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that involves forecasting the future path of a moving object based on its past movements and environment.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that involves predicting the future states and positions of agents in complex driving scenarios using semantic maps and perception data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that models the movement of vessels to predict their future positions in near-real time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task that predicts the future paths of agents in multi-agent systems while accounting for interactions and collision avoidance.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The task of forecasting the future path of an agent based on its past movements and interactions with other agents.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[probabilistic feature maps and personality characteristics] probabilistic feature maps and personality characteristics</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[semantic maps and perception data] semantic maps and perception data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[future positions/paths of moving entities/objects/agents/vehicles, future movements/paths of agents/objects] future movements/paths of agents/objects</rdfs:comment>
