  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#spectral_normalization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Spectral Normalization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A normalization technique that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a layer by dividing weights by their largest singular value.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization method that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a network by normalizing the spectral norm of weight matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that bounds the spectral norm of weight matrices to improve the generalization and robustness of deep neural networks against adversarial attacks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a neural network by normalizing the spectral norm of its weight matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a neural network by normalizing the weight matrices.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a neural network by normalizing the weights of each layer by their largest singular value.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that constrains the Lipschitz constant of a neural network layer by normalizing its weights.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that constrains the spectral norm of weight matrices to improve test set accuracy in neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that controls the Lipschitz constant of a neural network by normalizing the weights of each layer by their spectral norm.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique that controls the spectral norm of weight matrices to stabilize the training of generative adversarial networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A regularization technique used in the discriminator of a generative adversarial network to enforce Lipschitz continuity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A weight normalization technique used to stabilize the training of the discriminator in generative adversarial networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[stabilize the training of the discriminator in generative adversarial networks] stabilize the training of the discriminator in generative adversarial networks</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[spectral norm of weight matrices] spectral norm of weight matrices</rdfs:comment>
