  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#stacked_autoencoder">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Stacked Autoencoder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture composed of multiple layers of autoencoders used for hierarchical feature extraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture composed of multiple layers of autoencoders used for high-accuracy prediction of clinical significance in genetic mutations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture used for unsupervised feature extraction and classification of high-dimensional signals.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep neural network composed of multiple layers of autoencoders used to learn robust compressed representations of data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep neural network designed for dimensionality reduction through layered unsupervised pre-training.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A multilayered unsupervised neural network used to learn compressed representations of data through a sequence of encoding and decoding stages.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture composed of multiple layers of encoders and decoders used for dimensionality reduction and image reconstruction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of multiple layers of autoencoders used for unsupervised feature extraction and dimensionality reduction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network architecture consisting of multiple layers of autoencoders used for unsupervised feature learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network composed of multiple layers of autoencoders used for dimensionality reduction and feature extraction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A neural network used for feature space dimension reduction by layering multiple autoencoding structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[hierarchical feature extraction] hierarchical feature extraction</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[high-accuracy prediction of clinical significance in genetic mutations] high-accuracy prediction of clinical significance in genetic mutations</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[unsupervised feature extraction and classification of high-dimensional signals] unsupervised feature extraction and classification of high-dimensional signals</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[learn robust compressed representations of data, learn compressed representations of data through a sequence of encoding and decoding stages] learn robust compressed representations of data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[dimensionality reduction and image reconstruction, unsupervised feature extraction and dimensionality reduction, dimensionality reduction and feature extraction] dimensionality reduction and feature extraction</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[feature space dimension reduction by layering multiple autoencoding structures] feature space dimension reduction by layering multiple autoencoding structures</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[dimensionality reduction through layered unsupervised pre-training] dimensionality reduction and feature extraction</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture composed of multiple layers of autoencoders used for hierarchical feature extraction.</skos:definition>
