    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[model count data or time-to-event analysis by optimizing a log-likelihood function] model count data or time-to-event analysis by optimizing a log-likelihood function</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[predict count data based on one or more predictor variables] predict count data based on one or more predictor variables</rdfs:comment>
