  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#sequential_monte_carlo">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sequential Monte Carlo</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms that use a set of particles to represent and update a probability distribution over time or iterations.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms that uses a set of particles to approximate the posterior distribution of a state.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms used for estimating the state of a dynamic system through a set of weighted particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms used to estimate posterior distributions in Bayesian optimization via a set of evolving particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms used to estimate the posterior distribution of a hidden state in a non-linear state-space model.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of algorithms used to estimate the state of a dynamic system through a set of weighted particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of approximate inference methods used to estimate posterior densities and expectations in analytically intractable probabilistic models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of random-sampling methods used for approximate inference in probabilistic models by representing distributions as sets of particles.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A class of sampling algorithms that use a set of particles to approximate a target probability distribution over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational framework that uses a set of particles to represent the posterior distribution of a hidden state in a dynamic system.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic sampling algorithm that iteratively approximates a posterior distribution using a top-down generative process.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A probabilistic sampling method used to handle multiple pose hypotheses and mitigate prediction errors in multi-person tracking.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A recursive Bayesian filtering method that uses a set of particles to approximate the posterior distribution of a state.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A sampling method that estimates a target distribution through a sequence of simpler intermediate distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of algorithms used to estimate the internal states of a dynamical system as it evolves over time using a series of random samples.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of algorithms used to estimate the internal states of a dynamical system as observations arrive over time.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic inference algorithm for probabilistic graphical models that can be enhanced by leveraging deterministic inference outputs.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A stochastic sampling method that estimates latent states and optimizes model parameters through recursive filtering.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An inference algorithm for state space models that approximates the posterior distribution by sampling from a sequence of intermediate target distributions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a set of particles] set of particles</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[estimating the state of a dynamic system through a set of weighted particles, estimate the state of a dynamic system through a set of weighted particles] estimate the state of a dynamic system through a set of weighted particles</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[estimate posterior distributions in bayesian optimization via a set of evolving particles] estimate posterior distributions in bayesian optimization via a set of evolving particles</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[estimate the posterior distribution of a hidden state in a non-linear state-space model] estimate the posterior distribution of a hidden state in a non-linear state-space model</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[estimate posterior densities and expectations in analytically intractable probabilistic models] estimate posterior densities and expectations in analytically intractable probabilistic models</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[approximate inference in probabilistic models by representing distributions as sets of particles] approximate inference in probabilistic models by representing distributions as sets of particles</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a top-down generative process] top-down generative process</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[handle multiple pose hypotheses and mitigate prediction errors in multi-person tracking] handle multiple pose hypotheses and mitigate prediction errors in multi-person tracking</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[a series of random samples] series of random samples</rdfs:comment>
