  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#contrastivepredictivecoding">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Contrastivepredictivecoding</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A representation learning framework that uses noise contrastive estimation to predict future observations in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning framework that captures long-term temporal structures in sensor data streams for representation learning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that extracts useful representations by predicting future observations in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting future latent states in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting future latent states of a time series.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting future observations in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting future observations in latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting the future in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that maximizes mutual information between input signals and output features for non-intrusive speech intelligibility prediction.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that predicts future latent representations of a signal to learn robust features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning strategy that learns representations by separating adjacent and non-adjacent time intervals in time series data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning technique that extracts shared information between different parts of data to improve discriminative power.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning approach that extracts representations by predicting future samples in a latent space using a contrastive loss.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning framework that learns feature representations by predicting future parts of a signal from its current context.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning method that learns representations by predicting future observations in a latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised learning objective used to learn representations by predicting future parts of a signal.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An unsupervised pretraining algorithm that learns representations by predicting future observations in a sequence.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[learn representations by predicting future parts of a signal] representations by predicting future samples</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[useful representations by predicting future observations, representations by predicting future samples] representations by predicting future samples</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[shared information between different parts of data] shared information between different parts of data</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[long-term temporal structures] long-term temporal structures</rdfs:comment>
