    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that learns representations by predicting the future in a latent space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that maximizes mutual information between input signals and output features for non-intrusive speech intelligibility prediction.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning method that predicts future latent representations of a signal to learn robust features.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A self-supervised learning strategy that learns representations by separating adjacent and non-adjacent time intervals in time series data.</skos:definition>
