    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A software library and interface for the symbolic expression and execution of machine learning algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An open source software library used for defining, training, and deploying deep learning models.</rdfs:comment>
