    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process of discovering patterns and relationships within large datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process that discovers patterns and knowledge from large datasets.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational process that extracts patterns from large software asset datasets to determine asset ownership.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering hidden patterns and knowledge from large datasets using various computational methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large amounts of data using various techniques.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large datasets using a variety of machine learning and statistical techniques.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large datasets using classification, clustering, and association rule algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large datasets using statistical and machine learning techniques.</rdfs:comment>
