    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of extracting patterns and useful signals from large databases to identify adverse drug events.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that extracts patterns and useful information from large datasets, such as electronic documents.</rdfs:comment>
