    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large sets of raw data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The process of discovering patterns and knowledge from large sets of structured or unstructured data.</rdfs:comment>
