    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A deep learning framework for object detection that utilizes a region proposal network to localize objects within an image.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network that uses a region proposal network to efficiently detect objects in an image.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network used for object detection and localization in images.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network used for object detection that combines region proposal networks with fast classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A two-stage object detection framework that uses a region proposal network to identify potential object locations before classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A two-stage object detection framework that utilizes a region proposal network to identify bounding boxes for objects.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An object detection architecture that combines a region proposal network with classification networks to recognize fish species in underwater videos.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An object detection framework that uses a region proposal network to identify and localize objects within an image.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[object detection that combines region proposal networks with convolutional neural networks, object detection that combines region proposal networks with fast classification] object detection that combines region proposal networks with fast classification</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[object detection and localization in images] object detection and localization in images</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[fish species] fish species</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning architecture used for object detection that combines region proposal networks with convolutional neural networks.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning framework for object detection that uses a region proposal network to identify potential object locations.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A deep learning framework for object detection that utilizes a region proposal network to localize objects within an image.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network that uses a region proposal network to efficiently detect objects in an image.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network used for object detection and localization in images.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A region-based convolutional neural network used for object detection that combines region proposal networks with fast classification.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A two-stage object detection framework that uses a region proposal network to identify potential object locations before classification.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A two-stage object detection framework that utilizes a region proposal network to identify bounding boxes for objects.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An object detection architecture that combines a region proposal network with classification networks to recognize fish species in underwater videos.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An object detection framework that uses a region proposal network to identify and localize objects within an image.</skos:definition>
