    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Quantum Algorithm</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure designed to run on a quantum computer to estimate spectral sums of matrices more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure designed to run on a quantum computer to solve specific problems more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that leverages quantum mechanical phenomena to solve a problem more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that leverages quantum mechanical phenomena to solve mathematical problems more efficiently than classical algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that leverages quantum mechanical phenomena to solve optimization problems more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
