    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that leverages quantum mechanical properties to solve a problem.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that leverages quantum mechanical properties to solve machine learning problems more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure that utilizes quantum mechanical phenomena to find stationary points of a function more efficiently than classical methods.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A computational procedure utilizing quantum mechanical properties to achieve speed-ups in testing distributional properties.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A set of instructions designed to be executed on a quantum computer to solve a computational problem.</rdfs:comment>
