  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#distance_metric_learning">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Distance Metric Learning</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning process that discovers a distance function to measure the similarity between pairs of data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A learning process that optimizes a similarity function to improve classification accuracy.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns a distance function to ensure that similar objects are closer together in the embedding space than dissimilar ones.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns a distance function to measure the similarity between pairs of data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning branch that learns a distance function from data to improve the performance of similarity-based algorithms.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning process that learns transformations of data to better align with specified pairwise similarity and dissimilarity constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that aims to learn a distance function for measuring the similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that learns a distance function from labeled training samples to improve pattern recognition.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that learns a distance function to capture the similarity of spatial relations between objects.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that learns a distance function to measure the similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that learns a transformation of the data space to optimize the distance between pairs of points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning task that learns an optimal distance function to measure similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A machine learning technique that learns a distance function to better represent the similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology for learning a similarity measure between data points based on provided constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that learns a distance function to better group similar data points in a feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that learns a function to compute the similarity between data points, often by integrating multiple features into a shared latent space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A methodology that learns an optimal distance function to better separate or cluster patterns in a feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of learning a distance function that better reflects the similarity of data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process of learning a distance function that optimizes the similarity between data points for specific tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A process that learns a specialized similarity measure to better characterize the relationship between data points in high-dimensional spaces.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning process that learns a distance function to better represent the similarity between data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning task that learns a distance function from labeled pairs of similar and dissimilar data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A supervised learning task that learns a distance function to measure the similarity between pairs of data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A task of learning a distance function that allows the similarity between two data points to be measured effectively.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for learning a dissimilarity function to improve the accuracy of k-nearest neighbor classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for learning a distance function that captures the similarity between pairs of data points.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique for learning a distance function that optimizes the similarity between data points for tasks like k-NN classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that learns a transformation of the representation space so that distances correspond to a predefined notion of similarity.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A technique that optimizes the distance function used to measure similarity between data points for improved clustering or classification.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[measure similarity between data points for improved clustering or classification] measure similarity between data points for improved clustering or classification</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[transformations of data, transformation of the data space] transformation of data</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A learning process that discovers a distance function to measure the similarity between pairs of data points.</skos:definition>
