  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#tensor_factorization">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tensor Factorization</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A compression technique that reshapes and factorizes convolutional kernels to reduce the computational and memory complexity of neural networks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that breaks a multi-dimensional array into a sum of rank-one tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that breaks a multi-way array into a set of simpler low-rank components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that breaks down a high-order array into a sum of simpler components to uncover latent features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that factors a multi-dimensional array into a set of lower-dimensional components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method that represents high-dimensional data as a product of lower-rank tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A decomposition method used for knowledge graph completion by representing entities and relations as tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a high-order tensor into a sum of simpler rank-one tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-dimensional array into a set of lower-dimensional components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-dimensional array into a set of lower-rank components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-dimensional array into a set of simpler components while preserving structural constraints.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-dimensional array into smaller factors to extract latent patterns.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-way array into a set of constituent factors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes a multi-way array into a sum of simpler component tensors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction method that decomposes high-order tensors into a set of lower-order components to model multi-aspect preferences.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique for multi-modal data that decomposes a tensor into a set of lower-dimensional components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that decomposes a high-dimensional tensor into a set of lower-dimensional components to capture latent structures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that decomposes a high-order tensor into a set of lower-order components.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A dimensionality reduction technique that decomposes a high-order tensor into a sum of simpler components for knowledge graph completion.</rdfs:comment>
