    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method for estimating the parameters of a model by maximizing the probability that the model produced the observed data.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method for estimating the parameters of a probability distribution by maximizing a likelihood function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method for estimating the parameters of a probability distribution that make the observed data most probable.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method that determines the parameters of a probability distribution by maximizing the likelihood of the observed data.</rdfs:comment>
