    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to estimate the parameters of a neuron system model by maximizing the likelihood of observed spike trains.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A statistical method used to estimate the parameters of a probabilistic model by maximizing the likelihood of the observed data.</rdfs:comment>
