    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns discrete, high-dimensional representations of visual data without the need for labels.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns semantic features from unlabeled data by mapping different modalities to a shared latent space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning approach that learns useful features from unlabeled data without the need for explicit target labels.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A machine learning paradigm that extracts meaningful features from unlabeled data without explicit guidance.</skos:definition>
