    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A method of learning graph-level representations by maximizing mutual information between different scales of substructures.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A method of learning meaningful data embeddings without the use of manually labeled target outputs.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A method of learning meaningful data features from unlabeled data by exploiting consistency across different views.</skos:definition>
