    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based classification algorithm that adapts representative vectors to categorize data in non-stationary environments.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based classification algorithm that iteratively adjusts codevectors to define decision boundaries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based classification algorithm that iteratively adjusts representative vectors to define decision boundaries.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised clustering method used to represent data through a set of code vectors.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm that classifies data by adapting a set of codevectors in the feature space.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm that classifies data by associating it with the nearest representative vector.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm that classifies input vectors by assigning them to the nearest representative prototype.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm that represents classes using a set of codevector neurons.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm used for classification and evaluated for its robustness against adversarial attacks.</rdfs:comment>
