    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm used for classifying galaxy catalogues based on morphological and physical features.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm used for creating interpretable decision boundaries in classification tasks.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A prototype-based supervised learning algorithm used to represent data using a small set of distinguishable vectors.</rdfs:comment>
