    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[milp encodings] milp encodings</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[all possible states a system can reach] all possible states a system can reach</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[whether a neural network can produce a specific arbitrary output] whether a neural network can produce a specific arbitrary output</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A formal method used to determine the set of all possible states a system can reach from an initial set of conditions.</skos:definition>
