  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://linqubit.co/ontology/ml_concepts#evolutionary_computation">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Evolutionary Computation</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms for global optimization inspired by biological evolution.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms for optimization and search inspired by biological evolution, often used to automate the design of neural network architectures.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms for optimization and search inspired by biological evolution, used here to automatically program computer models.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms inspired by biological evolution that uses mechanisms such as mutation and selection to optimize a given objective function.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms inspired by biological evolution used to optimize complex AI systems like AlphaStar.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms inspired by biological evolution used to optimize complex functions or policies.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms inspired by biological evolution used to optimize network architectures and hyperparameters automatically.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of algorithms inspired by biological evolution used to solve optimization and search problems.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of optimization algorithms inspired by biological evolution that use mechanisms such as mutation and selection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of optimization algorithms inspired by biological evolution used to automate architecture tuning.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A family of population-based search algorithms inspired by biological evolution to optimize complex functions.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A population-based search technique that finds creative solutions to complex problems through iterative mutation and selection.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[automate the design of neural network architectures] automate the design of neural network architectures</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[mechanisms such as mutation and selection] mutation and selection</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimize complex ai systems like alphastar] optimize complex ai systems like alphastar</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimize complex functions or policies] optimize complex functions or policies</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">[optimize network architectures and hyperparameters automatically] optimize network architectures and hyperparameters automatically</rdfs:comment>
