    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A fairness criterion that requires a model's prediction to remain unchanged if a sensitive attribute of an individual were different.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A fairness framework that uses causal graphs to ensure a model's prediction remains the same in a counterfactual world where a protected attribute is changed.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A fairness metric that evaluates whether a model's prediction would remain the same if a sensitive attribute of an individual were changed.</rdfs:comment>
