    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A methodology that uses gradient-based optimization to automatically discover the optimal structure of a neural network.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A neural architecture search method that optimizes the network structure using gradient-based optimization on a continuous relaxation of the search space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A neural architecture search method that uses a differentiable relaxation to optimize the network structure.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A neural architecture search method that uses continuous relaxation of the search space to identify optimal network structures.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A neural architecture search method that uses continuous relaxation to optimize the network structure via gradient descent.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An AutoML technique that optimizes a neural network's structure by treating the architecture parameters as continuous variables.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An algorithm for neural architecture search that optimizes the network structure using gradient-based methods.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated machine learning method that optimizes the network structure by treating the architecture as a continuous differentiable variable.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated method for designing neural network architectures by optimizing a continuous relaxation of the search space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated method for discovering optimal neural network topologies by optimizing architecture parameters via gradient descent.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated method for finding optimal neural network structures using gradient-based optimization.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated method for finding the optimal neural network structure by optimizing a continuous relaxation of the architecture space.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated method for optimizing neural network structures by treating the architecture search space as a continuous optimization problem.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated process for designing neural network architectures by optimizing the structure using gradient descent.</skos:definition>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An automated process that optimizes the structure of a neural network using gradient-based methods.</skos:definition>
